"supervisordesc_tony","*The standard Nubby experience!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_octopus","*Squids are {b}x more likely to appear in Nubby-Mart.{a}*Squids cost {c}% less.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_tonyjr","*Start the game with {b} coins.{a}*You will enter Nubby-Mart when the game starts.{a}*Rare and ultra rare items are twice as likely to appear in shops.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_goblin","*You receive +3 coins per restock instead of 1.{a}*Maximum coins limit is raised to {b}.{a}*You lose two lives when you launch Nubby.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_mutant","*Items have two trigger types.{a}*For example, an item could trigger when the round goal is passed OR when Nubby dies.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_glass","*Maximum lives capped at {b}.{a}*When an item triggers, it triggers twice.{a}*Perks and food items are unaffected.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_hunter","*Adds a moving target to the bottom of the pegboard.{a}*If Nubby hits the target, gain +{b} coins AND double total score.{a}*You cannot gain coins from restocks.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_balogna","*Item and perk triggers are randomized at the start of the run. Don't question it.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_criminal","*Black market items can appear in Nubby-Mart and mystery capsules. Black market items cost money in Nubby-Mart.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_ceo","*Start game with {b} coins.{a}*You cannot gain more coins.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_immortal","*Replaces endless mode with prestige mode.{a}*When you win, you can prestige.{a}*This restarts the game and increases the difficulty for each prestige level.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"supervisordesc_dwarf","*Every round, spawns helpful {b}Gem Pegs{b} and hurtful {b}Rock Pegs{b}.{a}*These pegs become very chaotic as the game progresses.{a}*No special events or bosses, except for the final boss.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

