"item_desc170","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +2 cafe nubby rerolls.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc171","[#ffffff]{a}*Creates an upgraded squid in the right-most empty item slot in your inventory.{a}*If you have no empty item slots, this does nothing.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc172","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits an anti-particle that halves the first peg it hits.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc173","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped was NOT the highest # peg, {b} random pegs become 1-pegs.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc174","[#ffffff]{a}*Destroys [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc175","[#ffffff]{a}*If the round goal has been passed more than once, this kills nubby. (This is an extremely painful death for him)","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc176","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc177","[#ffffff]{a}*Disables the left-most non-disabled item, besides itself. (Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.)","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc178","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons an eggsac.{a}*Eggsacs bounce and pop pegs like Nubby.{a}*Pegs popped by eggsacs give NO points!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc179","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc180","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the upgraded version of the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc181","[#ffffff]{a}*A giant finger appears over the first peg popped's column.{a}*All pegs in this column subtract points equal to their #.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
