"peg_desc1","[#ffffcc]*This peg will give +{a} coin when popped for the first time.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc2","[#ffe6e6]*This peg can only be popped once it's stone layer has been popped {a} times.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc3","[#ffffcc]*When popped for the first time, this peg will trigger a mega explosion that pops all pegs once.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc4","[#ffffcc]*This peg will pop the highest # peg when popped. (will not pop itself)","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc5","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will subtract points instead of adding points when popped.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc6","[#ffffcc]*This peg will force-trigger the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{a} [#ffffcc]when popped.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc7","[#ffffcc]*This peg will multiply your total points by {a}x when popped for the first time.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc8","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will break after it has been popped for the first time.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc9","[#ffffcc]*This peg will explode and pop {a} pegs in a cross-pattern when popped for the first time.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc10","[#ffffcc]*When popped for the first time, all other pegs will be doubled ({a}% chance) OR halved ({b}% chance)","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc11","[#ffffcc]*This peg will multiply your total points by {a}x when fully popped.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc12","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will kill nubby and end the round when fully popped.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",	
"peg_desc13","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will disable a random item when fully popped.{a}*Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"peg_desc14","[#ffffcc]*This peg gives points twice when popped.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

"peg_desc15","[#ffffcc]*No description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"peg_desc16","[#ffffcc]*All psychic pegs will give points equal to their # when any psychic peg is popped.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc17","[#ffffcc]*When popped, this peg will emit 2 {b}snot-shots{b} that pop any pegs they pass through.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc18","[#ffe6e6]*When popped, all pegs will copy this peg's #.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc19","[#ffe6e6]*When fully popped, the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #2[#ffe6e6] will be sold.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc20","[#ffffcc]*When popped, it counts as a [#ffd500]{a}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{a} [#ffffcc] trigger.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc21","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, gain +x coins, equal to the round number.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc22","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, increase total coins by +{a}%.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc23","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, if nubby is still alive, duplicates nubby.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc24","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles {a} random pegs.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc25","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers all perks once.{a}*If no perks exist, force triggers all items once.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc26","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, gives a non-temporary random common item from nubby mart in the first empty inventory slot.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc27","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, two copies of every summon in the game are summoned.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc28","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles all pegs twice, lose {a}% of total points.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc29","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, a random item in your inventory that summons anything force triggers {a} times.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc30","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers item in slot {a}, {b} times.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc31","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers item in slot {b}, {c} times.{a}*Can force trigger corrupted items.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc32","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers all items {a} times.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc33","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles the highest # peg {a} times.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc34","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles all pegs {a} times.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc35","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, all items temporarily turn into random upgraded ultra-rare items.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc36","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, summons {a} crazy straw summons.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc37","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, multiplies total points by {a}x.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc38","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, sets total points to {a}.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc39","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, temporarily disables items in slots {a},{b}, and {c}.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc40","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, lose {a} coins.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc41","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, temporarily randomizes all items in your inventory.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc42","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, {a} random pegs become 1-pegs.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"peg_desc43","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, halves all pegs.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

