"tut1","Hey. You must be the new employee they were telling me about.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut2","My name is Tony and I'm gonna be your supervisor.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut3","My job is to show you how to run the factory.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",	
"tut4","I don't really care about your name or anything so let's just get into this.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut5","First things first, welcome aboard to Nubby's Number Factory - the world's leading number manufacturer!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut6","This is the main control center of the factory.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut7","Your first task is to launch our mascot, Nubby, down the peg board.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut8","Hold down [{a}] and press [{b}] to launch Nubby.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut9","Wow, you're really good at this.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut10","At this factory, your only job is to make big numbers...","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut11","By launching Nubby at these pegs, you will earn however many points are shown on the peg.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut12","This number shows how many points you made in a round.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut13","The number on the bottom is the goal. If you beat the goal, the board will restock.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut14","If you get a REALLY high score, the board can restock multiple times in a single round.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut15","Oh wait.. I forgot to tell you what a restock even is!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut16","Well listen up, because restocks are an important thing!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut17","When the board restocks, a bunch of NEW pegs will fall from the sky and fill all your empty spaces.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut18","Soon after, pairs of pegs with the same number will merge into one greater peg.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut19","Let's try it out. Keep launching Nubby until you beat the goal.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut20","You can do better than that. Do it again.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut21","Pegtacular! That was pegalicious! You're a star!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut22","Just kidding, no you're not.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",	
"tut23","Ok. We're almost done. To rearrange your new pegs, press the jumble button.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut24","Nice. Launch Nubby one more time [{a}] + [{b}]. I wanna show you something.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut25","So you might have noticed that Nubby goes through some pegs, but not others.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut26","Nubby will break through 1's, but will bounce off any peg greater than 1.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut27","Alright bud, that's it for the tutorial. You'll figure the rest out for yourself.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut28","OH! WAIT! WAIT! I FORGOT ONE THING!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut29","Everytime you launch Nubby, you lose one life. If you run out of lives, the sun will explode.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut30","But luckily, everytime the board restocks, you get one life back.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",		
"tut31","So as long as you keep making big numbers, nobody gets hurt.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"tut32","Ok now I'm done. Thanks for not pressing the {a}skip tutorial{a} button. I know that was difficult for you.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",	
"tut33","I'll start you off with a fresh, new factory now. Good luck.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

