"challenge_desc_0","*Items in shops are replaced by various mystery boxes.{a}*Mystery boxes give a random item when purchased.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_1","*You can jumble pegs once PER GAME.{a}*Rerolling items in shops is disabled.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_2","*Maximum coins are capped at 10.{a}*Items that cost more than 10 coins have reduced prices.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_3","*Rare items, foods, and perks cannot be found.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_4","*Items will be deleted 15 rounds after they were obtained.{a}*Upgrading items will reset their expiration date.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_5","*During restocks, you can only gain +1 life at most - even if you restocked more than once.{a}*You cannot gain lives using any alternative method.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_6","*Failure to meet the quota on any round will result in the left-most item being deleted.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_7","*A C-4 is strapped to Nubby.{a}*Nubby will explode and die after 1.5 seconds, causing a big explosion that pops pegs.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_8","*Perks cannot be obtained.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_9","*If you start a round with more than 1 item in your inventory, all items will be disabled for the rest of the round.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"challenge_desc_10","*Collect all 5 letters (N.U.B.B.Y.) by completing trials.{a}*You must beat round 80 to complete.{a}*Difficulty: {b}","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

"NubbyTrialsAllLocked","Beat at least 5 challenges to unlock!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

