"NubbySkinDesc0","Nubby's classic look!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc1","This frog nubby was sent to us in the mail one day. We have no idea why this frog resembles nubby.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc2","An endangered subspecies of nubbies, scientifically known as Nubbicus Aquaticus.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc3","A failed experiment, resulting from the factory's past attempts to tap into the cheese industry.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc4","This nubby stole factory money to follow his dreams at clown college.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc5","This nubby made his own cosplay and thinks he has cyborg strength. Just let the poor guy have a dream...","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc6","This nubby is also a parasite in the metaphorical sense too. If he asks, don't lend him any money.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc7","In the nubby manufacturing process, things like this happen by accident sometimes.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc8","This nubby finds joy in Victorian Era live action roleplay. He's not hurting anyone so we let it happen.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc9","We keep this nubby around to celebrate employee birthdays. He's also super good at playing kazoo.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc10","Just for kicks, we sometimes make nubbies that can feel emotion. They all end up forming punk bands.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc11","The result of our attempts at making self replicating nubbies to save money.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc12","Despite his appearance, this nubby is very mature and sophisticated if you get to know him.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc13","Back when the number factory had a petting zoo, this nubby was super popular. Of course, that was before the incident...","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc14","One of the very first nubbies we cloned. Made way before we discovered their number harvesting capabilities.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc15","Tony thinks it's really funny to brainwash nubbies into thinking he's god.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc16","The PR team requested a {b}wholesome{b} nubby mascot to slap on all of our advertising and merch to overshadow our non-wholesome practices.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc17","One year we dressed this nubby up as a butterfly for Halloween. Now we have to leave the costume on him because he'll try to bite you if you get near him.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc18","This is just a souvenir that we sell to tourists at the number factory gift shop.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc19","This Nubby is an official star-employee at the number factory... Just like you!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc20","This Nubby angered the car wizard and as punishment he was turned into a car. Despite his curse, he remains joyous.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","This skin is a mystery...","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","Who knows what this could be...","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","Oooh a mystery nubby...","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

