"ItemSkinDesc0","Transform your seals into dapper gentlemen.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc1","Turn your all-seeing pyramids into poorly drawn ancient artifacts.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc2","Turn your fake plastic trees into fake plastic trees.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc3","Turn your kidney beans into kidneys, minus the beans.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc4","Turn your e-blocks into hardened, stone-faced soldiers.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc5","Turn your avocados into your friends!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc6","Turn your jeans into jorts!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc7","Make your ton of feathers way heavier.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc8","Turn your donut into a drawing of a donut.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc9","Fill your mushrooms with compacted C4.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc10","Replace your normal noodles with shorter, tubular noodles that are bent.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc11","Give your mannequin head some style, and a personality too!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc12","Turn your mollusk into an extinct mollusk.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc13","Turn your pedro into pedroooooooooooooooo.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc14","Turn your clay man into a clay man, except this time he's actually made out of clay.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc15","Give poopbutt a timeout in the magic microwave.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc16","Release your sea cucumbers into the wild, and then make a handcrafted charm to honor their legacy.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc17","Turn your fish into a fish on a wall!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc18","Turn your squids into the best American carnival food!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","A mystery item skin.. what is it?","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","How mysterious...","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","I wonder what it is...","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating the game at least once with every supervisor.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by reaching round 300 in endless mode on any supervisor.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating all challenges, including all nubby trials levels.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

"warehouse_tutorial0","Greetings! The name's Sparkplug.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial1","You've entered my realm... the warehouse!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial2","I'm the manager here, sort of. It's complicated...","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial3","Anyways, who cares, am I right? I'm gonna show you around real quick.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial4","Here we are! The warehouse is where you buy and activate cosmetic nubby skins and item skins.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial5","We're currently looking at the nubby skins menu. Press the item skins button to view the item skins menu.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial6","This is the menu for buying and activating item skins, but we're going to focus on nubby skins for now.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial7","Go back to the nubby skins menu by pressing the nubby skins button.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial8","Use the arrows to page through my collection of cosmetics! Click the arrows a couple times and we'll move on.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial9","Good job! Here's 10 free stars as a reward for being so obedient!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial10","Now, find a nubby skin you can afford and buy it.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial11","Nice. Now hit the green button below to activate it.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial12","You can only activate one nubby skin at a time, but you can activate multiple item skins at once.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial13","Other than that, nubby skins and item skins work the same way.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial14","Ok. That's pretty much all I have left to say I think.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial15","You're probably smart and you can figure the rest out for yourself.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial16","I'm not gonna go away though because I don't trust you.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial17","By the way, did I mention that I'm also the official number factory historian?","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"warehouse_tutorial18","If you poke me, I'll tell you a random fact about the number factory. Anyways, have fun!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome1","Yeah, sure. Feel free to barge in unannounced.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome2","Welcome in! You need to learn to knock, though.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome3","Welcome back! I totally wasn't in the middle of something.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",

"SparkplugRandomDialogue0","Nubbies are a species of genetically modified human. They also have DNA from over 300 random mammals, fish, and reptiles.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue1","There is no singular nubby. Rather, nubbies are genetically cloned right here at the factory. It's the way we've always done it.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue2","Not counting the incubation phase of nubby production, the average nubby life span is 6 seconds.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue3","The nubby production process is a highly guarded secret, we're the only number factory to own the nubby patent.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue4","Other companies in the number industry try to produce numbers ethically without using nubbies. No other company is as successful as us.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue5","We produce numbers for the whole world to use in their math problems, computations, and calculations. Without numbers, the laws of physics cease to exist.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue6","Years ago, I was hired to help remove asbestos from the warehouse. The other employees mistakenly thought I was a manager here, so I just rolled with it and here we are.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue7","The factory pays me based on how many hours I spend in the warehouse, so I moved in and I haven't left in years.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue8","Sometimes Tony and I listen to music and drive the forklift around to kill time. He's a nice guy once you get to know him.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue9","Nobody's met the boss of the number factory. Nobody knows if there even is one. You could fire Tony and he couldn't do anything about it.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue10","A while ago, Tony covered a bunch of nubbies in paint and threw them at my wall. He's a great artist!","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue11","We don't even store anything in the warehouse. My only job is to explain what the warehouse is to new employees and drive the forklift.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue12","Here at the factory, we don't produce our number pegs - we buy them from the peg factory. they won't tell us what they're made of, so it can't be good.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue13","We protect nubbies from themselves and from our rival companies. If they leave the factory grounds, they self destruct.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue14","Nubbies usually can't feel emotion, but they all have their own unique personality.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue15","If nubbies are kept alive for too long, they slowly turn into cubes. We don't know why.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue16","Tony and I go way back. I don't know if he's shy or something but I've known him for over a decade and I've never seen him take the glasses off.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue17","You should really wear a gas mask in here. There's still tons of asbestos everywhere.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue18","Nubbies are the only known creature that can harvest numbers. Their bodies have the exact shape and texture required to harvest numbers.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue19","I've overheard talks about the number factory getting into letter production as well. Who knows... letters are in high demand these days.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue20","You didn't hear this from me, but I've heard that nubbies taste like grape candy.","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",













"credit_main","Nubby's Number Factory{a}{a}A game by {b}.{a}{a}{a}Soundtrack by {c}{a}{a}{a}{a}","Nubby's Number Factory {a}{a} Um jogo de {b}. {a}{a}{a}Trilha sonora por {c}{a}{a}{a}{a}",

