"classicmode_description","Classic Mode:{a}------{a}*Achievements enabled.{a}*Random game seed.","Mode Clàssic:{a}------{a}*Assoliments activats.{a}*Seed aleatòria.",

"abortround_btn","End!","Acabar!",

"txt_supervisor","Choose your supervisor!","Escull el teu supervisor!",

"unlock_supervisor_button","Unlock:","Desbloqueja:",

"supervisorname_tony","Tony","Toni",
"supervisorname_octopus","Octo-ny","Pop Toni",
"supervisorname_tonyjr","Tony Jr.","Toni Jr.",
"supervisorname_goblin","Goblony","Gobloni",
"supervisorname_mutant","Mutant Tony","Toni el mutant",
"supervisorname_glass","Glass Tony","Toni de vidre",
"supervisorname_hunter","Hunter Tony","Toni el caçador",
"supervisorname_balogna","Balogna Tony","Chopped Toni",
"supervisorname_criminal","Criminal Tony","Toni el criminal",
"supervisorname_ceo","C.E.O. Tony","Direc-Toni General",
"supervisorname_immortal","Immortal Tony","Toni immortal",
"supervisorname_dwarf","Dwarf Tony","Toni el nan",

"supervisordesc_tony","*The standard Nubby experience!","L'experiència estàndard d'en Nubby!",
"supervisordesc_octopus","*Squids are {b}x more likely to appear in Nubby-Mart.{a}*Squids cost {c}% less.","*Els calamars apareixen {b} cops més freqüentment al Nubbymercat.{a}*Els calamars costen {c}% menys.",
"supervisordesc_tonyjr","*Start the game with {b} coins.{a}*You will enter Nubby-Mart when the game starts.{a}*Rare and ultra rare items are twice as likely to appear in shops.","*Comences la partida amb {b} monedes.{a}*Apareixes al Nubbymercat quan comences la partida.{a}*Els objectes rars i ultrarars tenen el doble de probabilitat d'aparèixer.",
"supervisordesc_goblin","*You receive +3 coins per restock instead of 1.{a}*Maximum coins limit is raised to {b}.{a}*You lose two lives when you launch Nubby.","*Reps 3 monedes per reabastiment en lloc de 1.{a}*El màxim de monedes que pots tenir puja a {b}.{a}*Perds dues vides quan llences Nubby.",
"supervisordesc_mutant","*Items have two trigger types.{a}*For example, an item could trigger when the round goal is passed OR when Nubby dies.","*Els objectes poden activar-se de dues maneres.{a}*Per exemple, un objecte podria activar-se quan l'objectiu de ronda ha estat assolit o quan Nubby mor.",
"supervisordesc_glass","*Maximum lives capped at {b}.{a}*When an item triggers, it triggers twice.{a}*Perks and food items are unaffected.","*Pots tenir {b} vides com a màxim.{a}*Quan s'activa un objecte, s'activa dos cops.{a}*No afecta als avantatges i els aliments.",
"supervisordesc_hunter","*Adds a moving target to the bottom of the pegboard.{a}*If Nubby hits the target, gain +{b} coins AND double total score.{a}*You cannot gain coins from reabastiment.","*Afegeix un blanc al fons de la taula.{a}*Si Nubby encerta el blanc, guanya {b} monedes i duplica la puntuació.{a}*No guanyes monedes amb els reabastiments.",
"supervisordesc_balogna","*Item and perk triggers are randomized at the start of the run. Don't question it.","L'activació d'objectes i avantatges es genera aleatòriament al inici de la partida. No preguntis.",
"supervisordesc_criminal","*Black market items can appear in Nubby-Mart and mystery capsules. Black market items cost money in Nubby-Mart.","*Els objectes del mercat negre poden aparèixer al Nubbymercat i a càpsules misteri. Els objectes del mercat negre costen diners al Nubbymercat.",
"supervisordesc_ceo","*Start game with {b} coins.{a}*You cannot gain more coins.","*Comences la partida amb {b} monedes.{a}*No pots guanyar més monedes.",
"supervisordesc_immortal","*Replaces endless mode with prestige mode.{a}*When you win, you can prestige.{a}*This restarts the game and increases the difficulty for each prestige level.","*Reemplaça el mode infinit amb el mode prestigi.{a}*Quan guanyes, pots prestigiar.{a}*Això reinicia la partida i augmenta la dificultat amb cada nivell de prestigi.",
"supervisordesc_dwarf","*Every round, spawns helpful {b}Gem Pegs{b} and hurtful {b}Rock Pegs{b}.{a}*These pegs become very chaotic as the game progresses.{a}*No special events or bosses, except for the final boss.","*Cada ronda apareixen {b}Gemmes{b} que t'ajuden i {b}Roques{b} que et perjudiquen.{a}*Aquestes boles es tornen més caòtiques a mesura que el joc progressa.{a}*Sense esdeveniments especials o bosses, excepte el boss final.",

"txt_nametag","Hello! My name is:","Hola! Em dic:",

"svbtn_go","GO!","SOM-HI!",

"customseed_warning","Warning: Using a custom seed disables achievements,stars, and unlocks.","Atenció: Fer servir una seed desactiva assoliments, estrelles i desbloquejos.",
                      
