"null","[#ffd500]Error: null","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc0","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fan esclatar una bola aleatòria. Quan aquesta bola esclata, dóna punts dos cops.",		
"item_desc1","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita l'efecte de l'aliment consumit més recentment{a}*Imitarà: {c}{b}{c}. {d}",		
"item_desc2","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quill that falls from the sky and pops {c} peg.","[#ffffff]{a}Invoca {b} punxa que cau del cel i fa esclatar {c} bola.",		
"item_desc3","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una bola aleatòria reventa i fa esclatar {b} (màxim) boles properes.",		
"item_desc4","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada objecte al teu inventari dóna punts equivalents al valor d'una bola aleatòria.",		
"item_desc5","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}meat-orb{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si en Nubby és viu encara, invoca una {b}esfera de carn{b} que flota i fa esclatar boles.{a}*Les esferes de carn moren quan en Nubby mor.",		
"item_desc6","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} de cada {c} cops, TOTES les boles es dupliquen.",		
"item_desc7","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Maxes out at {b} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanyes +1 moneda per cada maduixa consumida durant aquesta partida.{a}*Pots obtenir un màxim de {b} monedes.",		
"item_desc8","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot shots{b} that pop any pegs they pass through.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una bola aleatòria llença {c} {b}mocs{b} que fan esclatar les boles que travessen.",		
"item_desc9","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca una palla que fa esclatar una bola.{a}*Les boles que esclaten per culpa de les palles donen +{b}% punts extra.{a}*Guanya +{c}% punts extra cada cop que has remenat les boles en aquesta partida.",		
"item_desc10","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to double the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Totes les boles donen punts equivalents a la bola amb puntuació més baixa.",		
"item_desc11","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tens una probabilitat de {b}% de causar una explosió gegant que fa esclatar totes les boles un cop.{a}*La probabilitat puja a {c}% si només et queda una vida.",		
"item_desc12","[#ffffff]{a}*Every empty peg space will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada espai buit al tauler et dóna tants punts com boles hagis fet esclatar durant aquesta ronda.",	
"item_desc13","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the right-most item in your inventory.{a}*Deletes the left-most item in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Millora l'objecte més a la dreta de l'inventari .{a}*Esborra l'objecte més a l'esquerra.",
"item_desc14","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa esclatar {b} bola aleatòria.",		
"item_desc15","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiplica els teus punts totals per {b}.",		
"item_desc16","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*En Nubby et dóna punts equivalents al número de cops que en Nubby hagi rebotat aquesta ronda.",		
"item_desc17","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sharp-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca un dard que fa esclatar una bola aleatòria.",		
"item_desc18","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Et dóna 1 {b}Avantatge Croissant{b}.",	
"item_desc19","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives a copy of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Et dóna una còpia de l'avantatge obtingut més recentment.{a}(Ara mateix {b})",		
"item_desc20","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an egg missile that falls from the sky and causes an explosion that pops a row of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si en Nubby és viu encara, invoca un ou misil que cau del cel, reventa i fa esclatar una filera de boles.",		
"item_desc21","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the lowest # peg twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa esclatar la bola amb menys punts dos cops.",	
"item_desc22","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{d}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de no fer res.{a}*{c}% de probabilitats de doblar una bola.{a}*{d}% de probabilitats de dividir una bola.",		
"item_desc23","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna {b} punts per cada cop que aquest objecte s'ha activat aquesta ronda.{a}*{c} de cada {d} cops, metamorfosa.",		
"item_desc24","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% probabilitats de crear una corrent elèctrica que fa esclatar un grup de boles.",		
"item_desc25","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}meat-orbs{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si en Nubby és viu encara, invoca {c} {b}esferes de carn{b} que floten arreu i fan esclatar boles.{a}*Les esferes de carn moren quan en Nubby mor.",
		
"item_desc26","[#ffffff]{a}*Test{b}","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
		
"item_desc27","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs will copy the # of the first peg popped.{a}*If this item is in slot #{c}, {d} pegs will be affected instead of {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} boles aleatòries copien el valor de la primera bola que esclata.{a}*Si aquest objecte és a l'espai {c}, afectarà a {d} boles enlloc de {b}.",
"item_desc28","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna {b} punts per cada cop que aquest objecte ha estat activat durant aquesta ronda.",		
"item_desc29","[#ffffff]{a}*Every peg will give points equal to {b}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada bola dóna punts equivalents al {b}% del seu valor.",		
"item_desc30","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles a random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dobla una bola aleatòria.",		
"item_desc31","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into the non-upgraded version of the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Es converteix en la versió bàsica de l'[#ffb3ff]OBJECTE IMMEDIATAMENT A L'ESQUERRA[#ffffff] durant la resta de la ronda.",		
"item_desc32","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a pulse that doubles pegs within close range.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una bola aleatòria emet una pulsació que dobla el valor d'algunes boles a prop.",	
"item_desc33","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emits a burst of nuclear waste.{a}*Nuclear waste pops any pegs it touches.{a}*If Nubby isn't alive, a random peg will emit the burst.","[#ffffff]{a}*En Nubby genera una ràfega de residus nuclears.{a}*Els residus nuclears fan esclatar les boles que toquen.{a}*Si en Nubby és mort, una bola aleatòria emet la ràfega en el seu lloc.",
"item_desc34","[#ffffff]{a}*Marks a random peg.{a}*When a peg is marked, all pegs that have the same number will be doubled.{a}*If no pegs have the same number as the marked peg, a random peg will be doubled.","[#ffffff]{a}*Marca una bola aleatòria.{a}*Quan una bola es marca, totes les boles amb el mateix valor es doblen.{a}*Si cap bola té el mateix valor, una bola aleatòria esclata.",		
"item_desc35","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs get smacked.{a}*When a peg is smacked, it counts as a {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg halved [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] trigger without actually halving it.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} boles aleatòries reben un cop.{a}*Quan una bola rep un cop, compta com una activació de {a}[#ffd500]{c}Bola dividida [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] sense haver de dividir-la.",		
"item_desc36","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for each remaining life.","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanyes 1 moneda per cada vida que tinguis.",	
"item_desc37","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles {c} random pegs whose # is less than {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dobla {c} boles aleatòries amb menys valor que {b}.",	
"item_desc38","[#ffffff]{a}*50% chance to double total coins.{a}*50% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*50% de probabilitats de doblar les monedes.{a}*50% de probabilitats de perdre-les totes.",
"item_desc39","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random common item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Muta en un objecte comú aleatori que no sigui al teu inventari durant la resta de la ronda.",
"item_desc40","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de doblar el valor d'una bola aleatòria.",
"item_desc41","[#ffffff]{a}*Halves the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times","[#ffffff]{a}*Divideix la bola amb més valor.{a}*Dobla el valor de la bola menys valiosa {b} cops.",
"item_desc42","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay balls.{a}*If a clay ball bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay balls die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca {b} boles d'argila.{a}*Si una bola d'argila rebota sobre una paret o una bola, activa [#ffd500]{d}en Nubby toca la paret [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff].{a}*Les boles d'argila moren desprès de {c} rebot.",
"item_desc43","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita els efectes el objecte (bàsic) a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#ffffff], tot mantenint la seva pròpia activació.",
"item_desc44","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanya {b} punts.{a}*Si ets al menys a la ronda {d}, en guanyes {c}.",
"item_desc45","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna 1 {b}Avantatge Kebab{b}",
"item_desc46","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa aparèixer un aliment rar aleatori.",
"item_desc47","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si la primera bola que esclata és la bola amb més valor, multiplica els teus punts per {b}.",
"item_desc48","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa esclatar {b} boles aleatòries.",
"item_desc49","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg becomes a copy of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*La bola amb menys valor es converteix en una còpia de la bola amb més valor.",
"item_desc50","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +1 reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Quan tornis al Nubbymercat, tindràs un reroll extra.",
"item_desc51","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Redueix l'objectiu de la ronda un {b}%.{a}*Divideix totes les boles.",
"item_desc52","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers an electron beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an electron beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Electron beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Crea un raig d'electrons que travessa vàries boles.{a}*Quan un raig colpeja una bola, aquesta dóna un {b}% del seu valor.{a}*Els raigs NO fan esclatar les boles.",
"item_desc53","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits a god ray.{a}*The god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Aquest objecte emet un raig diví.{a}*El raig diví fa esclatar ràpidament una bola aleatòria per cada cop que l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI 1 [#ffffff]s'ha activat durant aquesta ronda.",
"item_desc54","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa l'avantatge obtingut més recentment.{a}(Ara mateix {b})",
"item_desc55","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*La bola amb menys valor dóna punts equivalents a {b} cops el seu valor.{a}*Si aquest valor és inferior a {d} punts, en dóna {c}.",
"item_desc56","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca una pilota de platja que emet {b} ràfegues de confeti.{a}*Les boles esclatades pel confeti donen {c}% del seu valor.",

"item_desc57","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc58","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to a copy of himself.","[#ffffff]{a}*En Nubby genera una còpia d'ell mateix.",
"item_desc59","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de doblar la bola amb més valor.",
"item_desc60","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Emet un raig d'icor per cada {b} cops que en Nubby és mort durant la partida.{a}*Quan l'icor colpeja una bola, els objectes i avantatges amb [#ffd500]{c}"Arribes a l'objectiu de ronda"[spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] s'activen.{a}(Ara mateix emet {d})",
"item_desc61","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all items in your inventory... Good luck!","[#ffffff]{a}*Canvia els teus objectes per altres aleatoris... Apa, bona sort!",
"item_desc62","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Conté un objecte comú aleatori del Nubbymercat.",
"item_desc63","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Conté un objecte comú aleatori del mercat negre.",
"item_desc64","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common food item.","[#ffffff]*Conté un aliment comú aleatori.",
"item_desc65","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanyes {b} punts per cada cop que el tauler s'ha reabastit.{a}(Ara mateix {c} punts)",
"item_desc66","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una bola aleatòria emet una {b}Cosmoexplosió{b}.{a}*Quan una bola esclata per culpa d'una cosmoexplosió, compta com {c} esclats en lloc de 1.",
"item_desc67","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Quan aquest objecte es força, transmet l'activació forçada a l'[#ffb3ff]OBJECTE A LA MEVA ESQUERRA[#ffffff].{a}*{c}% de possibilitats de activar-lo 1 cop més.",
"item_desc68","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points four times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa esclatar una bola aleatòria. Quan aquesta bola esclata, dóna punts quatre cops.",

"item_desc69","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc70","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quills that fall from the sky and pop {c} peg each.{a}*10% chance to summon one additional quill (3 total).","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca {b} punxes que cauen del cel i fan esclatar {c} boles cadascú.{a}*10% de probabilitats d'invocar-ne una més (3 en total).",
"item_desc71","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una bola aleatòria explota i fa esclatar {b} (màxim) boles properes.",
"item_desc72","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to double the value of a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada objecte a l'inventari dóna punts equivalents al doble del valor d'una bola aleatòria.",
"item_desc73","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}disease-orb{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si en Nubby és viu encara, invoca una {b}esfera pestilent{b} que es mou flotant agressivament i fa esclatar boles.",
"item_desc74","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.{a}*{d} in {e} chance to double all pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} de cada {c} cops, dobles el valor de TOTES les boles.{a}*{d} de cada {e} cops, el dobles dos cops.",

"item_desc75","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc76","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot rockets{b} that pop any pegs they pass through twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una bola aleatòria emet {c} {b}coets de mocs{b} que fan esclatar dos cops les boles que travessen.",
"item_desc77","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*+Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca una palla que fa esclatar una bola.{a}*Les boles que esclatan per una palla donen {b}% del seu valor.{a}*Guanya {c}% per cada cop que has remenat boles durant la partida.",
"item_desc78","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to quadruple the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Totes les boles donen punts equivalents a quatre cops el valor de la bola menys valiosa.",
"item_desc79","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de provocar una explosió que fa esclatar totes les boles un cop.{a}*{c}% de probabilitats si només et queda una vida.",
"item_desc80","[#ffffff]{a}*ALL peg spaces will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*TOTS els espais del tauler donen punts equivalents al número de boles que han esclatat durant la ronda.",
"item_desc81","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items in your inventory.{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa que l'activació dels teus objectes sigui aleatòria.{a}*NO HI HA MARXA ENRERE.",
"item_desc82","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa esclatar {b} boles aleatòries.",
"item_desc83","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiplica els teus punts totals per {b}.",
"item_desc84","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to double the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*En Nubby dóna 2 punts per cada cop que hagi rebotat durant aquesta ronda.",
"item_desc85","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sharp-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca un tret precís que fa esclatar una bola aleatòria {b} cops.",

"item_desc86","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc87","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc88","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an ostrich-egg missile that falls from the sky an causes an explosion that pops 1 row and 1 column of pegs.","*Si en Nubby és viu encara, invoca un ou d'estruç que cau del cel, explota i fa esclatar una fila i una columna de boles.",
"item_desc89","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the two lowest # pegs, twice each.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa esclatar les dues boles amb menys valor, dos cops cadascuna.",
"item_desc90","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{d}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de no fer res.{a}*{c}% de probabilitats de doblar una bola.{a}*{d}% de probabilitats de dividir una bola.",
"item_desc91","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna {b} punts per cada cop que aquest objecte s'ha activat.{a}*{c} de cada {d} cops, metamorfosa.",
"item_desc92","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a high-voltage chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de crear una corrent elèctrica d'alt voltatge que fa esclatar un grup de boles dos cops.",
"item_desc93","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}disease-orbs{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si en Nubby és viu encara, invoca {c} {b}esferes pestilents{b} que es moven flotant agressivament i fan esclatar boles.{a}*Les esferes pestilents moren quan en Nubby mor.",

"item_desc94","[[#ffffff]{a}*Test{b}","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc95","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs will copy the # of the first peg popped.{a}*If this item is in slot #{c}, {d} pegs will be affected instead of {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} boles aleatòries copien el valor de la primera bola que esclata.{a}*Si aquest item és al espai {c}, {d} boles el copien en lloc de {b}.",
"item_desc96","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna {b} punts per cada cop que aquest objecte s'ha activat durant la ronda.",
"item_desc97","[#ffffff]{a}*Every peg will give points equal to {b}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada bola dóna punts equivalents al {b}% del seu valor.",
"item_desc98","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles a random peg twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Duplica una bola aleatòria dos cops.",
"item_desc99","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into the upgraded version of the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME [#ffffff] for the rest of the round","[#ffffff]{a}*Muta en la versió millorada de l'[#ffb3ff]OBJECTE A LA MEVA ESQUERRA [#ffffff]durant la resta de la ronda.",
"item_desc100","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a super pulse that doubles pegs within close range twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una bola aleatòria emet una superpulsació que dobla les boles properes dos cops.",
"item_desc101","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emits a burst of bouncy {b}unstable waste{b}.{a}*Unstable waste bounces and pops any pegs it touches.{a}*If Nubby isn't alive, a random peg will emit the burst.","[#ffffff]{a}*En Nubby emet una ràfega de {b}residus inestables{b}.{a}*Els residus inestables reboten i fan esclatar qualsevol bola que toquen.{a}*Si en Nubby és mort, una bola aleatòria emet la ràfega.",
"item_desc102","[#ffffff]{a}*Marks a random peg.{a}*When a peg is marked, all pegs that have the same number will be doubled twice.{a}*If no pegs have the same number as the marked peg, a random peg will be doubled twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Marca una bola aleatòria.{a}*Quan es marca una bola, totes les boles amb el mateix valor es doblen dos cops.{a}*Si no hi han boles amb el mateix valor, una bola aleatòria es dobla dos cops.",
"item_desc103","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs get smacked twice.{a}*When a peg is smacked, it counts as a {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg halved [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] trigger without actually halving it.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} boles aleatòries reben dos cops.{a}*Quan una bola rep un cop, compta com una activació de {a}[#ffd500]{c}Bola dividida [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] sense haver de dividir-la.",

"item_desc104","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc105","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles {c} random pegs whose # is less than {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dobla {c} boles aleatòries amb menys de {b} de valor.",

"item_desc106","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc107","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random rare or ultra-rare item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Muta en un objecte rar o ultrarar que no sigui al teu inventari durant la resta de la ronda.",
"item_desc108","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de duplicar una bola aleatòria.",
"item_desc109","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% chance to halve the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% de probabilitats de dividir la bola més valiosa.{a}*Dobla la bola menys valiosa {b} cops.",
"item_desc110","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay prisms.{a}*If a clay prism bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay prisms die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca {b} prismes d'argila.{a}*Si un prisma d'argila rebota en una paret o en una bola, compta com [#ffd500]{d}en Nubby toca la paret[spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff].{a}*Els prismes d'argila moren després de {c} rebots.",
"item_desc111","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita l'efecte millorat de l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#ffffff], tot mantenint la seva pròpia activació.",
"item_desc112","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanya {b} punts.{a}*Si ets a la ronda {d} o ja l'has passada, en guanyes {c}.",

"item_desc113","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc114","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc115","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si la primera bola que esclata n'és la més valiosa, multiplica la teva puntuació per {b}.",
"item_desc116","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs, twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa esclatar {b} boles aleatòries, dos cops.",
"item_desc117","[#ffffff]{a}*The two lowest # pegs become copies of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Les dues boles amb menys valor es converteixen en còpies de la bola més valiosa.",

"item_desc118","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc119","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Redueix l'objectiu de la ronda en un {b}%.{a}*Divideix totes les boles.",
"item_desc120","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers a hyper-beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an hyper-beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Hyper-beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Genera un hiperraig que travessa boles.{a}*Quan un hiperraig travessa una bola, aquesta dóna {b}% del seu valor.{a}*Els hiperraigs no fan esclatar boles.",
"item_desc121","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits two god rays.{a}*Each god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Aquest objecte emet dos raigs divins.{a}*Cada raig diví fa esclatar una bola aleatòria per cada cop que l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI 1 [#ffffff]s'ha activat durant aquesta ronda.",
"item_desc122","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk twice.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa l'avantatge rebut més recentment dos cops.{a}(Ara mateix {b})",
"item_desc123","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*La bola amb menys valor dóna punts equivalents a {b} cops el seu valor.{a}*Si aquest valor és inferior a {d} punts, en dóna {c}.",
"item_desc124","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a MEGA beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca una MEGA pilota de platja que emet {b} ràfegues de confeti.{a}*Les boles esclatades pel confeti donen {c}% del seu valor.",

"item_desc125","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty Description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc126","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to two copies of himself.","En Nubby genera dues còpies d'ell mateix.",
"item_desc127","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de doblar la bola més valiosa.",
"item_desc128","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Emet un raig d'icor per cada {b} cops que en Nubby és mort durant la partida.{a}*Quan l'icor colpeja una bola, els objectes i avantatges amb [#ffd500]{c}"Arribes a l'objectiu de ronda"[spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] s'activen.{a}(Ara mateix emet {d})",
"item_desc129","[#ffffff]{a}*Temporarily upgrades cafe foods that are currently available for purchase.","[#ffffff]{a}*Millora temporalment els aliments disponibles a la cafeteria.",

"item_desc130","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc131","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc132","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc133","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanyes {b} punts per cada cop que el tauler s'ha reabastit.{a}(Ara mateix {c} punts)",
"item_desc134","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Giant Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a giant cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una bola aleatòria emet una {b}Cosmoexplosió Gegant{b}.{a}*Quan una bola esclata per culpa d'una cosmoexplosió gegant, compta com {c} esclats en lloc de 1.",
"item_desc135","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Quan aquest objecte es força, transmet l'activació forçada a l'[#ffb3ff]OBJECTE A LA MEVA ESQUERRA[#ffffff].{a}*{c}% de possibilitats de activar-lo 1 cop més.",
"item_desc136","[#ffffff]{a}*If you have less than maximum lives, restores +1 life.{a}*Otherwise, gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si tens menys vides del màxim, n'obtens una extra.{a}*Si no, pots fer 1 reroll als aliments de la cafeteria.",
"item_desc137","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.{a}*This does not increase odds of ultra-rare items.","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanyes {b}% de probabilitat d'obtenir objectes rars a totes les botigues.{a}*Això no augmenta les probabilitats d'objectes ultrarars.",
"item_desc138","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa aparèixer un aliment ultrarar.",
"item_desc139","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Conté un objecte rar aleatori del Nubbymercat.",
"item_desc140","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Conté un objecte rar aleatori del mercat negre.",
"item_desc141","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Conté un aliment rar aleatori.",
"item_desc142","[#ffffff]*Contains a copy of a random item in your inventory.{a}*If you have no items, this will give a random common item.","[#ffffff]*Conté una còpia aleatòria d'un objecte del teu inventari.{a}*Si no en tens, te'n dóna un objecte comú aleatori.",
"item_desc143","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Conté un objecte ultrarar aleatori del Nubbymercat.",
"item_desc144","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Conté un objecte ultrarar aleatori del mercat negre.",
"item_desc145","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Conté un aliment ultrarar aleatori.",
"item_desc146","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +1 additional time per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Pots remenar les boles un cop més per torn.",
"item_desc147","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna 1 reroll per a la cafeteria.",
"item_desc148","[#ffffff]{a}*Deletes the left-most item.{a}*The right-most item transforms into a squid.{a}*If the right-most item is upgraded, it transforms into an upgraded squid.","[#ffffff]{a}*Esborra l'objecte més a l'esquerra.{a}*L'objecte més a la dreta es transforma en un calamar.{a}*Si l'objecte més a la dreta està millorat, es transforma en un calamar millorat.",
"item_desc149","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de forçar [#ffb3ff]ELS OBJECTES ADJACENTS A MI[#ffffff].{a}*Les probabilitats cauen {c}% cada cop que aquest objecte s'activa.{a}*Les probabilitats tornen a {b}% en acabar la ronda.",
"item_desc150","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de forçar [#ffb3ff]ELS OBJECTES ADJACENTS A MI[#ffffff].{a}*Les probabilitats cauen {c}% cada cop que aquest objecte s'activa.{a}*Les probabilitats tornen a {b}% en acabar la ronda.",
"item_desc151","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tots els avantatges forcen l'[#ffb3ff]OBJECTE A LA MEVA ESQUERRA[#ffffff] un cop.",
"item_desc152","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.{a}*Each perk has a {b}% chance to force trigger the item twice instead of once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tots els avantatges forcen l'[#ffb3ff]OBJECTE A LA MEVA ESQUERRA[#ffffff] un cop.",
"item_desc153","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita l'efecte de l'aliment consumit més recentment.{a}*Ara mateix: {c}{b}{c}. {d}",
"item_desc154","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Can give up to {c} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanya {b} monedes per cada maduixa consumida durant la partida.{a}*Pot donar fins a un màxim de {c} monedes.",
"item_desc155","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the two right-most items in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Millora els dos objectes més a la dreta del teu inventari.",
"item_desc156","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Jelly-Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna 1 {b}Avantatge Croissant amb Melmelada{b}",
"item_desc157","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives two copies of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna 2 còpies de l'avantatge obtingut més recentment.{a}(Ara mateix {b})",
"item_desc158","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for each remaining life.{a}*Bonus +{c} coins if you have all lives remaining.","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanya {b} monedes per cada vida que et quedi.{a}*Bonus de {c} monedes si les tens totes.",
"item_desc159","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double total coins.{a}*{c}% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de doblar el número de monedes.{a}*{c}% de probabilitats de perdre-les totes.",
"item_desc160","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Spicy Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna 1 {b}Avantatge Kebab Picant{b}",
"item_desc161","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa aparèixer un aliment millorat aleatori.",
"item_desc162","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +{b} rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanyes {b} rerolls en tornar al Nubbymercat.",
"item_desc163","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all common items in your inventory.{a}*Rare and ultra-rare items are unaffected.","[#ffffff]{a}*Canvia els teus objectes comuns per altres aleatoris.{a}*Els objectes rars i ultrarars no canvien.",
"item_desc164","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items except the [#ffb3ff]ITEM IN SLOT #1[#ffffff].{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa que l'activació dels teus objectes sigui aleatòria, excepte la de l'[#ffb3ff]OBJECTE A L'ESPAI 1[#ffffff].{a}*NO HI HA MARXA ENRERE.",
"item_desc165","[#ffffff]{a}*Permanently upgrades all foods that are currently available for purchase.{a}*From now on, these items will only appear as their upgraded version.","[#ffffff]{a}*Millora permanentment tots els aliments disponibles a la cafeteria.{a}*D'ara endavant, aquests aliments només apareixeran millorats.",
"item_desc166","[#ffffff]{a}*Restores +1 life and gives +2 rerolls in the cafe.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna 1 vida i 2 rerolls per a la cafeteria.",
"item_desc167","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.","[#ffffff]{a}*Guanya {b}% probabilitats de que surtin objectes rars a totes les botigues.",
"item_desc168","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fa aparèixer un aliment millorat aleatori.",
"item_desc169","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +{b} additional times per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Pots remenar les boles {b} cops adicionals per torn.",
"item_desc170","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +2 cafe nubby rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dóna 2 rerolls per a la cafeteria.",
"item_desc171","[#ffffff]{a}*Creates an upgraded squid in the right-most empty item slot in your inventory.{a}*If you have no empty item slots, this does nothing.","[#ffffff]{a}*Crea un calamar al espai buit més a la dreta del teu inventari.{a}*Si no tens espais buits, no fa res.",
"item_desc172","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits an anti-particle that halves the first peg it hits.","[#ffffff]{a}*Emet una antipartícula que divideix la primera bola que colpeja.",
"item_desc173","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped was NOT the highest # peg, {b} random pegs become 1-pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si la primera bola que ha esclatat NO era la més valiosa, {b} boles aleatòries redueixen el seu valor a 1.",
"item_desc174","[#ffffff]{a}*Destroys [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].","[#ffffff]{a}*Destrueixo [#ffb3ff]ELS OBJECTES ADJACENTS A MI[#ffffff].",
"item_desc175","[#ffffff]{a}*If the round goal has been passed more than once, this kills nubby. (This is an extremely painful death for him)","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc176","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Perds un {b}% de la teva puntuació total.",
"item_desc177","[#ffffff]{a}*Disables the left-most non-disabled item, besides itself. (Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.)","[#ffffff]{a}*Deshabilita l'objecte actiu més a l'esquerra a l'inventari, apart de si mateix. (Els objectes deshabilitats no poden activarse durant la resta de la ronda.)",
"item_desc178","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons an eggsac.{a}*Eggsacs bounce and pop pegs like Nubby.{a}*Pegs popped by eggsacs give NO points!","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca un sac d'ous.{a}*Els sac d'ous reboten i fan esclatar boles com en Nubby.{a}*Però NO donen punts!",
"item_desc179","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Substitueix l'objecte més a la dreta al teu inventari pel darrer objecte que has comprat al Nubbymercat o al mercat negre.{a}(Ara mateix: {b})",
"item_desc180","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the upgraded version of the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Substitueix l'objecte més a la dreta al teu inventari per la versió millorada del darrer objecte que has comprat al Nubbymercat o al mercat negre.{a}(Ara mateix: {b})",
"item_desc181","[#ffffff]{a}*A giant finger appears over the first peg popped's column.{a}*All pegs in this column subtract points equal to their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un dit gegant apareix sobre la columna de la primera bola que esclata.{a}*Totes les boles d'aquesta columna et treuen punts equivalents al seu valor.",
"item_desc182","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Perds un {b}% de la teva puntuació total.",

"item_desc183","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

