"peg_desc0","Missing description.","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",	
	
"peg_desc1","[#ffffcc]*This peg will give +{a} coin when popped for the first time.","[#ffffcc]*Aquesta bola dóna {a} moneda quan esclata per primer cop.",		
"peg_desc2","[#ffe6e6]*This peg can only be popped once it's stone layer has been popped {a} times.","[#ffe6e6]*Aquesta bola només comença a donar punts quan ha rebut {a} cops.",		
"peg_desc3","[#ffffcc]*When popped for the first time, this peg will trigger a mega explosion that pops all pegs once.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata per primer cop, aquesta bola genera una megaexplosió que fa esclatar totes les boles al mateix temps.",		
"peg_desc4","[#ffffcc]*This peg will pop the highest # peg when popped. (will not pop itself)","Aquesta bola fa esclatar la bola més valiosa quan rep un cop. (no s'aplica a ella mateixa)",
"peg_desc5","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will subtract points instead of adding points when popped.","[#ffe6e6]*Aquesta bola treu punts en lloc de donar-ne quan esclata.",		
"peg_desc6","[#ffffcc]*This peg will force-trigger the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{a} [#ffffcc]when popped.","[#ffffcc]*Aquesta bola activa per la força l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {a} [#ffffcc]quan esclata.",		
"peg_desc7","[#ffffcc]*This peg will multiply your total points by {a}x when popped for the first time.","[#ffffcc]*Aquesta bola multiplica els teus punts per {a} quan esclata per primer cop.",		
"peg_desc8","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will break after it has been popped for the first time.","[#ffe6e6]*Aquesta bola es trenca i desapareix quan esclata per primer cop.",		
"peg_desc9","[#ffffcc]*This peg will explode and pop {a} pegs in a cross-pattern when popped for the first time.","[#ffffcc]*Aquesta bola explota i fa esclatar {a} boles en un patró de creu quan rep el primer cop.",		
"peg_desc10","[#ffffcc]*When popped for the first time, all other pegs will be doubled ({a}% chance) OR halved ({b}% chance)","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata per primer cop, la resta de boles es doblen ({a}% de probabilitats) o es divideixen ({b}% probabilitats)",		
"peg_desc11","[#ffffcc]*This peg will multiply your total points by {a}x when fully popped.","[#ffffcc]*Aquesta bola multiplica els teus punts per {a} quan esclata completament.",		
"peg_desc12","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will kill nubby and end the round when fully popped.","[#ffe6e6]*Aquesta bola mata en Nubby i acaba la ronda quan esclata completament.",	
"peg_desc13","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will disable a random item when fully popped.{a}*Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.","[#ffe6e6]*Aquesta bola deshabilita un objecte quan esclata completament.{a}*Els objectes deshabilitats no s'activen durant la resta de la ronda.",		
"peg_desc14","[#ffffcc]*This peg gives points twice when popped.","[#ffffcc]*Aquesta bola dóna el doble de punts quan esclata.",

"peg_desc15","[#ffffcc]*No description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"peg_desc16","[#ffffcc]*All psychic pegs will give points equal to their # when any psychic peg is popped.","[#ffffcc]*TOTES les psicoboles donen punts equivalents al seu valor a la vegada quan esclata una d'elles.",
"peg_desc17","[#ffffcc]*When popped, this peg will emit 2 {b}snot-shots{b} that pop any pegs they pass through.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, aquesta bola emet 2 {b}trets de moc{b} que fan esclatar les boles que travessen.",
"peg_desc18","[#ffe6e6]*When popped, all pegs will copy this peg's #.","[#ffe6e6]*Quan esclata, totes les boles còpien el valor d'aquesta bola.",
"peg_desc19","[#ffe6e6]*When fully popped, the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #2[#ffe6e6] will be sold.","[#ffe6e6]*Ven l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI 2[#ffe6e6] automaticament quan esclata completament.",
"peg_desc20","[#ffffcc]*When popped, it counts as a [#ffd500]{a}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{a} [#ffffcc] trigger.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, compta com una activació de [#ffd500]En Nubby toca la paret [spr_ITArrow,0]{a}.",
"peg_desc21","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, gain +x coins, equal to the round number.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, guanya un número de monedes equivalent al número de la ronda on siguis.",
"peg_desc22","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, increase total coins by +{a}%.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, incrementa el número de monedes un {a}%.",N
"peg_desc23","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, if nubby is still alive, duplicates nubby.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, si en Nubby és viu encara, duplica en Nubby.",
"peg_desc24","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles {a} random pegs.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, dobla {a} boles aleatòries.",
"peg_desc25","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers all perks once.{a}*If no perks exist, force triggers all items once.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, activa tots els avantatges un cop.{a}*Si no en tens, activa tots els objectes un cop.",
"peg_desc26","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, gives a non-temporary random common item from nubby mart in the first empty inventory slot.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, genera un objecte comú no temporal del Nubbymercat a l'espai 1 de l'inventari.",
"peg_desc27","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, two copies of every summon in the game are summoned.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, genera dues còpies de cada invocació al joc.",
"peg_desc28","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles all pegs twice, lose {a}% of total points.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, perds un {a}% de la teva puntuació.",
"peg_desc29","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, a random item in your inventory that summons anything force triggers {a} times.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, activa {a} cops un objecte aleatori del teu inventari que invoqui quelcom.",
"peg_desc30","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers item in slot {a}, {b} times.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, activa l'objecte a l'espai {a} {b} cops.",
"peg_desc31","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers item in slot {b}, {c} times.{a}*Can force trigger corrupted items.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, activa l'objecte a l'espai {b} {c} cops. Pot activar objectes corruptes.",
"peg_desc32","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers all items {a} times.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, activa tots els objectes {a} cops.",
"peg_desc33","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles the highest # peg {a} times.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, dobla la bola més valiosa {a} cops.",
"peg_desc34","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles all pegs {a} times.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, dobla totes les boles {a} cops.",
"peg_desc35","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, all items temporarily turn into random upgraded ultra-rare items.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, tots els objectes es converteixen temporalment en objectes ultrarars millorats aleatoris.",
"peg_desc36","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, summons {a} crazy straw summons.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, invoca {a} palles boges.",
"peg_desc37","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, multiplies total points by {a}x.","[#ffffcc]*Quan esclata, multiplica la teva puntuació per {a}.",
"peg_desc38","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, sets total points to {a}.","[#ffe6e6]*Quan esclata, posa els teus punts a {a}.",
"peg_desc39","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, temporarily disables items in slots {a},{b}, and {c}.","[#ffe6e6]*Quan esclata, deshabilita els objectes als espais {a},{b}, i {c}.",
"peg_desc40","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, lose {a} coins.","[#ffe6e6]*Quan esclata, perds {a} monedes.",
"peg_desc41","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, temporarily randomizes all items in your inventory.","[#ffe6e6]*Quan esclata, canvia els teus objectes per altres aleatoris.",
"peg_desc42","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, {a} random pegs become 1-pegs.","[#ffe6e6]*Quan esclata, el valor de {a} boles aleatòries baixa a 1.",
"peg_desc43","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, halves all pegs.","[#ffe6e6]*Quan esclata, divideix totes les boles.",

"btn_skiploot_part1","Skip!","Saltar!",
"btn_skiploot_part2","Gives +{a}[spr_ITCoin,0]","Dóna {a}[spr_ITCoin,0]",
	
