"perk_name26","The Archaic Perk","Avantatge Arcaic",
"perk_name27","The Warlock Perk","Avantatge Màgic",
"perk_name28","The Gourmet Perk","Avantatge Gourmet",
"perk_name29","The Lunar Perk","Avantatge Lunar",
"perk_name30","The Croissant Perk","Avantatge del Croissant",
"perk_name31","The Jelly-Croissant Perk","Avantatge del Croissant de Melmelada",
"perk_name32","The Spicy Kebab Perk","Avantatge de la Broqueta Picant",

"perk_desc0","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Empty perk description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",	
	
"perk_desc1","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items.{a}*Disables the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa tots els objectes.{a}*Deshabilita l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6].",		
"perk_desc2","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the right-most item in your inventory.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats d'activar l'objecte més a la dreta al teu inventari.",		
"perk_desc3","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats d'activar l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {c}[#e6ffe6].",		
"perk_desc4","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the round started less than {b} seconds ago, force-triggers the items in slots [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #1, #2, and #3[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si la ronda va començar fa menys de {b} segons, activa els objectes als [#ffb3ff]ESPAIS 1, 2 i 3[#e6ffe6].",
"perk_desc5","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6]",	
"perk_desc6","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa tots els objectes.",	
"perk_desc7","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items in odd-numbered slots.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa els objectes en espais impars.",		
"perk_desc8","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers one random item.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa un objecte aleatori.",		
"perk_desc9","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all {b}[#ffd500]First peg popped [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa tots els objectes amb {b}[#ffd500]Primera bola esclatada[spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b}.",	
"perk_desc10","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats de activar l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {c}[#e6ffe6].",		
"perk_desc11","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #5.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte a l'espai #5.",		
"perk_desc12","[#e6ffe6]{a}If [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] is empty...{a}*A random item from nubby-mart will appear in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] and force-trigger {c} times.{a}*The new item will disappear at the end of the round.","[#e6ffe6]{a}Si l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6] està buit...{a}*Un objecte aleatori del Nubbymercat apareixerà a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6] i s'activarà {c} cops.{a}*Aquest objecte desapareix al final de la ronda.",		
"perk_desc13","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], 3 times.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6], 3 cops.",		
"perk_desc14","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 time for every {c} coins you have.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6] 1 cop per cada {c} monedes.",		
"perk_desc15","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the items in slots [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #5, #6, and #7[#e6ffe6], {b} times each.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa els objectes als [#ffb3ff]ESPAIS 5, 6, i 7[#e6ffe6], {b} cops cadascú.",		
"perk_desc16","[#e6ffe6]{a}If you have 4 or less items... {a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], {c} times","[#e6ffe6]{a}Si tens 4 o menys objectes... {a}*Activa l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6], {c} cops.",		
"perk_desc17","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the round goal was passed {b} or more times, force-triggers all items and lose {c}% of total points.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si has assolit l'objectiu de ronda {b} o més cops, activa tots els objectes i et fa perdre el {c}% dels punts.",	
"perk_desc18","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If you have passed the round goal this round, force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], twice.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si has assolit l'objectiu de ronda, activa dos cops l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6].",	
"perk_desc19","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the leftmost item x times.{a}*Jumbling pegs increases x by +{b}.{a}*This value resets after each round.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte més a l'esquerra x cops.{a}*Remenar les boles augmenta x en {b}.{a}*Aquest valor es reinicia cada ronda.",
"perk_desc20","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the left-most item in your inventory.{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte més a l'esquerra.{a}*Perds un {b}% dels teus punts totals.",
"perk_desc21","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all {b}[#ffd500]x pegs popped [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa tots els objectes amb {b}[#ffd500]x boles esclatades[spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b}.",
"perk_desc22","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items that summon anything.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa tots els objectes que invoquin quelcom.",
"perk_desc23","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the first peg popped was the highest # peg, force-triggers the items in [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #1, and #2[#e6ffe6], {b} times each.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si la primera bola esclatada és la de més valor, activa els objectes als [#ffb3ff]ESPAIS 1 i 2[#e6ffe6], {b} cops cadascú.",
"perk_desc24","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 2 times for each empty inventory slot.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6] 2 cops per cada espai d'inventari buit.",
"perk_desc25","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 time for each perk you have.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte a l'[#ffb3ff]ESPAI {b}[#e6ffe6] 1 cop per cada avantatge que tinguis.",
"perk_desc26","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all non-upgraded items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa tots els objectes bàsics.",
"perk_desc27","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force triggers all {b}[#ffd500]Nubby Dies [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items again.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa tots els objectes amb {b}[#ffd500]En Nubby mor [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b}un altre cop.",
"perk_desc28","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #{b}, 1 time for every {c} food items you've consumed.{a}(Foods eaten: {d})","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte a l'espai {b}, 1 cop per cada {c} aliments consumits.{a}(Aliments consumits: {d})",
"perk_desc29","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #{b}, 1 time for every {c} rounds you've passed.{a}(Current force-triggers: {d})","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa l'objecte a l'espai {b}, 1 cop per cada {c} rondes que hagis passat.{a}(Activacions actuals: {d})",
"perk_desc30","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Has an x% chance to force-trigger the item in slot #{b}.{a}*For each remaining life, gain +{c}% odds.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Té un x% de probabilitats d'activar l'objecte a l'espai {b}.{a}*Per cada vida restant, guanyes {c}% de probabilitats.",
"perk_desc31","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Has an x% chance to force-trigger the item in slot #{b}.{a}*For each remaining life, gain +{c}% odds.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Té un x% de probabilitats d'activar l'objecte a l'espai {b}.{a}*Per cada vida restant, guanyes {c}% de probabilitats.",
"perk_desc32","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the right-most item in your inventory.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de probabilitats d'activar l'objecte més a la dreta.",

