"finalboss_desc1","Blood drops will rapidly rain down from above and halve the first peg they come in contact with.","Del cel cauen gotes de sang que divideixen la primera bola que toquen.",
"finalboss_desc2","The side walls of the factory turn into brimstone. When Nubby hits brimstone, lose {a}% of your total points","Les parets de la fàbrica es cobreixen de sofre infernal. Quan en Nubby les toca, perd un {a}% de la puntuació total.",
"finalboss_desc3","Tony shoots lazers from his eyes! If a peg is hit by a lazer, its number will be reduced to 1.","En Toni dispara làsers pels ulls! Si un làser colpeja una bola, el seu valor baixa a 1.",

"shoperror1","All item slots full.{a}Sell items to make room!{a}{a}[Press {b} items to sell]","No tens espai.{a}Vend objectes per comprar un de nou!{a}{a}[Prem {b} sobre un objecte per vendre'l]",					
"shoperror4","Too poor! Get more money to buy this!","Ets molt pobre! Guanya diners per comprar això!",				
"shoperror6","Drag and drop an item over this button to freeze them!{a}(Frozen items won't go away when you reroll or leave the shop.)","Arrossega un objecte fins aquí per congelar-lo!{a}(Els objectes congelats no canvien entre botigues.)",
"shoperror7","Beat the game at least once to unlock!","Completa el joc al menys un cop per desbloquejar-lo!",
"shoperror8","Must play at least one game to unlock!","Has de jugar al menys una partida per desbloquejar-lo!",
"shoperror9","Not enough stars! Play the game and take on challenges to get stars!","No tens prou estrelles! Juga partides i reptes per obtenir-ne!",
"shoperror10","Stars are a currency used to unlock things. You can obtain stars by doing well in-game!","Les estrelles són una moneda per desbloquejar coses. En pots obtenir si jugues bé!",
"shoperror11","Your autosaved run is no longer compatible in the current game version.","La teva partida desada no és compatible amb la versió actual del joc.",
"shoperror12","You must beat the previous difficulty level to unlock!","Has de completar el joc en la dificultat anterior per desbloquejar-lo!",

"pausemenuerror1","The round must be over to save and quit.","Has d'acabar la ronda per desar i sortir.",
	
