"bmdoorprompt","A mysterious door appears...","Una porta misteriosa apareix...",

"bmdoor_usekey","Use key?","Vols fer servir la clau?",

"perkwarning","Note: Perks are permanent. You cannot sell or get rid of them.","Nota: Els avantatges són permanents. No els pots eliminar o vendre.",
		
