"soldout","Sold out!","Esgotat!",
		
"newgame","New{a}Game!","Nova{a}Partida!",
		
"roundinfo","Round {a}","Ronda {a}",	

"tut1","Hey. You must be the new employee they were telling me about.","Hola! Tu deus ser la "enorme" ajuda que ens van prometre, oi? M'han parlat força de tu.",
"tut2","My name is Tony and I'm gonna be your supervisor.","Em dic Toni, sóc el teu supervisor.",		
"tut3","My job is to show you how to run the factory.","T'explicaré com funciona la fàbrica.",	
"tut4","I don't really care about your name or anything so let's just get into this.","No m'interessa com et dius o de quin equip ets, o sigui que anem per feina.",		
"tut5","First things first, welcome aboard to Nubby's Number Factory - the world's leading number manufacturer!","Per començar, et vull donar la benvinguda a la Fàbrica de Números d'en Nubby, el major productor de números del món!",		
"tut6","This is the main control center of the factory.","Aquest és el centre de control de la fàbrica.",		
"tut7","Your first task is to launch our mascot, Nubby, down the peg board.","La teva primera tasca és llençar la nostra mascota, en Nubby, tauler avall.",		
"tut8","Hold down [{a}] and press [{b}] to launch Nubby.","Manté [{a}] i prem [{b}] per llençar en Nubby.",		
"tut9","Wow, you're really good at this.","Ostres, tens traça amb això!!",		
"tut10","At this factory, your only job is to make big numbers...","Dins d'aquesta fàbrica, només has de fer números molt grossos.",		
"tut11","By launching Nubby at these pegs, you will earn however many points are shown on the peg.","En llençant en Nubby cap a les boles, guanyes tants punts com indiqui el número de la bola.",		
"tut12","This number shows how many points you made in a round.","Aquest número indica quants punts has aconseguit en una ronda.",		
"tut13","The number on the bottom is the goal. If you beat the goal, the board will restock.","L'altre número és l'objectiu. Si hi arribes, el tauler es reabasteix.",		
"tut14","If you get a REALLY high score, the board can restock multiple times in a single round.","Si obtens una puntuació ALTÍSSIMA, el tauler es reabastirà unes quantes vegades en una sola ronda.",		
"tut15","Oh wait.. I forgot to tell you what a restock even is!","Espera, me n'he oblidat de dir-te què és un reabastiment!",		
"tut16","Well listen up, because restocks are an important thing!","Escolta nan, perquè són ben importants!",		
"tut17","When the board restocks, a bunch of NEW pegs will fall from the sky and fill all your empty spaces.","Quan el tauler es reabasteix, noves boles cauen del cel i omplen tots els espais buits del tauler.",		
"tut18","Soon after, pairs of pegs with the same number will merge into one greater peg.","Poc després, parells de boles amb el mateix valor s'uniran per formar boles més valioses.",		
"tut19","Let's try it out. Keep launching Nubby until you beat the goal.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]","Provem-ho ara de debó. Llença en Nubby fins que arribis a l'objectiu.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]",		
"tut20","You can do better than that. Do it again.","Sé que ho pots fer molt millor, fes-ho un altre cop",
"tut21","Pegtacular! That was pegalicious! You're a star!","Bolavellós! Això ha sigut hiperbòlic! Ets una llegenda!",		
"tut22","Just kidding, no you're not.","Nah, és broma. No ho ets.",	
"tut23","Ok. We're almost done. To rearrange your new pegs, press the jumble button.","Va, que gairebé hem acabat. Per recol·locar les boles, prem el botó de remenar.",		
"tut24","Nice. Launch Nubby one more time [{a}] + [{b}]. I wanna show you something.","Molt bé. Llença en Nubby un altre cop [{a}] + [{b}]. Vull que vegis una coseta.",		
"tut25","So you might have noticed that Nubby goes through some pegs, but not others.","Has vist? En Nubby travessa unes boles però no altres.",		
"tut26","Nubby will break through 1's, but will bounce off any peg greater than 1.","Les boles amb un 1 les travessa sense problema, peró si el valor és més alt, hi rebotarà",		
"tut27","Alright bud, that's it for the tutorial. You'll figure the rest out for yourself.","Va compi, això és tot. Et pots imaginar la resta.",		
"tut28","OH! WAIT! WAIT! I FORGOT ONE THING!","EEEEI! ESPERA! ESPERA! UNA COSETA MÉS!",		
"tut29","Everytime you launch Nubby, you lose one life. If you run out of lives, the sun will explode.","Cada cop que llences en Nubby perds una vida. Si en perds totes, el sol explota.",		
"tut30","But luckily, everytime the board restocks, you get one life back.","Però afortunadament, cada cop que el tauler es reabasteix, recuperes una vida.",		
"tut31","So as long as you keep making big numbers, nobody gets hurt.","O sigui que sempre que segueixis creant números enormes, tot anirà bé.",
"tut32","Ok now I'm done. Thanks for not pressing the {a}skip tutorial{a} button. I know that was difficult for you.","Ara sí que m'en vaig. Gràcies per no prèmer el botó de {a}saltar tutorial{a}. Sé que ha sigut difícil per tu.",	
"tut33","I'll start you off with a fresh, new factory now. Good luck.","Ara et donaré una nova fàbrica per que puguis començar. Bona sort.",

"skiptut","Skip Tutorial","Saltar Tutorial",
		
