"altdesc_corrupted","[#cc99ff]CORRUPTED ITEM[#ffffff]:{a}*This item cannot be force-triggered.","[#cc99ff]OBJECTE CORRUPTE[#ffffff]:{a}*No activable amb boles, altres objectes o avantatges.",
"altdesc_evil","[#ff0000]EVIL ITEM[#ffffff]:{a}*This item cannot be moved, upgraded, sold, or otherwise destroyed.","[#ff0000]OBJECTE MALVAT[#ffffff]:{a}*No pots moure, millorar, vendre o destruir aquest objecte.",
"altdesc_glass","[#99e6e6]GLASS ITEM[#ffffff]:{a}*This item has a 5% chance to shatter when it triggers.","[#99e6e6]OBJECTE DE VIDRE[#ffffff]:{a}*Aquest objecte té un 5% de probabilitats de trencar-se quan s'activa.",
"altdesc_disable","*DISABLED ITEMS:{a}[#ffffff]*Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.","*OBJECTED DESACTIVATS:{a}[#ffffff]*Els objectes desactivats no es poden activar durant la resta de la ronda.",
"altdesc_kebab","[#4dff4d][fnt_ItemName]{b}  [#ffffff][spr_Sub_Perk,0]{a}[fnt_ComicSansMed]{c}","[#4dff4d][fnt_ItemName]{b}  [#ffffff][spr_Sub_Perk,0]{a}[fnt_ComicSansMed]{c}",
