"challenge_highscore","Highscore","Màxima puntuació",

"challenge_desc_0","*Items in shops are replaced by various mystery boxes.{a}*Mystery boxes give a random item when purchased.","*Els objectes al Nubbymercat es substitueixen per caixes misterioses.{a}*Aquestes donen un objecte aleatori quan es compren.",
"challenge_desc_1","*You can jumble pegs once PER GAME.{a}*Rerolling items in shops is disabled.","*Pots remenar les boles només un cop PER PARTIDA.{a}*No pots fer rerolls al Nubbymercat.",
"challenge_desc_2","*Maximum coins are capped at 10.{a}*Items that cost more than 10 coins have reduced prices.","*No pots tenir més de 10 monedes.{a}*Tots els objectes que costen més de 10 monedes estan rebaixats.",
"challenge_desc_3","*Rare items, foods, and perks cannot be found.","Els objectes, aliments i avantatges rars no apareixen.",
"challenge_desc_4","*Items will be deleted 15 rounds after they were obtained.{a}*Upgrading items will reset their expiration date.","*Els objectes desapareixen 15 rondes després de obtenir-los.{a}*Millorar-los reinicia la seva data de caducitat.",
"challenge_desc_5","*During restocks, you can only gain +1 life at most - even if you restocked more than once.{a}*You cannot gain lives using any alternative method.","*No pots guanyar més d'una vida amb els reabastiments.{a}*No pots guanyar vides amb cap mètode alternatiu.",
"challenge_desc_6","*Failure to meet the quota on any round will result in the left-most item being deleted.","*Si no aconsegueixes arribar a l'objectiu en qualsevol ronda, l'objecte més a l'esquerra desapareix.",
"challenge_desc_7","*A C-4 is strapped to Nubby.{a}*Nubby will explode and die after 1.5 seconds, causing a big explosion that pops pegs.","*En Nubby té un C4 lligat.{a}*En Nubby explota i mor després de 1.5 segons, causant una explosió que fa esclatar boles properes.",
"challenge_desc_8","*Perks cannot be obtained.","*No pots obtenir avantatges.",
"challenge_desc_9","*If you start a round with more than 1 item in your inventory, all items will be disabled for the rest of the round.","Si comences una ronda amb més d'un objecte a l'inventari, tots els objectes es desactiven durant la resta de la ronda.",
"challenge_desc_10","*Collect all 5 letters (N.U.B.B.Y.) by completing trials.{a}*You must beat round 80 to complete.{a}*Difficulty: {b}","*Col·lecciona les 5 lletres (N.U.B.B.Y.) en completant proves.{a}*Has de superar la ronda 80 per completar-les.{a}*Dificultat: {b}",

"NubbyTrialsAllLocked","Beat at least 5 challenges to unlock!","Supera al menys 5 reptes per desbloquejar això!",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Antimatter{d})","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objecte malvat apareix a l'espai {c}.{a}({d}Antimatèria{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Shell Shocked!{c} boss.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}T'enfrontes al boss {c}Atordit!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Items in slots {c} and {d} are destroyed.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Els objectes als espais {c} i {d} es destrueixen.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all coins.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Perds totes les monedes.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All upgraded items are downgraded.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Tots els objects millorats tornen a ser bàsics.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Dollhead{d})","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objecte malvat apareix a l'espai {c}.{a}({d}Cap de Ninot{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All items are destroyed, except for evil items.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Tots els objectes es destrueixen, excepte els malvats.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Psychic Spider{d})","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objecte malvat apareix a l'espai {c}.{a}({d}Psicaranya{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Bedrock Bash!{c} boss.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}T'enfrontes al boss {c}Trencant el subsol!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Pots tenir fins a {c} vides.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Homunculus{d})","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objecte malvat apareix a l'espai {c}.{a}({d}Homuncle{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum coins capped at {c}.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Pots tenir fins a {c} monedes.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All rare and ultra-rare items are destroyed.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Tots els objectes rars i ultrarars es destrueixen.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Holiday Cheer!{c} boss.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}T'enfrontes al boss {c}Esperit Nadalenc!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}{c}Homunculus{c} turns into {c}Alphamunculus{c} (harder variant).","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}{c}Homuncle{c} es converteix en {c}Alfamuncle{c} (més difícil).",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Broken Figurine{d})","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objecte malvat apareix a l'espai {c}.{a}({d}Ninot Trencat{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Scary Fingore{d})","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objecte malvat apareix a l'espai {c}.{a}({d}Dit Esgarrifós{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}I've Been Robbed!{c} boss.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}T'enfrontes al boss {c}M'han Robat!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All non-upgraded items are destroyed.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Tots els objectes bàsics es destrueixen.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all but one life.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Perds totes les vides menys una.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Pots tenir fins a {c} vides.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Rodent Bones{d})","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objecte malvat apareix a l'espai {c}.{a}({d}Esquelet de Ratolí{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Bottled Tears{d})","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objecte malvat apareix a l'espai {c}.{a}({d}Llàgrimes en una ampolla{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Pessimism!{c} boss.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}T'enfrontes al boss {c}Pessimisme!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All perks are destroyed.","A LA RONDA {b}:{a}Tots els avantatges es destrueixen.",

