"NubbySkinDesc0","Nubby's classic look!","L'aspecte clàssic d'en Nubby!",
"NubbySkinDesc1","This frog nubby was sent to us in the mail one day. We have no idea why this frog resembles nubby.","Aquesta granota ens la van enviar per correu fa un temps. No tenim ni idea de per què s'assembla al Nubby.",
"NubbySkinDesc2","An endangered subspecies of nubbies, scientifically known as Nubbicus Aquaticus.","Un espècie de nubby en perill d'extinció, científicament coneguda com Nubbicus Aquaticus.",
"NubbySkinDesc3","A failed experiment, resulting from the factory's past attempts to tap into the cheese industry.","Un experiment fallit que va resultar dels nostres intents d'incursió a l'indústria làctia.",
"NubbySkinDesc4","This nubby stole factory money to follow his dreams at clown college.","Aquest nubby va robar diners de l'empresa per estudiar el grau de ciències de l'humor.",
"NubbySkinDesc5","This nubby made his own cosplay and thinks he has cyborg strength. Just let the poor guy have a dream...","Aquest nubby es va fer el seu propi cosplay i creu que té força de cíborg. Deixa'l que somiï.",
"NubbySkinDesc6","This nubby is also a parasite in the metaphorical sense too. If he asks, don't lend him any money.","Aquest nubby també és un paràsit en sentit metafòric. Si et demana diners, no l'hi donis.",
"NubbySkinDesc7","In the nubby manufacturing process, things like this happen by accident sometimes.","Accidents com aquests poden ocòrrer durant el procès de producció de nubbies.",
"NubbySkinDesc8","This nubby finds joy in Victorian Era live action roleplay. He's not hurting anyone so we let it happen.","A aquest nubby li agrada jugar a ser un senyor de l'Era Victoriana. A nosaltres ens sembla bé sempre que no faci mal a ningú.",
"NubbySkinDesc9","We keep this nubby around to celebrate employee birthdays. He's also super good at playing kazoo.","Guardem aquest nubby a la fàbrica per celebrar els aniversaris. També toca el mirlitó molt bé.",
"NubbySkinDesc10","Just for kicks, we sometimes make nubbies that can feel emotion. They all end up forming punk bands.","A vegades produïm nubbies amb emocions. Tots acaben formant bandes de punk rock.",
"NubbySkinDesc11","The result of our attempts at making self replicating nubbies to save money.","El resultat dels esforços de l'empresa per auto-replicar nubbies i estalviar-se calés.",
"NubbySkinDesc12","Despite his appearance, this nubby is very mature and sophisticated if you get to know him.","Tot i la seva apariència, aquest nubby és molt madur i sofisticat quan el coneixes.",
"NubbySkinDesc13","Back when the number factory had a petting zoo, this nubby was super popular. Of course, that was before the incident...","Quan la fàbrica tenia un zoo, aquest nubby era super popular. Clar, això va ser abans de l'incident...",
"NubbySkinDesc14","One of the very first nubbies we cloned. Made way before we discovered their number harvesting capabilities.","Un dels primers nubbies que vam clonar, molt abans de descobrir les seves propietats per fer números.",
"NubbySkinDesc15","Tony thinks it's really funny to brainwash nubbies into thinking he's god.","En Toni creu que és molt divertit rentar el cervell dels nubbies per tal que pensin que ell és déu.",
"NubbySkinDesc16","The PR team requested a {b}wholesome{b} nubby mascot to slap on all of our advertising and merch to overshadow our non-wholesome practices.","Els de màrqueting van demanar una mascota {b}agradable i familiar{b} per posar en tots els nostres anuncis i merchandising i cobrir les nostres pràctiques no tan ètiques.",
"NubbySkinDesc17","One year we dressed this nubby up as a butterfly for Halloween. Now we have leave the costume on him because he'll try to bite you if you get near him.","Un any vam vestir aquest nubby de papallona per Halloween. L'hi hem deixat perquè si t'apropes molt, et mossega.",
"NubbySkinDesc18","This is just a souvenir that we sell to tourists at the number factory gift shop.","Aquest nubby només és un souvenir que venem als turistes al final de les nostres visites guiades.",
"NubbySkinDesc19","This Nubby is an official star-employee at the number factory... Just like you!","Aquest nubby és oficialment el treballador del mes a la fàbrica... Com tu!",
"NubbySkinDesc20","This Nubby angered the car wizard and as punishment he was turned into a car. Despite his curse, he remains joyous.","Aquest nubby va emprenyar el mag del concessionari i va acabar transformat en cotxe. No sembla importar-li molt.",

"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","This skin is a mystery...","Aquesta skin és un misteri...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","Who knows what this could be...","Qui sap què és això...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","Oooh a mystery nubby...","Ohhh un nubby misteriós...",

"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 1","Desbloqueja això superant el Nivell 1 de les Proves d'en Nubby",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 2","Desbloqueja això superant el Nivell 2 de les Proves d'en Nubby",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 3","Desbloqueja això superant el Nivell 3 de les Proves d'en Nubby",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_18","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 4","Desbloqueja això superant el Nivell 4 de les Proves d'en Nubby",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_19","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 5","Desbloqueja això superant el Nivell 5 de les Proves d'en Nubby",

