"ItemSkinNickName17","Trophy","Trofeu",
"ItemSkinNickName18","Corndog","Frankfurt",


"ItemSkinDesc0","Transform your seals into dapper gentlemen.","Transforma les teves foques en fastuosos i elegants senyors.",
"ItemSkinDesc1","Turn your all-seeing pyramids into poorly drawn ancient artifacts.","Canvia les teves piràmids totveients en lloses amb dibuixos de dubtosa destreça.",
"ItemSkinDesc2","Turn your fake plastic trees into fake plastic trees.","Transforma els teus arbres de plàstic en arbres de plàstic cutres.",
"ItemSkinDesc3","Turn your kidney beans into kidneys, minus the beans.","La teva mongeta es converteix en un il·lustratiu ronyó de plàstic. No té tant de carisma, però hauràs d'estimar-te'l igualment.",
"ItemSkinDesc4","Turn your e-blocks into hardened, stone-faced soldiers.","Transforma els teus blocs E en blocs de formigó DURÍSSIMS",
"ItemSkinDesc5","Turn your avocados into your friends!","L'alvocat, el millor amic de l'home!",
"ItemSkinDesc6","Turn your jeans into jorts!","Talla els teus texans i ves a la darrera moda!",
"ItemSkinDesc7","Make your ton of feathers way heavier.","De sobte la teva tona de plomes és molt més pesada...",
"ItemSkinDesc8","Turn your donut into a drawing of a donut.","El teu dónut és ara un gargot! No l'intentis menjar...",
"ItemSkinDesc9","Fill your mushrooms with compacted C4.","Un bolet amb un gust... explosiu.",
"ItemSkinDesc10","Replace your normal noodles with shorter, tubular noodles that are bent.","Vam demanar galets i ens van portar això. Doncs ok.",
"ItemSkinDesc11","Give your mannequin head some style, and a personality too!","Un maniquí que escolta indie i beu cafè d'especialitat.",
"ItemSkinDesc12","Turn your mollusk into an extinct mollusk.","Transforma el teu mol·lusc de sempre en un mol·lusc extint exclusiu.",
"ItemSkinDesc13","Turn your pedro into pedroooooooooooooooo.","Canvia en Pere per en Pereeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee.",
"ItemSkinDesc14","Turn your clay man into a clay man, except this time he's actually made out of clay.","Fer ninots de plastilina és molt 2000, fes-los d'argila de debò.",
"ItemSkinDesc15","Give poopbutt a timeout in the magic microwave.","Un minut al microones i llest! Espera... no sap una mica a plàstic?",
"ItemSkinDesc16","Release your sea cucumbers into the wild, and then make a handcrafted charm to honor their legacy.","Autèntic art, digne del millor alumne de P-3.",
"ItemSkinDesc17","Turn your fish into a fish on a wall!","Ara pots colgar el teu peix i ensenyar-lo a cada reunió familiar!",
"ItemSkinDesc18","Turn your squids into the best American carnival food!","Converteix els teus calamars en deliciosos frankfurts fregits!",

"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","A mystery item skin.. what is it?","Una skin misteriosa... quina serà?",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","How mysterious...","Què misteriós...",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","I wonder what it is...","Em pregunto què serà...",

"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating the game at least once with every supervisor.","Desbloqueja això superant el joc un cop amb tots els supervisors.",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by reaching round 300 in endless mode on any supervisor.","Desbloqueja això arribant a la ronda 300 en mode infinit amb qualsevol supervisor.",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating all challenges, including all nubby trials levels.","Desbloqueja això superant tots els reptes i Proves d'en Nubby.",

"warehouse_tutorial0","Greetings! The name's Sparkplug.","Salutacions! Sóc el Bugies.",
"warehouse_tutorial1","You've entered my realm... the warehouse!","Ara mateix ets als meus dominis... el magatzem!",
"warehouse_tutorial2","I'm the manager here, sort of. It's complicated...","Sóc el encarregat aquí... més o menys. És complicat.",
"warehouse_tutorial3","Anyways, who cares, am I right? I'm gonna show you around real quick.","En qualsevol cas, a ningú l'importa. T'ensenyaré el lloc.",
"warehouse_tutorial4","Here we are! The warehouse is where you buy and activate cosmetic nubby skins and item skins.","Ja som aquí! El magatzem és on compres i actives skins d'objectes i d'en Nubby.",
"warehouse_tutorial5","We're currently looking at the nubby skins menu. Press the item skins button to view the item skins menu.","Aquestes són les skins d'en Nubby. Prem el botó de skins d'objectes per veure-les.",
"warehouse_tutorial6","This is the menu for buying and activating item skins, but we're going to focus on nubby skins for now.","Aquí pots comprar i activar skins d'objectes, però ens concentrarem en les skis per al Nubby.",
"warehouse_tutorial7","Go back to the nubby skins menu by pressing the nubby skins button.","Pots tornar al menú de skins d'en Nubby en prement el botó de skins d'en Nubby.",
"warehouse_tutorial8","Use the arrows to page through my collection of cosmetics! Click the arrows a couple times and we'll move on.","Fes servir les fletxes per fer un cop d'ull a totes les skins! Va, clica les fletxes un parell de cops i continuem.",
"warehouse_tutorial9","Good job! Here's 10 free stars as a reward for being so obedient!","Ben fet! Aquí tens 10 estrelles com a recompensa per ser tan obedient!",
"warehouse_tutorial10","Now, find a nubby skin you can afford and buy it.","Ara troba una skin d'en Nubby que et puguis permetre i compra-la.",
"warehouse_tutorial11","Nice. Now hit the green button below to activate it.","Molt bé. Ara prem el botó verd de sota per activar-la.",
"warehouse_tutorial12","You can only activate one nubby skin at a time, but you can activate multiple item skins at once.","Nomets pots tenir una skin d'en Nubby activa a la vegada, però pots activar diverses skins d'objecte alhora.",
"warehouse_tutorial13","Other than that, nubby skins and item skins work the same way.","Per la resta, les skins d'en Nubby i d'objectes funcionen igual.",
"warehouse_tutorial14","Ok. That's pretty much all I have left to say I think.","Val. Això és tot el que havia de dir-te. Crec.",
"warehouse_tutorial15","You're probably smart and you can figure the rest out for yourself.","Segurament siguis força intel·ligent i et pots imaginar la resta.",
"warehouse_tutorial16","I'm not gonna go away though because I don't trust you.","Però no m'en aniré perquè no tinc clar que pugui confiar en tu.",
"warehouse_tutorial17","By the way, did I mention that I'm also the official number factory historian?","Per cert, t'he dit que també sóc l'historiador oficial de la fàbrica?",
"warehouse_tutorial18","If you poke me, I'll tell you a random fact about the number factory. Anyways, have fun!","Si em cliques, et donaré un fet aleatori sobre la fàbrica.",

"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome1","Yeah, sure. Feel free to barge in unannounced.","És clar, sí. Pots pasar sense avisar si vols.",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome2","Welcome in! You need to learn to knock, though.","Benvingut! Hauries d'aprendre a picar la porta abans...",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome3","Welcome back! I totally wasn't in the middle of something.","Benvingut de nou! No m'has pillat en mig de res, de cap manera...",

"SparkplugRandomDialogue0","Nubbies are a species of genetically modified human. They also have DNA from over 300 random mammals, fish, and reptiles.","Els Nubbies són una espècie d'humà modificat genèticament, amb ADN de més de 300 mamífers, peixos i reptils aleatoris.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue1","There is no singular nubby. Rather, nubbies are genetically cloned right here at the factory. It's the way we've always done it.","No hi ha un nubby singular, els clonem genèticament aquí a la fàbrica seguint el métode tradicional.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue2","Not counting the incubation phase of nubby production, the average nubby life span is 6 seconds.","Sense tenir en compte el temps d'incubació, l'esperança de vida mitjana d'un Nubby és de 6 segons.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue3","The nubby production process is a highly guarded secret, we're the only number factory to own the nubby patent.","El procès de producció d'un nubby és un secret ultraconfidencial. Som l'única fàbrica amb patent per produir-ne.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue4","Other companies in the number industry try to produce numbers ethically without using nubbies. No other company is as successful as us.","Hi han altres companyies que intenten produir números èticament sense nubbies. Però no tenen tant d'èxit com nosaltres.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue5","We produce numbers for the whole world to use in their math problems, computations, and calculations. Without numbers, the laws of physics cease to exist.","Produïm números per que la resta del món els faci servir als seus problemes de matemàtiques, enginyeria, etc. Sense números, les lleis de la física no existirien.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue6","Years ago, I was hired to help remove asbestos from the warehouse. The other employees mistakenly thought I was a manager here, so I just rolled with it and here we are.","Fa uns anys em van contractar per treure l'asbest del magatzem. Els altres van pensar que era el encarregat del magatzem, o sigui que vaig començar a fer veure que ho era.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue7","The factory pays me based on how many hours I spend in the warehouse, so I moved in and I haven't left in years.","Com que la fàbrica em paga per hora que passo al magatzem, no m'he mogut en anys. De fet, visc aquí.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue8","Sometimes Tony and I listen to music and drive the forklift around to kill time. He's a nice guy once you get to know him.","De vegades en Toni i jo escoltem música i conduïm el carretó per pasar l'estona. És un noi maco quan el coneixes.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue9","Nobody's met the boss of the number factory. Nobody knows if there even is one. You could fire Tony and he couldn't do anything about it.","Ningú ha vist mai el cap de la fàbrica. De fet, hi ha gent que diu que no n'hi ha. Podries acomiadar en Toni i ningú no podria fer res.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue10","A while ago, Tony covered a bunch of nubbies in paint and threw them at my wall. He's a great artist!","Fa una estona, en Toni va cobrir uns nubbies amb pintura i els va llençar a la paret del magatzem. Tot un artista!",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue11","We don't even store anything in the warehouse. My only job is to explain what the warehouse is to new employees and drive the forklift.","No guardem res al magatzem. La meva única tasca és explicar què és el magatzem als nous companys i conduir el carretó.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue12","Here at the factory, we don't produce our number pegs - we buy them from the peg factory. they won't tell us what they're made of, so it can't be good.","Les boles numerades no les produïm aquí a la fàbrica, les comprem a la fàbrica de boles numerades. Mai ens volen dir de què estan fetes, o sigui que no deu ser res bo.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue13","We protect nubbies from themselves and from our rival companies. If they leave the factory grounds, they self destruct.","Protegim als nubbies d'ells mateixos i de les companyies rivals. Si creuen els límits de la fàbrica, exploten.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue14","Nubbies usually can't feel emotion, but they all have their own unique personality.","Els nubbies no tenen emocions, però la personalitat de cadascú és diferent.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue15","If nubbies are kept alive for too long, they slowly turn into cubes. We don't know why.","Si els nubbies viuen massa, es tornen cúbics. No sabem per què.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue16","Tony and I go way back. I don't know if he's shy or something but I've known him for over a decade and I've never seen him take the glasses off.","En Toni i jo ens coneixem de fa temps. No sé si és perquè és tímid o quin és el seu problema però en 10 anys no li he vist treure's les ulleres ni una sola vegada.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue17","You should really wear a gas mask in here. There's still tons of asbestos everywhere.","Hauries de portar una màscara de gas aquí. Hi ha asbest per tot arreu.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue18","Nubbies are the only known creature that can harvest numbers. Their bodies have the exact shape and texture required to harvest numbers.","Els nubbies són l'única criatura que pot recolectar números. Els seus cossos tenen la forma i textura perfectes per això.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue19","I've overheard talks about the number factory getting into letter production as well. Who knows... letters are in high demand these days.","He escoltat que la fàbrica podria obrir una línia de producció de lletres. Qui sap... molta gent fa servir les lletres avui dia...",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue20","You didn't hear this from me, but I've heard that nubbies taste like grape candy.","Si pregunten, jo no he dit res, però m'han dit que els nubbies tenen gust de sugus de pinya.",













