"item_desc91","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Giver +{b} point for hver gang denne genstand har udløst i løbet af runden.{a}*{c} ud af {d} chance for at metamorfosere.",
