"item_desc113","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc114","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc115","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hvis den første pløk sprængt er den højeste # pløk, gang den samlede scoring med {b}x.",
"item_desc116","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs, twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Sprænger {b} tilfældige pløkker, to gange.",
"item_desc117","[#ffffff]{a}*The two lowest # pegs become copies of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*De to laveste # pløkker bliver kopier af den højeste # pløk.",

"item_desc118","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc119","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Formindsker rundens mål med -{b}%.{a}*Halverer alle pløkker.",
"item_desc120","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers a hyper-beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an hyper-beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Hyper-beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Udløser en hyper lysstråle, der går igennem pløkker.{a}*Når en hyper lysstråle rammer en pløk, så vil den pløk give {b}% af dens #.{a}*Hyper lysstråle sprænger IKKE pløkker.",
"item_desc121","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits two god rays.{a}*Each god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Denne genstand udsender to guddommelige stråle.{a}*Hver guddommelig stråle sprænger en tilfældig pløk en gang for hver gang genstanden på [#ffb3ff]PLADS #1 [#ffffff]har udløst denne runde.",
"item_desc122","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk twice.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Udløser den seneste modtaget frynsegode to gange.{a}(Lige nu {b})",
"item_desc123","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Den laveste # pløk giver point lig med {b}x dens #.{a}*Hvis den laveste # pløk er {d} eller mindre, så vil den give +{c} point i stedet for.",
"item_desc124","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a MEGA beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tilkalder en MEGA badebold, der udsender {b} strømme af konfetti når den sprænger.{a}*Pløkker sprængt af konfetti giver {c}% af deres #.",

"item_desc125","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty Description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc126","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to two copies of himself.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby føder to kopier af hamselv.",
"item_desc127","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance for at fordoble den højeste # pløk.",
"item_desc128","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Udsender en ichor strøm for hver {b} gange Nubby døde i dette spil.{a}*Når en pløk er ramt af ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Bestå rundens mål [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] genstande og frynsegoder vil udløse.{a}(Udsender {d} lige nu)",
"item_desc129","[#ffffff]{a}*Temporarily upgrades cafe foods that are currently available for purchase.","[#ffffff]{a}*Opgraderer midlertidligt mad i caféen, der er til salg lige nu.",

"item_desc130","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc131","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc132","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc133","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*For hver gang brættet har genopfyldt dette spil, få +{b} point.{a}(Lige nu +{c} point)",
"item_desc134","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Giant Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a giant cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}*En tilfældig pløk udsender et {b}Gigantisk Kosmo-Brag{b}.{a}*Når en pløk er sprængt af et gigantisk kosmo-brag, så tæller det som {c} pløk sprængninger i stedet for 1.",
"item_desc135","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Når denne genstand er tvang-udløst, så overfører den tvang-udløsningen til [#ffb3ff]GENSTANDEN TIL VENSTRE FOR MIG[#ffffff].{a}*Har en {c}% chance for at tilføje +1 ekstra tvang-udløsning.",
"item_desc136","[#ffffff]{a}*If you have less than maximum lives, restores +1 life.{a}*Otherwise, gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hvis du har færre liv end maks liv, giver +1 liv tilbage.{a}*Ellers, giver +1 café nubby genrul.",
"item_desc137","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.{a}*This does not increase odds of ultra-rare items.","[#ffffff]{a}*Få +{b}% odds for sjældne genstande over alle butikker.{a}*Dette øger ikke oddsene af ultra-sjældne genstande.",
"item_desc138","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Laver en tilfældig ultra-sjælden mad genstand.",
"item_desc139","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Indeholder en tilfældig sjælden genstand fra Nubby Mart.",
"item_desc140","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Indeholder en tilfældig sjælden genstand det sorte marked.",
"item_desc141","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Indeholder en tilfældig sjælden mad genstand.",
"item_desc142","[#ffffff]*Contains a copy of a random item in your inventory.{a}*If you have no items, this will give a random common item.","[#ffffff]*Indeholder en kopi af en tilfældig genstand i din inventar.{a}*Hvis du har ingen genstande, så vil du få en tilfældig almindelig genstand.",
"item_desc143","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Indeholder en tilfældig ultra-sjælden genstand fra Nubby Mart.",
"item_desc144","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Indeholder en tilfældig ultra-sjælden genstand det sorte marked.",
"item_desc145","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Indeholder en tilfældig ultra-sjælden mad genstand.",
"item_desc146","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +1 additional time per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Du kan blande pløkker +1 ekstra gang hver tur.",
"item_desc147","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Giver +1 café nubby genrul.",
"item_desc148","[#ffffff]{a}*Deletes the left-most item.{a}*The right-most item transforms into a squid.{a}*If the right-most item is upgraded, it transforms into an upgraded squid.","[#ffffff]{a}*Sletter genstanden længst til venstre.{a}*Genstanden længst til højre bliver om til en blæksprutte.{a}*Hvis genstanden længst til højre er opgraderet, så bliver den om til en opgraderet blæksprutte.",
"item_desc149","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance for at tvang-udløse [#ffb3ff]BEGGE GENSTANDE TIL VENSTRE OG HØJRE FOR MIG[#ffffff].{a}*Oddsene aftager med {c}% for hver gang dette udløser succesfuldt.{a}*Oddsene nulstiller til {b}% når runden er slut.",
"item_desc150","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance for at tvang-udløse [#ffb3ff]BEGGE GENSTANDE TIL VENSTRE OG HØJRE FOR MIG[#ffffff].{a}*Oddsene aftager med {c}% for hver gang dette udløser succesfuldt.{a}*Oddsene nulstiller til {b}% når runden er slut.",
"item_desc151","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Alle frynsegoder tvang-udløser [#ffb3ff]GENSTANDEN TIL VENSTRE FOR MIG[#ffffff] en gang.",
"item_desc152","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.{a}*Each perk has a {b}% chance to force trigger the item twice instead of once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Alle frynsegoder tvang-udløser [#ffb3ff]GENSTANDEN TIL VENSTRE FOR MIG[#ffffff] en gang.{a}*Hver frynsegode har en {b}% chance for at tvang-udløse genstanden to gange i stedet for en gang.",
"item_desc153","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Efterligner den opgraderet effekt af den seneste spiste mad gestand{a}*Vil efterligne: {c}{b}{c}. {d}",
"item_desc154","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Can give up to {c} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Få +{b} mønter for hvert jordbær spist i løbet af dette spil.{a}*Kan give op til {c} mønter.",
"item_desc155","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the two right-most items in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Opgraderer de to genstande længst til højre i din inventar.",
"item_desc156","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Jelly-Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Giver +1 {b}Gelé-Croissant Frynsegode{b}.",
"item_desc157","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives two copies of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Giver to kopier af den seneste modtaget frynsegode.{a}(Lige nu {b})",
"item_desc158","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for each remaining life.{a}*Bonus +{c} coins if you have all lives remaining.","[#ffffff]{a}*Få +{b} mønter for hvert liv tilbage.{a}*Bonus +{c} mønter hvis du har alle liv tilbage.",
"item_desc159","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double total coins.{a}*{c}% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance for at fordoble dine mønter.{a}*{c}% risiko for at nulstille antallet af dine mønter.",
"item_desc160","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Spicy Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Giver +1 {b}Stærk Kebab Frynsegode{b}",
"item_desc161","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Laver en tilfældig opgraderet sjælden mad genstand.",
"item_desc162","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +{b} rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Når du kommer tilbage til Nubby-Mart, få +{b} genrul.",
"item_desc163","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all common items in your inventory.{a}*Rare and ultra-rare items are unaffected.","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomiserer alle almindelige genstande i din inventar.{a}*Sjældne og ultra-sjældne genstande er ikke påvirket.",
"item_desc164","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items except the [#ffb3ff]ITEM IN SLOT #1[#ffffff].{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomiserer udløsninger for alle genstande i din inventar bortset fra [#ffb3ff]GENSTANDEN PÅ PLADS #1[#ffffff].{a}*Denne forandring kan ikke fortrydes.",
"item_desc165","[#ffffff]{a}*Permanently upgrades all foods that are currently available for purchase.{a}*From now on, these items will only appear as their upgraded version.","[#ffffff]{a}*Opgraderer permanent alt mad, der er til salg lige nu.{a}*Fra nu af, disse genstande vil kun dukke op som deres opgraderet udgave.",
"item_desc166","[#ffffff]{a}*Restores +1 life and gives +2 rerolls in the cafe.","[#ffffff]{a}*Giver +1 liv tilbage og giver +2 genrul i caféen.",
"item_desc167","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.","[#ffffff]{a}*Få +{b}% odds for sjældne genstande over alle butikker.",
"item_desc168","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Laver en tilfældig opgraderet ultra-sjælden mad genstand.",
"item_desc169","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +{b} additional times per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Du kan blande pløkker +{b} ekstra gange hver tur.",
"item_desc170","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +2 cafe nubby rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Giver +2 café nubby genrul.",
"item_desc171","[#ffffff]{a}*Creates an upgraded squid in the right-most empty item slot in your inventory.{a}*If you have no empty item slots, this does nothing.","[#ffffff]{a}*Laver en opgraderet blæksprutte på den tomme genstands plads længst til højre i din inventar.{a}*Hvis du har ingen tomme genstands pladser, dette gør ingenting.",
"item_desc172","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits an anti-particle that halves the first peg it hits.","[#ffffff]{a}*Udsender en anti-partikel, der halverer den første pløk den rammer.",
"item_desc173","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped was NOT the highest # peg, {b} random pegs become 1-pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hvis den første sprængte pløk IKKE var den højeste # pløk, {b} tilfældige pløkker bliver 1-pløkker.",
"item_desc174","[#ffffff]{a}*Destroys [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].","[#ffffff]{a}*Sletter [#ffb3ff]BEGGE GENSTANDE TIL VENSTRE OG HØJRE FOR MIG[#ffffff].",
"item_desc175","[#ffffff]{a}*If the round goal has been passed more than once, this kills nubby. (This is an extremely painful death for him)","[#ffffff]{a}*Hvis rundens mål er bestået mere end en gang, dette dræber nubby. (Dette er en ekstremt smertefuld død for ham)",
"item_desc176","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Mist {b}% af dine samlede point.",
"item_desc177","[#ffffff]{a}*Disables the left-most non-disabled item, besides itself. (Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.)","[#ffffff]{a}*Deaktiverer genstanden længst til venstre, hvis den ikke er deaktiveret, bortset fra sigselv. (Deaktiverede genstande kan ikke udløse resten af runden.)",
"item_desc178","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons an eggsac.{a}*Eggsacs bounce and pop pegs like Nubby.{a}*Pegs popped by eggsacs give NO points!","[#ffffff]{a}*Tilkalder en æggesæk.{a}*Æggesækker hopper på og sprænger pløkker som Nubby.{a}*Pløkker sprængt af æggesækker giver INGEN point!",
"item_desc179","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Erstatter genstanden længst til højre i din inventar med den sidste genstand du har købt fra nubby mart eller det sorte marked.{a}(Lige nu: {b})",
"item_desc180","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the upgraded version of the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Erstatter genstanden længst til højre i din inventar med den opgraderet udgave af den sidste genstand du har købt fra nubby mart eller det sorte marked.{a}(Lige nu: {b})",
"item_desc181","[#ffffff]{a}*A giant finger appears over the first peg popped's column.{a}*All pegs in this column subtract points equal to their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*En gigantisk finger dukker op over den første sprængte pløks kolonne.{a}*Alle pløkker i denne kolonne trækker point fra lig med deres #.",
"item_desc182","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Mist {b}% af dine samlede point.",

