"challenge_name_0","{a}Amnesiac{a}","{a}Hukommelsestab{a}",
"challenge_name_1","{a}Stay There!{a}","{a}Bliv Dér!{a}",
"challenge_name_2","{a}Short on Change{a}","{a}Pengemangel{a}",
"challenge_name_3","{a}Plain Jane{a}","{a}Ligegyldig Lene{a}",
"challenge_name_4","{a}Expiration Date{a}","{a}Udløbsdato{a}",
"challenge_name_5","{a}One-Shot McGee{a}","{a}Peter Pletskud{a}",
"challenge_name_6","{a}Nubbelocke{a}","{a}Nubbelocke{a}",
"challenge_name_7","{a}Times up!{a}","{a}Tiden er gået!{a}",
"challenge_name_8","{a}Pol's Bane{a}","{a}Pols Bane{a}",
"challenge_name_9","{a}Pheebie-Mode{a}","{a}Pheebie-Tilstand{a}",
"challenge_name_10","Nubby Trials: Level {a}","Nubby Prøver: Niveau {a}",

"challenge_wins","Wins: ","Sejre: ",
"supervisor_wins","Wins: ","Sejre: ",

"challenge_highscore","Highscore","Top Scoring",

"challenge_desc_0","*Items in shops are replaced by various mystery boxes.{a}*Mystery boxes give a random item when purchased.","*Genstande i butikkker er erstattet af mysterie bokse.{a}*Mysterie bokse giver en tilfældig genstand når købt.",
"challenge_desc_1","*You can jumble pegs once PER GAME.{a}*Rerolling items in shops is disabled.","*Du kan blande pløkker en gang HVERT SPIL.{a}*Kan ikke genrulle genstande i butikker.",
"challenge_desc_2","*Maximum coins are capped at 10.{a}*Items that cost more than 10 coins have reduced prices.","*Maks antal mønter begrænset til 10.{a}*Genstande, der koster mere end 10 mønter har nedsatte priser.",
"challenge_desc_3","*Rare items, foods, and perks cannot be found.","*Sjældne genstande, mad, og frynsegoder kan ikke findes.",
"challenge_desc_4","*Items will be deleted 15 rounds after they were obtained.{a}*Upgrading items will reset their expiration date.","*Genstande slettes 15 runder efter de var anskaffet.{a}*Når genstande opgradereres, så nulstilles udløbsdatoen.",
"challenge_desc_5","*During restocks, you can only gain +1 life at most - even if you restocked more than once.{a}*You cannot gain lives using any alternative method.","*Under genopfyldninger, så kan du kun få højst +1 liv - selv hvis du genopfyldte mere end en gang.{a}*Du kan ikke få liv på nogen andre måder.",
"challenge_desc_6","*Failure to meet the quota on any round will result in the left-most item being deleted.","*Manglende overholdelse af kvoten på enhver runde vil resultere i, at genstanden længst til venstre vil slettes.",
"challenge_desc_7","*A C-4 is strapped to Nubby.{a}*Nubby will explode and die after 1.5 seconds, causing a big explosion that pops pegs.","*En bombe er spændt fast på Nubby.{a}*Nubby vil eksplodere og dø efter 1.5 sekunder, som forårsager en stor eksplosion, der sprænger pløkker.",
"challenge_desc_8","*Perks cannot be obtained.","*Frynsegoder kan ikke anskaffes.",
"challenge_desc_9","*If you start a round with more than 1 item in your inventory, all items will be disabled for the rest of the round.","*Hvis du begynder en runde med mere end 1 genstand i din inventar, så vil alle dine genstande være deaktiverede resten af runden.",
"challenge_desc_10","*Collect all 5 letters (N.U.B.B.Y.) by completing trials.{a}*You must beat round 80 to complete.{a}*Difficulty: {b}","*Saml alle 5 bogstaver (N.U.B.B.Y.) gennem prøver.{a}*Du skal slå runde 80 for at vinde.{a}*Sværhedsgrad: {b}",

"NubbyTrialsAllLocked","Beat at least 5 challenges to unlock!","Slå mindst 5 udfordringer for at låse op!",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Antimatter{d})","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}En ond genstand dukker op på plads {c}.{a}({d}Antistof{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Shell Shocked!{c} boss.","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}Stå overfor {c}Skal Chok!{c} bossen.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Items in slots {c} and {d} are destroyed.","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}Genstande på pladserne {c} og {d} ødelægges.",
