"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}{c}Homunculus{c} turns into {c}Alphamunculus{c} (harder variant).","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}{c}Væsen{c} bliver om til {c}Alfa Væsen{c} (sværere udgave).",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Broken Figurine{d})","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}En ond genstand dukker op på plads {c}.{a}({d}Ødelagt Figur{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Scary Fingore{d})","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}En ond genstand dukker op på plads {c}.{a}({d}Skræmmende Fingar{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}I've Been Robbed!{c} boss.","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}Stå overfor {c}Tyveri!{c} bossen.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All non-upgraded items are destroyed.","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}Alle uopgraderede genstande ødelægges.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all but one life.","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}Mist alle liv bortset fra et.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","VED RUNDE {b}:{a}Maks antal liv er begrænset til {c}.",
