"NubbySkinName15","Tony Fan Nubby","Tony Fan Nubby",
"NubbySkinName16","Number Farmer Nubby","Tal Landmand Nubby",
"NubbySkinName17","Flutty Nubby","Sommerfugle Nubby",
"NubbySkinName18","Glass Marble Nubby","Glaskugle Nubby",
"NubbySkinName19","Star-Employee Nubby","Stjernemedarbejder Nubby",
"NubbySkinName20","Car Nubby","Bil Nubby",

"NubbySkinDesc0","Nubby's classic look!","Nubbys klassiske udseende!",
"NubbySkinDesc1","This frog nubby was sent to us in the mail one day. We have no idea why this frog resembles nubby.","Denne frø nubby var sendt til os med posten en dag. Vi har ingen idé hvorfor denne frø ligner nubby.",
"NubbySkinDesc2","An endangered subspecies of nubbies, scientifically known as Nubbicus Aquaticus.","En truet underart af nubbier, videnskabeligt kendt som Nubbicus Aquaticus.",
"NubbySkinDesc3","A failed experiment, resulting from the factory's past attempts to tap into the cheese industry.","Et fejlet eksperiment, et resultat af fabrikkens tidligere forsøg på at komme ind i osteindustrien.",
"NubbySkinDesc4","This nubby stole factory money to follow his dreams at clown college.","Denne nubby stjal fabrikkens penge for at opfylde sin drømme på klovneuddannelsen.",
"NubbySkinDesc5","This nubby made his own cosplay and thinks he has cyborg strength. Just let the poor guy have a dream...","Denne nubby lavede sit eget kostume og tænker han har cyborg styrke. Bare lad den stakkels fyr drømme...",
"NubbySkinDesc6","This nubby is also a parasite in the metaphorical sense too. If he asks, don't lend him any money.","Denne nubby er også en parasit figurativt set. Hvis han spørger, giv ham ikke penge.",
"NubbySkinDesc7","In the nubby manufacturing process, things like this happen by accident sometimes.","I nubby fremstillingsprocessen, så sker disse ting ved uheld nogle gange.",
"NubbySkinDesc8","This nubby finds joy in Victorian Era live action roleplay. He's not hurting anyone so we let it happen.","Denne nubby får glæde ud af viktoriansk æra live skuespil. Han skader ikke nogen, så vi lader det ske.",
"NubbySkinDesc9","We keep this nubby around to celebrate employee birthdays. He's also super good at playing kazoo.","Vi beholder denne nubby for at fejre medarbejdernes fødselsdage. Han er også super god til at spille kazoo.",
"NubbySkinDesc10","Just for kicks, we sometimes make nubbies that can feel emotion. They all end up forming punk bands.","Bare for sjov, så laver vi nogle gange nubbier med følelser. De ender alle med at lave et punk band.",
"NubbySkinDesc11","The result of our attempts at making self replicating nubbies to save money.","Resultatet af vores forsøg på at lave selv replikerende nubbier for at spare på penge.",
"NubbySkinDesc12","Despite his appearance, this nubby is very mature and sophisticated if you get to know him.","Trods hans udseende, så er denne nubby meget moden og sofistikeret hvis du kender ham.",
"NubbySkinDesc13","Back when the number factory had a petting zoo, this nubby was super popular. Of course, that was before the incident...","Da talfabrikken havde et klap-dyr-område, så var denne nubby super populær. Selvfølgelig, det var før 'det' skete...",
"NubbySkinDesc14","One of the very first nubbies we cloned. Made way before we discovered their number harvesting capabilities.","Én af de allerførste nubbier vi klonede. Lavet langt før vi opdagede deres tal høstnings evner.",
"NubbySkinDesc15","Tony thinks it's really funny to brainwash nubbies into thinking he's god.","Tony synes det er meget sjovt at hjernevaske nubbier til at tænke at han er gud.",
"NubbySkinDesc16","The PR team requested a {b}wholesome{b} nubby mascot to slap on all of our advertising and merch to overshadow our non-wholesome practices.","PR holdet bad om en {b}hyggelig{b} nubby maskot til at putte alle vores reklamer og merch på for at overskygge vores uhyggelige praksisser.",
"NubbySkinDesc17","One year we dressed this nubby up as a butterfly for Halloween. Now we have leave the costume on him because he'll try to bite you if you get near him.","Et år klædet vi nubby ud som en sommerfugl til Halloween. Nu lader være kostumet på ham, fordi han bider hvis du kommer tæt på.",
"NubbySkinDesc18","This is just a souvenir that we sell to tourists at the number factory gift shop.","Det her er bare en souvenir, som vi sælger til turister ved talfabriks gavebutikken.",
"NubbySkinDesc19","This Nubby is an official star-employee at the number factory... Just like you!","Denne Nubby er en officel stjernemedarbejder ved tal fabrikken... Ligesom dig!",
"NubbySkinDesc20","This Nubby angered the car wizard and as punishment he was turned into a car. Despite his curse, he remains joyous.","Denne Nubby gjorde bil troldmanden vred, og blev straffet ved at blive forvandlet om til en bil. Trods hans forbandelse, så er han stadig glad.",

"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","This skin is a mystery...","Denne udklædning er et mysterie...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","Who knows what this could be...","Hvem ved hvad dette kan være...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","Oooh a mystery nubby...","Uuuh en mysterie nubby...",

"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 1","Lås denne op ved at slå Nubby Prøver Niveau 1",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 2","Lås denne op ved at slå Nubby Prøver Niveau 2",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 3","Lås denne op ved at slå Nubby Prøver Niveau 3",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_18","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 4","Lås denne op ved at slå Nubby Prøver Niveau 4",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_19","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 5","Lås denne op ved at slå Nubby Prøver Niveau 5",

"NubbySkinCredit","Made by {a}","Lavet af {a}",
"NubbySkinCredit_Concept","Concept by {a}","Koncept af {a}",

