"classicmode_description","Classic Mode:{a}------{a}*Achievements enabled.{a}*Random game seed.","Modo Normal:{a}------{a}*Logros permitidos.{a}*Semilla aleatoria.",
"abortround_btn","End!","¡Acabar!",
"txt_supervisor","Choose your supervisor!","¡Escoge tu supervisor!",
"unlock_supervisor_button","Unlock:","Desbloquear",
"supervisorname_tony","Tony","Toño",
"supervisorname_octopus","Octo-ny","Pulpoño",
"supervisorname_tonyjr","Tony Jr.","Toñín",
"supervisorname_goblin","Goblony","Duendoño",
"supervisorname_mutant","Mutant Tony","Toño mutante",
"supervisorname_glass","Glass Tony","Toño cristalino",
"supervisorname_hunter","Hunter Tony","Toño cazador",
"supervisorname_balogna","Balogna Tony","Toño mortadela",
"supervisorname_criminal","Criminal Tony","Toño criminal",
"supervisorname_ceo","C.E.O. Tony","Toño empresario",
"supervisorname_immortal","Immortal Toño","Tony inmortal",
"supervisorname_dwarf","Dwarf Tony","Toño enano",
"supervisordesc_tony","*The standard Nubby experience!","*Una partida de Nubby's de toda la vida.",
"supervisordesc_octopus","*Squids are {b}x more likely to appear in Nubby-Mart.{a}*Squids cost {c}% less.","*Los calamares son {b}x más propensos a aparecer en el Merca-Nubby.{a}*Los calamares cuestan un {c}% menos.",
"supervisordesc_tonyjr","*Start the game with {b} coins.{a}*You will enter Nubby-Mart when the game starts.{a}*Rare and ultra rare items are twice as likely to appear in shops.","*Empieza el juego con {b} monedas.{a}*Entrarás en el Merca-Nubby nada más comience la partida.{a}*Los objetos raros y ultra-raros aparecen el doble de veces en la tienda.",
"supervisordesc_goblin","*You receive +3 coins per restock instead of 1.{a}*Maximum coins limit is raised to {b}.{a}*You lose two lives when you launch Nubby.","Recibirás +3 monedas por reabastecimiento en lugar de 1.{a}*El límite de monedas crece hasta {b}.{a}*Perderás 2 vidas si lanzas a Nubby.",
"supervisordesc_mutant","*Items have two trigger types.{a}*For example, an item could trigger when the round goal is passed OR when Nubby dies.","*Los objetos se activan de dos maneras distintas.{a}*Por ejemplo;cuando el objetivo de la ronda está superado O cuando Nubby muere.",
"supervisordesc_glass","*Maximum lives capped at {b}.{a}*When an item triggers, it triggers twice.{a}*Perks and food items are unaffected.","La vida máxima es de {b}.{a}*Cuando activa un objeto, lo activa por duplicado.{a}*Los libros y la comida no se ven afectados.",
"supervisordesc_hunter","*Adds a moving target to the bottom of the pegboard.{a}*If Nubby hits the target, gain +{b} coins AND double total score.{a}*You cannot gain coins from restocks.","*Añade una diana en movimiento en el fondo de l tablero de pegs.{a}*Si Nubby choca contra ésta, gana +{b} monedas Y duplica la puntuación total.{a}*No puedes ganar monedas en los reabastecimientos.",
"supervisordesc_balogna","*Item and perk triggers are randomized at the start of the run. Don't question it.","*Las activaciones de los objetos y los libros son aleatorias desde el comienzo de la partida. No preguntes el porqué.",
"supervisordesc_criminal","*Black market items can appear in Nubby-Mart and mystery capsules. Black market items cost money in Nubby-Mart.","Los objetos del mercado negro pueden aparecer en el Merca-Nubby y en las cápsulas misteriosas. Los objetos del mercado negro cuestan dinero en el Merca-Nubby",
"supervisordesc_ceo","*Start game with {b} coins.{a}*You cannot gain more coins.","*Empiezas el juego con {b} monedas.{a}*No puedes ganar más monedas.",
"supervisordesc_immortal","*Replaces endless mode with prestige mode.{a}*When you win, you can prestige.{a}*This restarts the game and increases the difficulty for each prestige level.","*Reemplaza el modo infinito con el modo el modo prestigioso.{a}*Cuando ganas, obtienes prestigio.{a}*Esto reinicia la partida y aumenta la dificultad por cada nivel de prestigio.",
"supervisordesc_dwarf","*Every round, spawns helpful {b}Gem Pegs{b} and hurtful {b}Rock Pegs{b}.{a}*These pegs become very chaotic as the game progresses.{a}*No special events or bosses, except for the final boss.","Por cada ronda, hace aparecer {b}Gemas Peg{b} y molestas {b}Pegs roca {b}.{a}*Estas pegs se vuelven muy caóticas a medida que el juego progresa.{a}*No hay eventos especiales ni jefes, exceptuando el jefe final.",
"txt_nametag","Hello! My name is:","Hola! Mi nombre es:",
"svbtn_go","GO!","¡VAMOS!",
