"null","[#ffd500]Error: null","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc0","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Choca contra una peg cualquiera. Cuando esta peg explota, da el doble de puntos.",
"item_desc1","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimetiza el efecto de la última comida consumida sin mejorar{a}*Imitará: {c}{b}{c}. {d}",
"item_desc2","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quill that falls from the sky and pops {c} peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer {b} pluma que cae del cielo y hace explotar {c} peg.",
"item_desc3","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una peg cualquiera explotará junto con {b} (máximo) de las pegs cercanas.",
"item_desc4","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}*Por cada objeto de tu inventario da puntos los puntos equivalentes al número de una peg cualquiera.",
"item_desc5","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}meat-orb{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby sigue viviendo, hace aparecer {b}orbe de carne{b} que flotará golpeando pegs del tablero.{a}*Los orbes de carne mueren cuando muere Nubby.",
"item_desc6","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} de {c} posibilidades para duplicar TODAS las pegs.",
"item_desc7","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Maxes out at {b} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +1 moneda por cada fresa comida durante la partida.{a}*Tiene el tope en {b} monedas.",
"item_desc8","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot shots{b} that pop any pegs they pass through.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una peg cualquiera emitirá {c} {b}moco dispara{b} que choca con todas las pegs que atraviesa.",
"item_desc9","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer una pajita que choca con una peg.{a}*Pegs golpeadas por las pajitas ganan un valor adicional del +{b}% de su #.{a}*Gana +{c}% por cada vez que hayas mezclado pegs en la partida.",	
"item_desc10","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to double the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Todas las pegs darán el doble de puntos de la peg de menor valor.",
"item_desc11","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de causar una explosión gigante que choca con todas las pegs 1 vez.{a}*{c}% de posibilidades si es tu último lanzamiento.",
"item_desc12","[#ffffff]{a}*Every empty peg space will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada espacio vacío dará puntos equivalentes al números de pegs que chocaron contra Nubby en esta ronda.",
"item_desc13","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the right-most item in your inventory.{a}*Deletes the left-most item in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Mejora el objeto de la derecha del todo de tu inventario.{a}*Borra el objeto de la izquierda del todo de tu inventario.",
"item_desc14","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Choca {b} peg cualquiera.",
"item_desc15","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiplica los puntos totales en {b}x",
"item_desc16","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby da puntos como veces botara en esta ronda.",
"item_desc17","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sharp-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer un disparo afilado que chocará con una peg cualquiera {b} veces.",
"item_desc18","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +1 {b}Libro del Cruasán{b}.",
"item_desc19","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives a copy of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Da una copia del libro conseguido de forma más reciente.{a}(Actualmente {b})",
"item_desc20","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an egg missile that falls from the sky and causes an explosion that pops a row of pegs.","*Si Nubby sigue vivo, hace aparecer una bomba huevo que cae desde el cielo y causa una explosión que choca contra una fila de pegs.",
"item_desc21","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the lowest # peg twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Choca contra la peg de menor valor dos veces.",
"item_desc22","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{d}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de no hacer nada.{a}*{c}% de posibilidades de duplicar una peg cualquiera.{a}*{d}% de posibilidades de dividir el valor de la peg por la mitad.",
"item_desc23","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +{b} puntos por cada vez que este objeto ha sido activado durante esta ronda.{a}*{c} en {d} posibilidades de realizar la metamorfosis.",
"item_desc24","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}%de posibilidades de tirar un calambrazo que choca contra un puñado de pegs.",
"item_desc25","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}meat-orbs{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby sigue vivo, hace aparecer {c} {b}orbes cárnicos{b} que flotan por ahí chocando contra pegs.{a}*Los orbes cárnicos desaparecen cuando Nubby muere.",
"item_desc26","[#ffffff]{a}*Test{b}","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc27","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs will copy the # of the first peg popped.{a}*If this item is in slot #{c}, {d} pegs will be affected instead of {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} pegs aleatorias copiarán el valor de la primera peg contra la que se chocó Nubby.{a}*Si este objeto está en la ranura #{c}, {d} pegs serán afectadas en lugar de {b}.",
"item_desc28","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +{b} puntos por cada vez que este objeto fue activado durante esta ronda.",
"item_desc29","[#ffffff]{a}*Every peg will give points equal to {b}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada peg dará puntos en función del {b}% de su valor.",
"item_desc30","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles a random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Duplica una peg cualquiera.",
"item_desc31","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into the non-upgraded version of the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Muta en la versión sin mejorar del [#ffb3ff]OBJETO A MI IZQUIERDA[#ffffff] por el resto de la ronda.",
"item_desc32","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a pulse that doubles pegs within close range.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una peg cualquiera emite un pulso que duplica pegs en un radio cercano.",
"item_desc33","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emits a burst of nuclear waste.{a}*Nuclear waste pops any pegs it touches.{a}*If Nubby isn't alive, a random peg will emit the burst.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emite radiación de residuos nucleares ingeridos.{a}*La radiación choca contra cualquier peg que toque.{a}*If Nubby muere, una peg cualquiera emitirá la radiación.",
"item_desc34","[#ffffff]{a}*Marks a random peg.{a}*When a peg is marked, all pegs that have the same number will be doubled.{a}*If no pegs have the same number as the marked peg, a random peg will be doubled.","[#ffffff]{a}*Marca una peg cualquiera.{a}*Cuando esté marcada, todas las pegs que tengan su mismo número lo duplicarán.{a}*Si ninguna peg  tiene el mismo número, ésta se duplicará.",
"item_desc35","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs get smacked.{a}*When a peg is smacked, it counts as a {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg halved [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] trigger without actually halving it.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} una peg cualquiera se da una palmada .{a}*Cuando esto pasa, cuenta como una {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg con valor partido [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] se activa sin que se tenga que partir realmente.",
"item_desc36","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for each remaining life.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +1 moneda por cada vida restante.",
"item_desc37","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles {c} random pegs whose # is less than {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Duplica {c} pegs aleatorias cuyo valor sea menor que {b}.",
"item_desc38","[#ffffff]{a}*50% chance to double total coins.{a}*50% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*50% de posibilidades de duplicar las monedas totales.{a}*50% de posibilidades de hacerlas esfumar.",
"item_desc39","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random common item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Muta en un objeto común cualquiera que no esté en tu inventario por el resto de la ronda.",
"item_desc40","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de duplicar una peg cualquiera.",
"item_desc41","[#ffffff]{a}*Halves the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times","[#ffffff]{a}*Divide a la mitad el valor de la peg con mayor valor.{a}*Duplica el valor de la peg con menor valor {b} veces",
"item_desc42","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay balls.{a}*If a clay ball bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay balls die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer {b} bolas de plastilina.{a}*Si una bola de plastilina bota contra la pared O una peg, contará como una [#ffd500]{d}Nubby golpea la pared [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]se activa.{a}*Las bolas de plastilina desaparecen después de {c} botes.",
"item_desc43","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita the efecto del objeto sin mejorar del objeto en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#ffffff], pero conserva su objeto.",
"item_desc44","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +{b} puntos.{a}*Si estás en la ronda {d} o superior, gana +{c} puntos en su lugar.",
"item_desc45","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +1 {b}Libro Kebab{b}",
"item_desc46","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Aparece un objeto de comida raro.",
"item_desc47","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si la primera peg golpeada es la peg de mayor valor, multiplica la puntuación total por {b}x",
"item_desc48","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Choca con {b} pegs aleatorias.",
"item_desc49","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg becomes a copy of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*La peg de menor valor se convierte en la de mayor valor.",
"item_desc50","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +1 reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada vez que se entre de nuevo al Merca-Nubby, gana 1 reabastecimiento.",
"item_desc51","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduce el objetivo de ronda en un -{b}%.{a}*Divide a la mitad todas las pegs.",
"item_desc52","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers an electron beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an electron beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Electron beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa un haz de electrones que viaja entre las pegs.{a}*Cuando un electrón golpea una peg,ésta dará {b}% de su #.{a}*El haz de electrones NO golpean las pegs.",
"item_desc53","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits a god ray.{a}*The god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Este objeto emite un rayo divino.{a}*Este rayo divino golpea una peg cualquiera rápidamente cada vez que el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #1 [#ffffff]ha sido activado durante esta ronda.",
"item_desc54","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa el libro de adquisición más reciente.{a}(Actualmente {b})",
"item_desc55","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*La peg de menor valor da los puntos equivalentes a {b}x su valor.{a}*Si la peg de menor valor es de {d} puntos o menos, dará +{c} puntos en su lugar.",
"item_desc56","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*hace apaqrecer una pelota de playa que emite {b} serpentinas de confetti cuando choca.{a}*Las pegs golpeadas con confetti dan {c}% fe su valor.",
"item_desc57","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc58","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to a copy of himself.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby da a luz una copia de sí mismo.",
"item_desc59","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de duplicar la peg de mayor valor.",
"item_desc60","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Emite rastros de icor por cada {b} veces que Nubby haya muerto en esta partida.{a}*Cuando una peg es golpeada por el icor, [#ffd500]{c}Pasa el objetivo de la ronda [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] objetos y libros se activarán.{a}(Actualmente emite {d})",
"item_desc61","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all items in your inventory... Good luck!","[#ffffff]{a}*Sustituye todos los objetos de tu inventario por otros cualquiera...Suerte!",
"item_desc62","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Contiene un objeto cualquiera del Merca-Nubby.",
"item_desc63","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Contiene un objeto cualquiera item from del mercado negro.",
"item_desc64","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common food item.","[#ffffff]*Contiene una comida cualquiera.",
"item_desc65","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*Por cada vez que el tablero haya sido reabastecido en esta partida, gana +{b} puntos.{a}(Actualmente +{c} puntos)",
"item_desc66","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una peg culaquiera emite un {b}Rayo Cósmico{b}.{a}*Cuando una peg es golpeada por un Rayo Cósmico, cuenta como {c} peg popeadas en lugar de 1.",
"item_desc67","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cuando se fuerza su activación, se la transfiere sl [#ffb3ff]OBJETO DE MI IZQUIERDA[#ffffff].{a}*Tiene un {c}% de posibilidades de añadir 1 activación adicional.",
"item_desc68","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points four times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Golpea una peg cualquiera. Cuando esta peg es golpeada, dará cuatro veces puntos.",
"item_desc69","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc70","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quills that fall from the sky and pop {c} peg each.{a}*10% chance to summon one additional quill (3 total).","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer {b} púas que caen del cielo y golpean {c} pegs.{a}*10% de posibilidades de hacer aparecer una púa adicional (3 en total).",
"item_desc71","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una pop cualquiera explotará y dará a {b} (máximo) pegs cercanas.",
"item_desc72","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to double the value of a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada objeto en tu inventario da puntos por el doble del valor de una peg cualquiera.",
"item_desc73","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}disease-orb{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby sigue vivo, hace aparecer un {b}orbe ponzoñoso{b} que agresivamente flota por ahí agrediendo pegs chocando con ellas.{a}*Los orbes ponzoñosos mueren cuando Nubby muere.",
"item_desc74","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.{a}*{d} in {e} chance to double all pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} en {c} de posibilidades de duplicar TODAS las pegs.{a}*{d} en {e} de posibilidades de duplicar todas las pegs 2 veces.",
"item_desc75","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc76","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot rockets{b} that pop any pegs they pass through twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una peg cualquiera emitirá {c} {b}mocos cohete{b} que golpearán dos veces cada peg con las que se cruzaran.",
"item_desc77","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*+Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","Hace aparecer una pajita que golpea una peg.{a}*Pegs golpeadas por pajitas dan un +{b}% adicional de su valor.{a}*+Gana +{c}% por cada vez que hayas mezclado pegs en esta partida.",
"item_desc78","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to quadruple the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Todas las pegs darán puntos equivalentes al cuádruple del número de la peg de menor valor.",
"item_desc79","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de causar una explosión gigante que golpea todas las pegs una vez.{a}*{c}% de posibilidades si es tu último tiro.",
"item_desc80","[#ffffff]{a}*ALL peg spaces will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*TODOS los espacios para pegs darán puntos en equivalencia al total de pegs que hayan sido golpeadas en esta ronda.",
"item_desc81","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items in your inventory.{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Intercambia azarosamente las habilidades de todos los objetos en tu inventario.{a}*Este cambio no puede ser deshecho.",
"item_desc82","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Golpea {b} pegs cualquiera.",
"item_desc83","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiplica el total de puntos por {b}x.",
"item_desc84","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to double the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby da puntos en equivalencia al doble de veces que Nubby haya botado en esta ronda.",
"item_desc85","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sword-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer una espada corta que golpeará una peg cualquiera {b} veces.",
"item_desc86","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc87","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc88","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an ostrich-egg missile that falls from the sky an causes an explosion that pops 1 row and 1 column of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby sigue vivo, hace aparecer un huevo bomba de avestruz que cae del cielo y causa una explosión que golpea 1 fila y 1 columna de pegs.",
"item_desc89","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the two lowest # pegs, twice each.","[#ffffff]{a}*Golpea las dos pegs de menor valor, dos veces cada una.",
"item_desc90","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{d}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de no hacer nada.{a}*{c}% de posibilidades de to duplicar una peg cualquiera.{a}*{d}% de posibilidades de dividir a la mitadf el valor de una peg cualquiera.",
"item_desc91","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +{b} puntos por cada vez que este objeto ha sido activado durante la ronda.{a}*{c} entre {d} de posibilidades de metamorforsizar.",
"item_desc92","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a high-voltage chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de crear una cadena de alto voltaje que golpea un conjunto de pegs dos veces.",
"item_desc93","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}disease-orbs{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby vivo, hace aparecer un {c} {b}orbe ponzoñoso{b} que flotará agresivamente por ahí agrediendo pegs.{a}*Los orbes ponzoñosos mueren si Nubby muere.",
