"item_desc96","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +{b} puntos por cada vez que este objeto ha sido activado durante esta ronda.",
"item_desc97","[#ffffff]{a}*Every peg will give points equal to {b}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada peg dará un {b}% de su valor.",
"item_desc98","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles a random peg twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Duplica una peg cualquiera dos veces.",
"item_desc99","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into the upgraded version of the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME [#ffffff] for the rest of the round","[#ffffff]{a}*Transmuta en la versión mejorada de [#ffb3ff]EL OBJETO A MI IZQUIERDA [#ffffff] por el resto de la ronda",
"item_desc100","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a super pulse that doubles pegs within close range twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una peg cualquiera emite un super pulso que duplica pegs de un rango cercano dos veces.",
"item_desc101","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emits a burst of bouncy {b}unstable waste{b}.{a}*Unstable waste bounces and pops any pegs it touches.{a}*If Nubby isn't alive, a random peg will emit the burst.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emite un haz de {b} residuos inestables{b}.{a}*Los residuos inestables botan y golpean cada peg con la que se encuentran .{a}*Si Nubby ha muerto, una peg cualquiera emitirá el haz.",
"item_desc102","[#ffffff]{a}*Marks a random peg.{a}*When a peg is marked, all pegs that have the same number will be doubled twice.{a}*If no pegs have the same number as the marked peg, a random peg will be doubled twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Marca una peg cualquiera.{a}*Cuando la peg esté marcada,todas las pegs que tengan el mismo número serán duplicadas dos veces.{a}*Si ninguna peg tienen el mismo número, una peg cualquiera hará esto.",
"item_desc103","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs get smacked twice.{a}*When a peg is smacked, it counts as a {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg halved [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] trigger without actually halving it.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} pegs cualquiera son defenestradas.{a}*Cuando una peg es defenestrada, cuenta como una {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg de valor partido [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] se activa sin tener que partirla a la mitad.",
"item_desc104","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc105","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles {c} random pegs whose # is less than {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Duplica {c} pegs cualquiera cuyo valor es menor que {b}.",
"item_desc106","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc107","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random rare or ultra-rare item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Se transforma en un objeto raro o ultrarraro que no esté en tu inventario por el resto de la ronda.",
"item_desc108","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de duplicar una peg cualquiera.",
"item_desc109","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% chance to halve the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% de posibilidades de partir la peg de mayor valor a la mitad.{a}*Duplica la peg de menor valor {b} veces.",
"item_desc110","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay prisms.{a}*If a clay prism bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay prisms die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer {b} prismas de arcilla .{a}*Si el prisma de arcilla choca contra el muro O peg, contará como un [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Los prismas de arcilla mueren tras {c} botes.",
"item_desc111","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita el efecto mejorado del objeto en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#ffffff], pero conserva su propia activación.",
"item_desc112","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +{b} puntos.{a}*Si estás en la ronda {d} o superior, gana +{c} puntos en su lugar.",
