"item_desc116","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs, twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Golpea {b} pegs cualquiera,dos veces.",
"item_desc117","[#ffffff]{a}*The two lowest # pegs become copies of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Las dos pegs de menor valor se vuelven copias de la peg de mayor valor.",
"item_desc118","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc119","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduce el objetivo de ronda en un {b}%.{a}*Divide a la mitad todas las pegs.",
"item_desc120","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers a hyper-beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an hyper-beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Hyper-beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa un hiper-haz que traspasa las pegs.{a}*Cuando el hiper-haz golpea una peg, la peg recibirá {b}% de su valor.{a}*El hiper-haz NO golpea a las pegs.",
"item_desc121","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits two god rays.{a}*Each god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Este objeto emite dos rayos divinos.{a}*Cada rayo divino rapidamente golpea una peg cualquiera por cada vez que el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #1 [#ffffff]ha sido activado en esta ronda.",
"item_desc122","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk twice.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa el libro obtenido más recientemente .{a}(Actualmente: {b})",
