"item_desc124","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a MEGA beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer una MEGA bola de playa que emite {b} rayas de conffeti cuando choca.{a}*Las pegs golpeadas por el confetti dan {c}% de su valor.",
"item_desc125","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty Description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
