"item_desc128","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Emite un rayo de icor que por cada {b} que Nubby haya muerto en esta partida.{a}*Cuando una peg es golpeada por el icor, [#ffd500]{c}Pasa el objetivo de ronda [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] objetos y libros serán activados.{a}(Actualmente emite {d})",
