"item_desc141","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Contiene una comida rara.",
"item_desc142","[#ffffff]*Contains a copy of a random item in your inventory.{a}*If you have no items, this will give a random common item.","[#ffffff]*Contiene una copia de un objeto cualquiera de tu inventario.{a}*Si no tienes objetos, te dará un objeto común cualquiera.",
"item_desc143","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Contiene un objeto ultrarraro del Merca-Nubby.",
"item_desc144","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Contiene un objeto ultrarraro del mercado negro.",
"item_desc145","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Contiene una comida ultrarrara.",
