"item_desc147","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da un reabastecimiento del café extra.",
"item_desc148","[#ffffff]{a}*Deletes the left-most item.{a}*The right-most item transforms into a squid.{a}*If the right-most item is upgraded, it transforms into an upgraded squid.","[#ffffff]{a}*Borra el objeto que esté más a la derecha.{a}*Éste se transformará en un calamar.{a}*Si está mejorado, se transformará en un calamar mejorado.",
"item_desc149","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de forzar la activación de [#ffb3ff]LOS OBJETOS A MI IZQUIERDA Y DERECHA [#ffffff].{a}*Las posibilidades disminuyen en un {c}% por cada vez que se active.{a}*Las posibilidades se reestablecen al {b}% cuando termina la ronda.",
"item_desc150","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de forzar la activación de [#ffb3ff]LOS OBJETOS A MI IZQUIERDA Y DERECHA [#ffffff].{a}*Las posibilidades disminuyen en un {c}% por cada vez que se active.{a}*Las posibilidades se reestablecen al {b}% cuando termina la ronda.",
"item_desc151","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Todas los libros activan el [#ffb3ff]OBJETO A MI IZQUIERDA[#ffffff] una vez.",
"item_desc152","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.{a}*Each perk has a {b}% chance to force trigger the item twice instead of once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Todas los libros activan el [#ffb3ff]OBJETO A MI IZQUIERDA[#ffffff] una vez.{a}*Cada libro tiene un {b}% de posibilidades de activar el objeto dos veces en lugar de una.",
"item_desc153","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita el efecto de la comida ingerida más recientemente{a}*Imitará: {c}{b}{c}. {d}",
"item_desc154","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Can give up to {c} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +{b} monedas por cada fresa ingerida en esta partida.{a}*Tiene un tope de {c} monedas.",
"item_desc155","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the two right-most items in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Mejora los dos objetos puestos más hacia la derecha.",
"item_desc156","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Jelly-Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +1 {b}Libro del Cruasán Gelatinoso{b}.",
"item_desc157","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives two copies of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Da dos copias del libro obtenido más recientemente.{a}(Actualmente {b})",
"item_desc158","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for each remaining life.{a}*Bonus +{c} coins if you have all lives remaining.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +{b} monedas por cada vida restante.{a}*Además da +{c} monedas extra si conservas todas las vidas.",
"item_desc159","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double total coins.{a}*{c}% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de duplicar las monedas totales.{a}*{c}% de posibilidades de dejar las monedas en 0.",
"item_desc160","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Spicy Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +1 {b}Libro del Kebab Picante{b}",
"item_desc161","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer una comida rara aleatoria y mejorada.",
"item_desc162","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +{b} rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hasta que se vuelva al Merca-Nubby, gana +{b} reabastecimientos.",
"item_desc163","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all common items in your inventory.{a}*Rare and ultra-rare items are unaffected.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cambia todos los objetos comunes de tu inventario.{a}*Raros y ultrarraros no se ven afectados.",
"item_desc164","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items except the [#ffb3ff]ITEM IN SLOT #1[#ffffff].{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Aleatoriza todas las activaciones de los objetos exceptuando el [#ffb3ff]OBJETO EN LA RANURA #1[#ffffff].{a}*Esta carga no volverá a ser la original.",
"item_desc165","[#ffffff]{a}*Permanently upgrades all foods that are currently available for purchase.{a}*From now on, these items will only appear as their upgraded version.","[#ffffff]{a}*Permanente mejora todas las comidas que puedas obtener en ese momento.{a}*Desde ahora, todas las comidas se verán con su versión mejorada.",
"item_desc166","[#ffffff]{a}*Restores +1 life and gives +2 rerolls in the cafe.","[#ffffff]{a}*Restaura +1 vida y da +2 reabastecimientos en el café.",
"item_desc167","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gaina +{b}%de posibilidades por objetos raros en todas las tiendas.",
"item_desc168","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer una comida rara o ultrarrara.",
"item_desc169","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +{b} additional times per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Puedes cambiar de sitio pegs +{b} veces más por turno.",
"item_desc170","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +2 cafe nubby rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +2 creabastecimientos del café.",
"item_desc171","[#ffffff]{a}*Creates an upgraded squid in the right-most empty item slot in your inventory.{a}*If you have no empty item slots, this does nothing.","[#ffffff]{a}*Crea un calamar en la ranura vacía posicionada más a la derecha de tu inventario.{a}*Si no tienes ranuras vacías, no hará nada.",
"item_desc172","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits an anti-particle that halves the first peg it hits.","[#ffffff]{a}*Emite una antipartícula que divide a la mitad la primera peg que toca.",
"item_desc173","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped was NOT the highest # peg, {b} random pegs become 1-pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si la primera peg golpeada NO es la peg de mayor valor {b} pegs cualesquieran valdrán 1.",
"item_desc174","[#ffffff]{a}*Destroys [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].","[#ffffff]{a}*Destruye [#ffb3ff]AMOBOS OBJETOS DE MI IZQUIERDA Y DERECHA[#ffffff].",
"item_desc175","[#ffffff]{a}*If the round goal has been passed more than once, this kills nubby. (This is an extremely painful death for him)","[#ffffff]{a}*Si el objetivo de la ronda es pasado en más de una ocasión, estao matará a Nubby.(Esto es abrumadoramente doloroso para él)",
"item_desc176","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Pierdes {b}% de todos tus puntos.",
"item_desc177","[#ffffff]{a}*Disables the left-most non-disabled item, besides itself. (Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.)","[#ffffff]{a}*Inutiliza el objeto a la izquierda, además de a si mismo. (Los objetos desactivados no se podrán activar po el resto de la ronda.)",
"item_desc178","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons an eggsac.{a}*Eggsacs bounce and pop pegs like Nubby.{a}*Pegs popped by eggsacs give NO points!","[#ffffff]{a}*Hace aparecer un saco de huevos.{a}*Botan como Nubby.{a}*Las pegs golpeadas por los sacos de huevos NO dan puntos!",
"item_desc179","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Reemplaza the objeto de más a la derecha por el último objeto obtenido en el Merca-Nubby o en el mercado negro.{a}(Actualmente: {b})",
"item_desc180","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the upgraded version of the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Reemplaza the objeto de más a la derecha por la versión mejorada del último objeto obtenido en el Merca-Nubby o en el mercado negro.{a}(Actualmente: {b})",
"item_desc181","[#ffffff]{a}*A giant finger appears over the first peg popped's column.{a}*All pegs in this column subtract points equal to their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un dedo gigante aparece en la columna de la primera peg golpeada.{a}*Todas las pegs en esa columna restarán puntos equivalentes a su valor",
"item_desc182","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Pierde {b}% de sus puntos totales.",
"item_desc183","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
