"perk_name30","The Croissant Perk","El Libro Cruasán",
"perk_name31","The Jelly-Croissant Perk","El Libro del Cruasán con Mermelada",
"perk_name32","The Spicy Kebab Perk","El Libro del Kabab Picante",
"perk_desc0","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Empty perk description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"perk_desc1","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items.{a}*Disables the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa todos los objetos.{a}*Desactiva el objeto en [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6].",
"perk_desc2","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the right-most item in your inventory.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de activar el objeto que esté más a la derecha.",
"perk_desc3","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de activar el objeto de la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{c}[#e6ffe6].",	
"perk_desc4","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the round started less than {b} seconds ago, force-triggers the items in slots [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #1, #2, and #3[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si la ronda comienzó hace {b} segundos, activa los objetos en ranuras [#ffb3ff] #1, #2, y #3[#e6ffe6].",
"perk_desc5","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa el objeto en [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6].",
"perk_desc6","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa todos los objetos.",
"perk_desc7","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items in odd-numbered slots.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa todos los objetos en ranuras impares.",
"perk_desc8","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers one random item.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa un objeto cualquiera de los tenidos.",
"perk_desc9","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all {b}[#ffd500]First peg popped [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Fuerza todos {b}[#ffd500]Primera peg golpeada [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} objetos.",
"perk_desc10","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de activar el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{c}[#e6ffe6].",
"perk_desc11","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #5.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa el objeto en la ranura #5.",
"perk_desc12","[#e6ffe6]{a}If [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] is empty...{a}*A random item from nubby-mart will appear in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] and force-trigger {c} times.{a}*The new item will disappear at the end of the round.","[#e6ffe6]{a}Si la[#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6] está vacía...{a}*Un objeto culaquiera del MercaNubbys aparecerá en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6] y activa {c} veces.{a}*El nuevo objeto desaparecerá al final de la ronda",
"perk_desc13","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], 3 times.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa el objeto de la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6], 3 veces.",		
"perk_desc14","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 time for every {c} coins you have.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 vez por cada {c} moneda que tienes.",
"perk_desc15","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the items in slots [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #5, #6, and #7[#e6ffe6], {b} times each.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa los objetos en ranuras [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #5, #6, y #7[#e6ffe6], {b} veces de cada.",
"perk_desc16","[#e6ffe6]{a}If you have 4 or less items... {a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], {c} times","[#e6ffe6]{a}Si tienes 4 o menos objetos... {a}*Activa el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6], {c} veces",
"perk_desc17","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the round goal was passed {b} or more times, force-triggers all items and lose {c}% of total points.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si el objetivo de la ronda se consigue {b} o más veces, activa todos los objetos y pierde el {c}% de los puntos totales.",
"perk_desc18","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If you have passed the round goal this round, force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], twice.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si has pasado el objetivo de ronda en esta tirada, activa el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6], dos veces.",
"perk_desc19","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the leftmost item x times.{a}*Jumbling pegs increases x by +{b}.{a}*This value resets after each round.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa el objeto de más a la izquierda x veces.{a}*Pegs mezcladas aumentan x por +{b}.{a}*Este valor se resetea en el fin de la ronda.",
"perk_desc20","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the left-most item in your inventory.{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#e6ffe6]{a}Activa el objeto más a la derecha.{a}*Pierde {b}% de tus puntos totales.",
"perk_desc21","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all {b}[#ffd500]x pegs popped [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Fuerza todos {b}[#ffd500]x pegs golpeadas [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} objetos.",
"perk_desc22","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items that summon anything.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Fuerzan todos los objetos que hagan aparecer algo.",
"perk_desc23","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the first peg popped was the highest # peg, force-triggers the items in [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #1, and #2[#e6ffe6], {b} times each.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si la primera peg golpeada es la de mayor valor, activa los objetos en [#ffb3ff]RANURAS #1, y #2[#e6ffe6], {b} veces cada uno.",
"perk_desc24","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 2 times for each empty inventory slot.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6] 2 veces por cada espacio vacío en el inventario.",
"perk_desc25","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 time for each perk you have.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Fuerza el objeto en la ranura [#ffb3ff]RANURA #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 vez por cada libro tenido.",
"perk_desc26","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all non-upgraded items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa todos los objetos sin mejorar.",
"perk_desc27","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force triggers all {b}[#ffd500]Nubby Dies [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items again.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Fuerza todos {b}[#ffd500]Nubby muere [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} objetos otra vez.",
"perk_desc28","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #{b}, 1 time for every {c} food items you've consumed.{a}(Foods eaten: {d})","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Fuerza el objeto en la ranura #{b}, 1 vez por cada {c} comidas que hayas consumido.{a}(Comidas consumida: {d})",
"perk_desc29","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #{b}, 1 time for every {c} rounds you've passed.{a}(Current force-triggers: {d})","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Fuerza el objeto en la ranura #{b}, 1 por cada {c} rondas que hayas pasado.{a}(Activaciones actuales: {d})",
"perk_desc30","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Has an x% chance to force-trigger the item in slot #{b}.{a}*For each remaining life, gain +{c}% odds.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Tiene un x% de posibilidades de activar el objeto en la ranura #{b}.{a}*Por cada vida restante, gana +{c}% de posibilidades.",
"perk_desc31","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Has an x% chance to force-trigger the item in slot #{b}.{a}*For each remaining life, gain +{c}% odds.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Tiene x% de posibilidades de activar el objeto en la ranura #{b}.{a}*Por cada vida restante, gana +{c}% de posibilidades.",
"perk_desc32","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the right-most item in your inventory.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de posibilidades de activar el objeto colocado más hacia la derecha de tu inventario.",
"rareitemodds","Rare Item Odds: {a}%","Saldrá objeto raro: {a}%",
