"finalbossevent_name1","Apocalypse!","¡Apocalipsis!",
"finalbossevent_name2","Go To Hell!","¡Vete al infierno!",
"finalbossevent_name3","Tony!?!?","¿¡¿¡Antonio!?!?",
"finalboss_desc1","Blood drops will rapidly rain down from above and halve the first peg they come in contact with.","Caerá sangre del mismísimo cielo, devaluando las pegs que toque a la mitad.",
"finalboss_desc2","The side walls of the factory turn into brimstone. When Nubby hits brimstone, lose {a}% of your total points","Los muros que limitan la fábrica se convierten en azufre demoníaco.Cuando Nubby toca el azufre, pierde el {a}% de sus puntos totales",
"finalboss_desc3","Tony shoots lazers from his eyes! If a peg is hit by a lazer, its number will be reduced to 1.","¡Antonio dispara rayos láser por los ojos! Si una peg es golpeada por los rayos láser, su valor será de 1.",
"shoperror1","All item slots full.{a}Sell items to make room!{a}{a}[Press {b} items to sell]","Todas las ranuras de objetos están llenas.{a}¡Vende algún objeto para hacer espacio!{a}{a}[Presiona {b} objetos para vender]",
"shoperror4","Too poor! Get more money to buy this!","¡Demasiado pobre! ¡Gana más dinero para comprarlo!",				
"shoperror6","Drag and drop an item over this button to freeze them!{a}(Frozen items won't go away when you reroll or leave the shop.)","¡Arrastra y suelta un objeto para congelarlo!{a}(Los objetos congelados no se perderán en reabastecimientos de tienda o al irse de ella.)",
"shoperror7","Beat the game at least once to unlock!","¡Gana por lo menos una partida para desbloquear!",
"shoperror8","Must play at least one game to unlock!","¡Juega una partida para ganar!",
"shoperror9","Not enough stars! Play the game and take on challenges to get stars!","¡Sin suficientes estrellas! ¡Juega al juego para obtenerlas!",
"shoperror10","Stars are a currency used to unlock things. You can obtain stars by doing well in-game!","Las estrellas son una moneda para desbloquear cosas. ¡Se obtienen teniendo una buena partida!",
"shoperror11","Your autosaved run is no longer compatible in the current game version.","Tu partida autoguardada ya no es compatible con la versión actual del juego.",
"shoperror12","You must beat the previous difficulty level to unlock!","¡Vence el nivel previo de dificultad para desbloquear!",
"pausemenuerror1","The round must be over to save and quit.","La ronda debe terminar para guardar y salir",
"lootdirections","Click to open!","¡Click para abrir!",
"bmdoorprompt","A mysterious door appears...","Una misteriosa puerta aparece...",
"bmdoor_usekey","Use key?","¿Usar llave?",
"perkwarning","Note: Perks are permanent. You cannot sell or get rid of them.","Nota: Los libros son permanentes. No puedes venderlos ni deshacerte de ellos.",
"nohighscore","Score: {b}{a}Highscore: {c}","Puntuación: {b}{a}Mejor puntuación: {c}",
"highscore","New Highscore!{a}{b}","¡Nuevo Récord!{a}{b}",
"nohighscore_challenge","Score: {b}{a}Challenge Highscore: {c}","Puntuación: {b}{a}Mejor puntuación del desafío: {c}",
"supervisor_highscore","Highscore: {a}","Récord: {a}",
"highscore_challenge","New Challenge Highscore!{a}{b}","¡Nuevo Récord del Desafío!{a}{b}",
"btn_gainslot","+1 item slot!","¡+1 ranura de objeto!",
"btn_bm_enter","Enter?","¿Entrar?",
"soldout","Sold out!","¡Sin existencias!",
"newgame","New{a}Game!","¡Nueva{a}Partida!",
"roundinfo","Round {a}","Ronda {a}",
"tut1","Hey. You must be the new employee they were telling me about.","Ei. Debes ser el nuevo empleado del que me hablaron.",		
"tut2","My name is Tony and I'm gonna be your supervisor.","Me llamo Antonio y voy a ser tu supervisor.",		
"tut3","My job is to show you how to run the factory.","Mi trabajo es enseñarte como funciona la fábrica.",	
"tut4","I don't really care about your name or anything so let's just get into this.","Me da igual como te llames, así que te voy a poner a trabajar por el salario mínimo cuanto antes",		
"tut5","First things first, welcome aboard to Nubby's Number Factory - the world's leading number manufacturer!","Pero primero de todo, bienvenido a la Factoría de Números de Nubby- ¡la productora mundial de cifras!",	
"tut6","This is the main control center of the factory.","Este es el centro de control principal de la fábrica.",		
"tut7","Your first task is to launch our mascot, Nubby, down the peg board.","Tu primera tarea será lanzar a nuestra mascota,Nubby, al tablero de pegs.",		
"tut8","Hold down [{a}] and press [{b}] to launch Nubby.","Mantén presionado [{a}] y presiona [{b}] para lanzar a Nubby.",		
"tut9","Wow, you're really good at this.","No se te da nada mal.",		
"tut10","At this factory, your only job is to make big numbers...","En esta fábrica, tu único trabajo es hacer números grandes...",		
"tut11","By launching Nubby at these pegs, you will earn however many points are shown on the peg.","Lanzando a Nubby a estas pegs,conseguirás los puntos indicados en la peg.",		
"tut12","This number shows how many points you made in a round.","Este número muestra cuántos puntos hiciste en una ronda",		
"tut13","The number on the bottom is the goal. If you beat the goal, the board will restock.","El número de abajo es el objetivo de ronda. Si lo consigues, el tablero se reabastecerá",		
"tut14","If you get a REALLY high score, the board can restock multiple times in a single round.","Si consigues una puntuación MUY alta, el tablero puede reabastecerse múltiples veces.",		
"tut15","Oh wait.. I forgot to tell you what a restock even is!","Bueno para... ¡Qué no te conté que es siquiera el reabastecimiento!",		
"tut16","Well listen up, because restocks are an important thing!","¡Toma nota que esto es importante!",		
"tut17","When the board restocks, a bunch of NEW pegs will fall from the sky and fill all your empty spaces.","Cuando el tablero se reabastece, un puñado de NUEVAS pegs caerán del cielo y llenarán tus espacios vacíos.",
"tut18","Soon after, pairs of pegs with the same number will merge into one greater peg.","Antes o después,parejas de pegs del mismo número se fusionarán en uno mayor."		
"tut19","Let's try it out. Keep launching Nubby until you beat the goal.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]","Vamos a darle un intento. Sigue tirando a Nubby hasta lograr la meta.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]",		
"tut20","You can do better than that. Do it again.","Mi abuela podría hacerlo mejor. ¡Hazlo o estás despedido!",		
"tut21","Pegtacular! That was pegalicious! You're a star!","¡Espegtacular! ¡Eso ha sido peglicioso! ¡Grande empleado por el sueldo mínimo!",		
"tut22","Just kidding, no you're not.","Nah, coña. En verdad das vergüenza ajena.",	
"tut23","Ok. We're almost done. To rearrange your new pegs, press the jumble button.","En fin, ya casi acabamos.Para cambiar la posición de las pegs con el botón de remezclar las pegs.",		
"tut24","Nice. Launch Nubby one more time [{a}] + [{b}]. I wanna show you something.","Bien. Lanza a Nubby una vez más [{a}] + [{b}]. Quiero enseñarte algo.",		
"tut25","So you might have noticed that Nubby goes through some pegs, but not others.","Si realmente eres tan listo como dices en el currículum, te habrás decatado de que Nubby atraviesa algunas pegs, mas no otras.",
"tut26","Nubby will break through 1's, but will bounce off any peg greater than 1.","Nubby solo atravesará las de 1, mientras que en las de mayor valor rebotará ",		
"tut27","Alright bud, that's it for the tutorial. You'll figure the rest out for yourself.","Bueno, pues ya estaría todo tío. Ya verás el resto de las cosas por tu cuenta, con ayudas emergentes y eso.",
"tut28","OH! WAIT! WAIT! I FORGOT ONE THING!","¡BUENO PARA QUIETO NIÑO, QUE ME FALTÓ DECIRTE UNA COSA!",		
"tut29","Everytime you launch Nubby, you lose one life. If you run out of lives, the sun will explode.","Cada vez que lanzas al Nubby, el pobre desgraciado pierde una vida. Si se queda sin vidas, el sol se pica y explota.",
"tut30","But luckily, everytime the board restocks, you get one life back.","Por suerte, cada vez que el tablero se reabastece, gana una vida.",		
"tut31","So as long as you keep making big numbers, nobody gets hurt.","Así que, mientras sigas haciendo buenas cifras, no tendrán que pagarte la baja por accidente laboral.",
"tut32","Ok now I'm done. Thanks for not pressing the {a}skip tutorial{a} button. I know that was difficult for you.","Listo, ahora sí que acabé . Gracias por no presionar el botón de {a}pasar tutorial{a}. Sé lo difícil que puede llegar a suponerte.",
"tut33","I'll start you off with a fresh, new factory now. Good luck.","Te mandaré a una nueva y maravillosa fábrica. Buena suerte, que la vas a necesitar.",
"skiptut","Skip Tutorial","Pasar del jefe",
