"challenge_highscore","Highscore","Mejor resultado",
"challenge_desc_0","*Items in shops are replaced by various mystery boxes.{a}*Mystery boxes give a random item when purchased.","*Los objetos en tienda son ahora cajas misteriosas.{a}*Las cajas darán un objeto al azar al ser adquiridas.",
"challenge_desc_1","*You can jumble pegs once PER GAME.{a}*Rerolling items in shops is disabled.","*Puedes mezclar pegs una vez POR PARTIDA.{a}*Cambiar objetos en las tiendas está prohibido.",
"challenge_desc_2","*Maximum coins are capped at 10.{a}*Items that cost more than 10 coins have reduced prices.","Solo podrás tener 10 monedas como máximo.{a}*Objetos con precios mayores tendrán una reducción.",
"challenge_desc_3","*Rare items, foods, and perks cannot be found.","*Objetos raros, comidas, y libros no pudieron ser encontrados.",
"challenge_desc_4","*Items will be deleted 15 rounds after they were obtained.{a}*Upgrading items will reset their expiration date.","*Los objetos se borrarán 15 rondas tras haberse ontenido.{a}*Mejorarlos reiniciará la cuenta atrás.",
"challenge_desc_5","*During restocks, you can only gain +1 life at most - even if you restocked more than once.{a}*You cannot gain lives using any alternative method.","*Durante los reabastecimientos, solo puedes ganar 1 vida-aún si reabasteces más de una vez.{a}*No puedes usar ningún método alternativo.",
"challenge_desc_6","*Failure to meet the quota on any round will result in the left-most item being deleted.","*Fallar tratando de alcanzar la cuota en cualquier ronda resultará en la destrucción del objeto más a la izquierda.",
"challenge_desc_7","*A C-4 is strapped to Nubby.{a}*Nubby will explode and die after 1.5 seconds, causing a big explosion that pops pegs.","*Un C-4 está pegado a Nubby.{a}*Mubby explotará y morirá tras 1.5 segundos, causando una gran explosión que golpea a las pegs.",
"challenge_desc_8","*Perks cannot be obtained.","*Los libros no pueden ser obtenidos",
"challenge_desc_9","*If you start a round with more than 1 item in your inventory, all items will be disabled for the rest of the round.","*Si empiezas la ronda con más de un objeto en tu inventario, todos los objetos se deshabilitarán por el resto de la ronda.",
"challenge_desc_10","*Collect all 5 letters (N.U.B.B.Y.) by completing trials.{a}*You must beat round 80 to complete.{a}*Difficulty: {b}","*Las 5 letras (N.U.B.B.Y.) están en las pruebas.{a}*Debes pasar de la ronda 80 para completarla.{a}*Dificultad: {b}",
"NubbyTrialsAllLocked","Beat at least 5 challenges to unlock!","¡Supera al menos 5 desafíos para desbloquear!",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Antimatter{d})","EN RONDA {b}:{a}un objeto maligno aparecerá en la ranura {c}. ({d}Antimateria{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Shell Shocked!{c} boss.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Face {c}¡Guirigai!{c} jefe.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Items in slots {c} and {d} are destroyed.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Objeto en ranuras {c} y {d} serán destruidos.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all coins.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Pierde todas las monedas.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All upgraded items are downgraded.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}TODOS los objetos mejorados se degradan.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Dollhead{d})","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto maligno aparece en la ranura {c}.{a}({d}Cabeza de muñeca{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All items are destroyed, except for evil items.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}TODOS los objetos se destruyen, exceptuando los objetos malignos.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Psychic Spider{d})","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto maligno aparece en la ranura {c}.{a}({d}Araña psísica{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Bedrock Bash!{c} boss.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Cara {c}¡Llueven piedras!{c} boss.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Vida máxima capada en {c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Homunculus{d})","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto maligno en la ranura {c}.{a}({d}Homúnculo{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum coins capped at {c}.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Monedas capadas en {c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All rare and ultra-rare items are destroyed.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Todos los objetos raros y superrraros son destruidos.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Holiday Cheer!{c} boss.","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Cara {c}¡Alegría Navideña!{c} jefe.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}{c}Homunculus{c} turns into {c}Alphamunculus{c} (harder variant).","EN RONDA {b}:{a}{c}Homúnculo{c} se transforma en {c}Alpfamúnculo{c} (versión más complicada).",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Broken Figurine{d})","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto maligno aparece en la ranura {c}.{a}({d}Figurita Rota{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Scary Fingore{d})","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto maligno aparece en la ranura {c}.{a}({d}Dedazo Aterrador{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}I've Been Robbed!{c} boss.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Cara {c}Me han mangado!{c} jefe.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All non-upgraded items are destroyed.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}TODOS los objetos sin mejorar son destruidos.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all but one life.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Pierdes todas las vidas menos una.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Vidas capadas en {c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Rodent Bones{d})","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto maligno aparece en la ranura {c}{a}({d}Huesos Roídos{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Bottled Tears{d})","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto maligno en la ranura {c}{a}({d}Lágrimas embotelladas{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Pessimism!{c} boss.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}Cara {c}Pesimismo!{c} jefe.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All perks are destroyed.","EN RONDA {b}:{a}TODOS los libros son destruidos.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_complete","All trials complete! Beat the final boss to win!","¡Todas las prublas han sido completadas!¡Vence al jefe final para acabar de una vez con esto, que ya debes estar aburrido!",
