"NubbySkinDesc0","Nubby's classic look!","¡La ropa que lleva siempre Nubby!",
"NubbySkinDesc1","This frog nubby was sent to us in the mail one day. We have no idea why this frog resembles nubby.","Este Nubby anfibio nos fue enviado por correo un día. No tenemos ni idea de por qué esta rana se parece a Nubby.",
"NubbySkinDesc2","An endangered subspecies of nubbies, scientifically known as Nubbicus Aquaticus.","Una subespecie en riesgo de extinción de Nubby, llamado específicamente como Nubbicus Aquaticus.",
"NubbySkinDesc3","A failed experiment, resulting from the factory's past attempts to tap into the cheese industry.","Un experimento fallido, resultado de el intento de la fábrica para adaptarse a la industria del queso.",
"NubbySkinDesc4","This nubby stole factory money to follow his dreams at clown college.","Este Nubby robó dinero de la fábrica para alcanzar sus sueños en la universidad de payasos.",
"NubbySkinDesc5","This nubby made his own cosplay and thinks he has cyborg strength. Just let the poor guy have a dream...","Este Nubby hizo su propio cosplay y piensa que tiene la fuerza de un androide. Solo déjale ser feliz al pobre diablo...",
"NubbySkinDesc6","This nubby is also a parasite in the metaphorical sense too. If he asks, don't lend him any money.","Este Nubby es también un parásito en un sentido metafórico. Si te pregunta,dile que no tienes un duro.",
"NubbySkinDesc7","In the nubby manufacturing process, things like this happen by accident sometimes.","En el proceso de creación de Nubby,le pasaron varias desgracias que le podrían pasar a cualquiera.",
"NubbySkinDesc8","This nubby finds joy in Victorian Era live action roleplay. He's not hurting anyone so we let it happen.","Este Nubby encuentra la felicidad imitando a un personaje de la Era Victoriana.",
"NubbySkinDesc9","We keep this nubby around to celebrate employee birthdays. He's also super good at playing kazoo.","Conservamos este Nubby para celebrar los cumpleaños de los empleados. Se le da de locos tocar la turuta.",
"NubbySkinDesc10","Just for kicks, we sometimes make nubbies that can feel emotion. They all end up forming punk bands.","Tan solo por las coñas, a veces hacemos Nubbys que pueden sentir emociones. Acaban todos en bandas de punk chorra español.",
"NubbySkinDesc11","The result of our attempts at making self replicating nubbies to save money.","El resultado de tratar de replicar Nubbys para ahorrar parné.",
"NubbySkinDesc12","Despite his appearance, this nubby is very mature and sophisticated if you get to know him.","A pesar de su apariencia, este Nubby es muy maduro y sofisticado si llegas a conocerlo.",
"NubbySkinDesc13","Back when the number factory had a petting zoo, this nubby was super popular. Of course, that was before the incident...","De aquellas cuando la fábrica de números tenía un zoo interactivo, este Nubby era muy popular, hasta llegar el fatídico día... ",
"NubbySkinDesc14","One of the very first nubbies we cloned. Made way before we discovered their number harvesting capabilities.","Uno de los primeros Nubbys que dimos clonado.Ya hecho, descubrimos sus numerosas discapacidades cognitivas.",
"NubbySkinDesc15","Tony thinks it's really funny to brainwash nubbies into thinking he's god.","El cachondo del Antonio se piensa que es divertido lavarles el cerebro a los pobres Nubbys para que piensen que son Dios.",
"NubbySkinDesc16","The PR team requested a {b}wholesome{b} nubby mascot to slap on all of our advertising and merch to overshadow our non-wholesome practices.","El equipo de relaciones públicas pidió un {b}saludable{b} Nubby mascota para tapar nuestras prácticas poco morales.",
"NubbySkinDesc17","One year we dressed this nubby up as a butterfly for Halloween. Now we have leave the costume on him because he'll try to bite you if you get near him.","Un buen día disfrazamos este Nubby de mariposa por Halloween. Le hemos dejado el disfraz porque intentará morder a quien se acerque a él.",
"NubbySkinDesc18","This is just a souvenir that we sell to tourists at the number factory gift shop.","Es un suvenir que vendemos a turistas pánfilos que vienen a visitar la fábrica en la tienda correspondiente.",
"NubbySkinDesc19","This Nubby is an official star-employee at the number factory... Just like you!","Este Nubby es un empleado del mes oficial de la fábrica... ¡Justo cómo tú!",
"NubbySkinDesc20","This Nubby angered the car wizard and as punishment he was turned into a car. Despite his curse, he remains joyous.","Este Nubby cabreó al mago de los coches, sufriendo como consecuencia ser transformado en un coche. A pesar de su maldición, se ve contento.",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","This skin is a mystery...","Este atuendo es un misterio...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","Who knows what this could be...","Quién sabe lo que podría ser esto...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","Oooh a mystery nubby...","Oooh,un Nubby misterioso...",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 1","Desbloquea este superando las Pruebas Nubbys Nivel 1",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 2","Desbloquea este superando las Pruebas Nubbys Nivel 2",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 3","Desbloquea este superando las Pruebas Nubbys Nivel 3",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_18","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 4","Desbloquea este superando las Pruebas Nubbys Nivel 4",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_19","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 5","Desbloquea este superando las Pruebas Nubbys Nivel 5",
"NubbySkinCredit","Made by {a}","Hecho por {a}",
"NubbySkinCredit_Concept","Concept by {a}","Concepto aportado por {a}",
"ItemSkinNickName0","Gentleman","Todo un caballero",
"ItemSkinNickName1","Tablet","Tableta",
"ItemSkinNickName2","Paradise","Paraíso",
"ItemSkinNickName3","Anatomy","Anatomía",
"ItemSkinNickName4","Concrete","Cemento",
"ItemSkinNickName5","Tonycado","Aguacantonio",
"ItemSkinNickName6","Jorts","Pantis",
"ItemSkinNickName7","Bricks","Bricks",
"ItemSkinNickName8","Doodle","Garabato",
"ItemSkinNickName9","Unstable","Inestable",
"ItemSkinNickName10","Macaroni","Macarrón",
"ItemSkinNickName11","Gustaf","Gustavo",
"ItemSkinNickName12","Ammonite","Ammonita",
"ItemSkinNickName13","Extra Long","Largo de más",
"ItemSkinNickName14","Stopmotion","Stopmotion",
"ItemSkinNickName15","Magic Microwave","Microondas Mágico",
"ItemSkinNickName16","Arts and Crafts","Manualidades",
"ItemSkinNickName17","Trophy","Trofeo",
"ItemSkinNickName18","Corndog","Perrito de maíz",
"ItemSkinDesc0","Transform your seals into dapper gentlemen.","Transforma tus focas en apuestos caballeros.",
"ItemSkinDesc1","Turn your all-seeing pyramids into poorly drawn ancient artifacts.","Transforma tus pirámides omniscientes en antiguos artefactos de civilizaciones hundidas.",
"ItemSkinDesc2","Turn your fake plastic trees into fake plastic trees.","Transforma tus árboles de plástico en árboles de plástico falsos.",
"ItemSkinDesc3","Turn your kidney beans into kidneys, minus the beans.","Transforma tus frijoles en riñones por transmutación cárnica.",
"ItemSkinDesc4","Turn your e-blocks into hardened, stone-faced soldiers.","Transforma tus bloques-e en unos soldados traumatizados.",
"ItemSkinDesc5","Turn your avocados into your friends!","¡Transforma tus aguacates en tus amigos!",
"ItemSkinDesc6","Turn your jeans into jorts!","¡Transforma tus vaqueros en unos pantis!",
"ItemSkinDesc7","Make your ton of feathers way heavier.","Haz tu tonelada de plumas mucho más pesada.",
"ItemSkinDesc8","Turn your donut into a drawing of a donut.","Haz de tu dónut un dibujo de un dónut",
"ItemSkinDesc9","Fill your mushrooms with compacted C4.","Rellena tus champiñones con un C4 bien compactado.",
"ItemSkinDesc10","Replace your normal noodles with shorter, tubular noodles that are bent.","Reemplaza tus fideos de siempre con una versión más corta y tubular que está doblada.",
"ItemSkinDesc11","Give your mannequin head some style, and a personality too!","¡Dale a tu maniquí cabeza con estilo y personalidad!",
"ItemSkinDesc12","Turn your mollusk into an extinct mollusk.","Transforma tu molusco en otro molusco ya extinto.",
"ItemSkinDesc13","Turn your pedro into pedroooooooooooooooo.","Transforma a Pedro en Pedrooooooooooooooooo.",
"ItemSkinDesc14","Turn your clay man into a clay man, except this time he's actually made out of clay.","Transforma tu hombre de arcilla en un hombre de arcilla que esta vez si que estaba hecho de arcilla.",
"ItemSkinDesc15","Give poopbutt a timeout in the magic microwave.","Da a Caraculo un paseo por el microondas mágico.",
"ItemSkinDesc16","Release your sea cucumbers into the wild, and then make a handcrafted charm to honor their legacy.","Libera tus pepinos de mar en la naturaleza,para hacer luego una manualidad en su honor",
"ItemSkinDesc17","Turn your fish into a fish on a wall!","¡Transforma tu pez en un pez contra un muro!",
"ItemSkinDesc18","Turn your squids into the best American carnival food!","¡Tranforma tus clalamares en la mejor comida del Carnaval americano!",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","A mystery item skin.. what is it?","Un atuendo de objeto misterioso...¿Qué será?",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","How mysterious...","Cuan misterioso...",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","I wonder what it is...","Me pregunto que será...",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating the game at least once with every supervisor.","Desbloquea este superando una partida con cada supervisor al menos 1 vez.",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by reaching round 300 in endless mode on any supervisor.","Obtén este llegando a la rondsa 300 del modo infinito con cualquier supervisor.",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating all challenges, including all nubby trials levels.","Desbloquea este superando todos los desafíos, incluyendo las Pruebas de Nubby.",
"warehouse_tutorial0","Greetings! The name's Sparkplug.","¡Qué pasa primooo! ¡Aquí 'ta tu ami'o el Bujía'! ",
"warehouse_tutorial1","You've entered my realm... the warehouse!","¡Mucho tiempo que un payo no viene por la casa mía,el almacén!",
"warehouse_tutorial2","I'm the manager here, sort of. It's complicated...","Me tienen tomao por patriarca del sitio, cosa' de la compañía...",
"warehouse_tutorial3","Anyways, who cares, am I right? I'm gonna show you around real quick.","Bue mi raza, te enseño el sitio este así por encima.",
"warehouse_tutorial4","Here we are! The warehouse is where you buy and activate cosmetic nubby skins and item skins.","¡Aquí 'tamos! En este merca'illo gigante te pue'o vender cualquier trapo pa'l Nubby o pa los objetos a mu' buen precio.",
"warehouse_tutorial5","We're currently looking at the nubby skins menu. Press the item skins button to view the item skins menu.","Pos por aquí tenemos la secció' de Nubby. Dale ahí al botoncico de autendos de orjeto' pa darles una ojeá a esos también.",
"warehouse_tutorial6","This is the menu for buying and activating item skins, but we're going to focus on nubby skins for now.","Este solo vale para artivá y comprá los atuendos de orjetos, peo vamo' a centrarnos en los atuendos del Nubby.",
"warehouse_tutorial7","Go back to the nubby skins menu by pressing the nubby skins button.","Vuélvete atrás dándole al botón.",
"warehouse_tutorial8","Use the arrows to page through my collection of cosmetics! Click the arrows a couple times and we'll move on.","Las flechicas son pa ir cambiando,¡pruébalas un poco que monté el sitema yo mismo!",
"warehouse_tutorial9","Good job! Here's 10 free stars as a reward for being so obedient!","¡Ole ahí! Voy a darte unas estrellas que me cobré de la vital por ser tan buen payico!",
"warehouse_tutorial10","Now, find a nubby skin you can afford and buy it.","¡Ahora píllale algo de ropa al Nubby, no vaya a ir desnu'o por la fábrica!",
"warehouse_tutorial11","Nice. Now hit the green button below to activate it.","Bien, solo te que'a darle al botón verde cantoso pa activarla.",
"warehouse_tutorial12","You can only activate one nubby skin at a time, but you can activate multiple item skins at once.","Nubby solo pue llevar 1 atuendo, pero los orjetos disfrazarlos cuantos te venga en gana vamos.",
"warehouse_tutorial13","Other than that, nubby skins and item skins work the same way.","Los dos tipos de atuendos funcionan igual.",
"warehouse_tutorial14","Ok. That's pretty much all I have left to say I think.","Ale, eso e' to'o",
"warehouse_tutorial15","You're probably smart and you can figure the rest out for yourself.","Ya darás sacao concrusione' del resto de cosa'.",
"warehouse_tutorial16","I'm not gonna go away though because I don't trust you.","Peo me voy a queda' por aquí, no vaya ser que me robes.",
"warehouse_tutorial17","By the way, did I mention that I'm also the official number factory historian?","Ai po cie'to, también te dihe que soy el historiado' de la fábrica",
"warehouse_tutorial18","If you poke me, I'll tell you a random fact about the number factory. Anyways, have fun!","Vente que te cuento cuarquie cosa de este sitio. En fin,¡pásalo bien niño!",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome1","Yeah, sure. Feel free to barge in unannounced.","Coñe, pasa' por aquí como Pedro por su casa.",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome2","Welcome in! You need to learn to knock, though.","¡Niñooo!¡Toca la puerta que me pienso que viene la Policía Nacional!",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome3","Welcome back! I totally wasn't in the middle of something.","Ai chachoo. Estaba haciendo argo de limpieza, por eso hay tanto porvo.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue0","Nubbies are a species of genetically modified human. They also have DNA from over 300 random mammals, fish, and reptiles.","Los Nubbys son una raza aparte de persona. Ademá' también los merclaron con sapo, rata', peses, 300 bicho' má' o meno'.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue1","There is no singular nubby. Rather, nubbies are genetically cloned right here at the factory. It's the way we've always done it.","No hay un Nubby origina'.Preferimo' clonarlo aquí todo', que es lo que hicimo' siempre.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue2","Not counting the incubation phase of nubby production, the average nubby life span is 6 seconds.","Sin conta' la incubación der bicho, la erperansa de vi'a de un Nubby es de 6 segundo'.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue3","The nubby production process is a highly guarded secret, we're the only number factory to own the nubby patent.","Es de arto secreto como hasemo' lo Nubby. De hecho la fábrica esta la tenemo' pa conserva' la patente.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue4","Other companies in the number industry try to produce numbers ethically without using nubbies. No other company is as successful as us.","La competencia intentó quitar a los Nubby de la ecuació' pa haselo más ético. Quedan mu 'tras de nosotros en cuanto a beneficio.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue5","We produce numbers for the whole world to use in their math problems, computations, and calculations. Without numbers, the laws of physics cease to exist.","Hasemo' número' pa tol planeta pa problema de matemática, ordenado' y carculadoa. ¡Sin nuestro' número ni había leyes dea física ni había na!",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue6","Years ago, I was hired to help remove asbestos from the warehouse. The other employees mistakenly thought I was a manager here, so I just rolled with it and here we are.","Ai, cuando me contrataran pa quitar amianto daquí, los otros payos me vieron como er gerente der sitio este, así que me dio por asentarme.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue7","The factory pays me based on how many hours I spend in the warehouse, so I moved in and I haven't left in years.","Aquí me pagan por las horas que echo de pie aquí. No me mue'o ni pa desayunar.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue8","Sometimes Tony and I listen to music and drive the forklift around to kill time. He's a nice guy once you get to know him.","El seño' Antonio y yo cuchamo' música y conducimo' pa matar er tiempo. Gran payo, me cae genia'.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue9","Nobody's met the boss of the number factory. Nobody knows if there even is one. You could fire Tony and he couldn't do anything about it.","Na'ie sabe quien es er jefe de to esto. No se sa'e siquiera si hay uno. Si despidiera' a Antonio, no creo que pudiera apelar a nadie.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue10","A while ago, Tony covered a bunch of nubbies in paint and threw them at my wall. He's a great artist!","Hace musho año, le dio al Antonio por coge' una docena de Nubbys pa pintarlo' y tirarlo a mi muro.¡No le que'ó nada mal! ",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue11","We don't even store anything in the warehouse. My only job is to explain what the warehouse is to new employees and drive the forklift.","Rearmente en er almacén. Solo explico lo que es y conduzco er montacarga'.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue12","Here at the factory, we don't produce our number pegs - we buy them from the peg factory. they won't tell us what they're made of, so it can't be good.","Las pegs las sacamos de la fábrica de pegs, de producció' desconozi'a.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue13","We protect nubbies from themselves and from our rival companies. If they leave the factory grounds, they self destruct.","A los Nubbys los protegemo' de ellos mismos y de la competencia,gracias a la explosió' resultante si tratan de salir de la fábrica.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue14","Nubbies usually can't feel emotion, but they all have their own unique personality.","Los Nubbys no tienen sentimiento',pero tienen una personali'a única.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue15","If nubbies are kept alive for too long, they slowly turn into cubes. We don't know why.","Los Nubbys se vuelven cuadriculaos si los dejamos vivos durante demasiado tiempo.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue16","Tony and I go way back. I don't know if he's shy or something but I've known him for over a decade and I've never seen him take the glasses off.","Yo al Antonio que lo llevo conociendo unos 10 años, no lo he visto nunca con las gafas quitadas.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue17","You should really wear a gas mask in here. There's still tons of asbestos everywhere.","Debería' de llevar una máscara antigas si estás aquí. Hay amianto por toas partes.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue18","Nubbies are the only known creature that can harvest numbers. Their bodies have the exact shape and texture required to harvest numbers.","Los Nubbys son los únicos sere' de este mundo que dan cosechao números. Lo llevan en la forma y la textura der cuerpo.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue19","I've overheard talks about the number factory getting into letter production as well. Who knows... letters are in high demand these days.","Escuche por ahi que nos vamos a meter también a hacer letras. Dio' sabe...",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue20","You didn't hear this from me, but I've heard that nubbies taste like grape candy.","Yo no los he probao aún, pero dicen que los Nubbys saben a chuche con sabor a uva.",
"credit_main","Nubby's Number Factory{a}{a}A game by {b}.{a}{a}{a}Soundtrack by {c}{a}{a}{a}{a}","Nubby's Number Factory{a}{a}Un jeu de {b}.{a}{a}{a}Bande sonore par {c}{a}{a}{a}{a}",

