"null","[#ffd500]Error: null","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc0","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Eclate un peg aléatoire. Quand il éclate, il donne 2 fois des points.",		
"item_desc1","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Copie le dernier aliment non-amélioré mangé{a}*Copiera: {c}{b}{c}. {d}",		
"item_desc2","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quill that falls from the sky and pops {c} peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque {b} une épine qui tombe du ciel et éclate {c} peg.",		
"item_desc3","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un peg aléatoire explosera et éclate {b} (maximum) pegs proches.",		
"item_desc4","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}*Chaque objet de l'inventaire donne des points égaux au nombre d'un peg aléatoire",		
"item_desc5","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}meat-orb{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby est encore en vie, invoque une {b}boule de chair{b} qui flotteront et éclatent des pegs.{a}*Les boules de chair meurent quand Nubby meurt.",		
"item_desc6","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} sur {c} chance de doubler TOUS les pegs.",		
"item_desc7","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Maxes out at {b} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gagne +1 pièce pour toute fraise mangée pendant la partie.{a}*Limité à {b} pièces.",		
"item_desc8","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot shots{b} that pop any pegs they pass through.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un peg aléatoire va projeter {c} {b}tirs de morve{b} qui éclatent tous les pegs qu'ils traversent.",		
"item_desc9","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque une paille qui éclate un peg.{a}*Les pegs éclatés par des pailles donne un bonus de +{b}% de leur #.{a}*Gagne +{c}% POur chaque fois que tu as mélangé les pegs cette partie.",		
"item_desc10","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to double the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tous les pegs donneront le double du # du peg le plus petit.",		
"item_desc11","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de causer une explosion géante qui éclate tous les pegs d'un coup.{a}*{c}% chance si tu es sur ton dernier tir.",		
"item_desc12","[#ffffff]{a}*Every empty peg space will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Chaque emplacement de peg vide donnera des points pour chaque pegs qui a été éclaté cette manche.",	
"item_desc13","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the right-most item in your inventory.{a}*Deletes the left-most item in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Améliore l'objet le plus à droite de l'inventaire.{a}*Supprime l'objet le plus à gauche de l'inventaire.",
"item_desc14","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Eclate {b} peg aléatoire.",		
"item_desc15","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiplie le nombre de points total par {b}x.",		
"item_desc16","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby donne autant de points que de fois qu'il a rebondit pendant cette manche.",		
"item_desc17","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sharp-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque projectile pointu qui éclate un peg aléatoire {b} fois.",		
"item_desc18","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne +1 {b}Atout du croissant{b}.",	
"item_desc19","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives a copy of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne une copie de l'atout obtenu le plus récemment.{a}(Actuellement {b})",		
"item_desc20","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an egg missile that falls from the sky and causes an explosion that pops a row of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby est toujours en vie, invoque un oeuf missile qui explose une rangée de pegs.",		
"item_desc21","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the lowest # peg twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Eclate le peg avec le plus petit # 2 fois.",	
"item_desc22","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{d}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de ne rien faire.{a}*{c}% chance de doubler un peg aléatoire.{a}*{d}% chance de diviser un peg aléatoire.",		
"item_desc23","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne +{b} points pour chaque fois que cet objet a été déclenché cette manche.{a}*{c} pour {d} chance de se métamorphoser.",		
"item_desc24","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de créer une chaine d'éclairs qui éclate un groupe de pegs",		
"item_desc25","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}meat-orbs{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby est toujours en vie, invoque {c} {b}boules de chair{b} qui flottent et éclatent des pegs.{a}*Les boules de chair meurent quand Nubby meurt.",	

	
"item_desc26","[#ffffff]{a}*Test{b}","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
		
"item_desc27","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs will copy the # of the first peg popped.{a}*If this item is in slot #{c}, {d} pegs will be affected instead of {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} pegs aléatoires copient le # du premier peg éclatée.{a}*Si cet objet est dans l'emplacement #{c}, {d} pegs seront affectés au lieu de {b}.",
"item_desc28","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne +{b} points pour chaque fois que cet objet s'est déclenché durant cette manche.",		
"item_desc29","[#ffffff]{a}*Every peg will give points equal to {b}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Chaque peg donne un nombre de points égal a {b}% de leur #.",		
"item_desc30","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles a random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Double un peg aléatoire.",		
"item_desc31","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into the non-upgraded version of the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] for the rest of the round.","Se transforme en la version non améliorée de [#ffb3ff]L'OBJET A GAUCHE[#ffffff] pour la manche.",		
"item_desc32","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a pulse that doubles pegs within close range.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un peg aléatoire émet une onde qui double les pegs proches.",	
"item_desc33","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emits a burst of nuclear waste.{a}*Nuclear waste pops any pegs it touches.{a}*If Nubby isn't alive, a random peg will emit the burst.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby émet un jet de déchets radioactifs.{a}*Les déchets radioactifs éclatent les pegs qu'ils touchent.{a}*Si Nubby n'est plus en vie, un peg aléatoire émet le jet.",
"item_desc34","[#ffffff]{a}*Marks a random peg.{a}*When a peg is marked, all pegs that have the same number will be doubled.{a}*If no pegs have the same number as the marked peg, a random peg will be doubled.","[#ffffff]{a}*Marque un peg aléatoire.{a}*Quand un peg est marqué, tous les pegs avec le même nombre sont doublés.{a}*Si aucun peg n'a le même nombre, un peg aléatoire est doublé.",		
"item_desc35","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs get smacked.{a}*When a peg is smacked, it counts as a {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg halved [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] trigger without actually halving it.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} pegs aléatoires se font claquer.{a}*Quand un peg est claqué, il compte comme un {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg divisé par 2 [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] sans réellement le diviser.",		
"item_desc36","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for each remaining life.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gagne +1 pièce pour chaque vie restante.",	
"item_desc37","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles {c} random pegs whose # is less than {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Double {c} pegs aléatoires dont le # est inférieur à {b}.",	
"item_desc38","[#ffffff]{a}*50% chance to double total coins.{a}*50% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*50/50.{a}*Tu doubles ou tu perds tout.",
"item_desc39","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random common item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Se transforme en un objet commun aléatoire qui n'est pas dans votre inventaire actuel jusqu'à la fin du tour.",
"item_desc40","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de doubler un peg aléatoire.",
"item_desc41","[#ffffff]{a}*Halves the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times","[#ffffff]{a}*Divise le peg avec le plus grand #.{a}*Double le peg avec le plus petit # {b} fois.",
"item_desc42","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay balls.{a}*If a clay ball bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay balls die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque {b} sphères d'argile.{a}*Si une boule d'argile rebondit sur un peg OU un mur, cela compte comme un [#ffd500]{d}Nubby rebondit contre un mur [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff].{a}*Les sphères d'argile meurent après {c} rebonds.",
"item_desc43","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Copie l'effet non amélioré de l'objet en [#ffb3ff]EMPLACEMENT #{b}[#ffffff], mais garde son propre déclencheur.",
"item_desc44","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gagne +{b} points.{a}*Si tu es à la manche {d} ou plus, gagne +{c} points à la place.",
"item_desc45","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne +1 {b}Atout Du Kebabier{b}",
"item_desc46","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fournit un aliment rare aléatoire.",
"item_desc47","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si le premier peg éclaté est celui avec le plus grand #, multiplie le score total par {b}x.",
"item_desc48","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Eclate {b} pegs aléatoires.",
"item_desc49","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg becomes a copy of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Le peg avec le plus petit # devient une copie du peg avec le plus grand #.",
"item_desc50","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +1 reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*En rentrant au Nubby-Marché, gagne +1 actualisation.",
"item_desc51","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Réduit l'objectif de manche de -{b}%.{a}*Divise tous les pegs par 2.",
"item_desc52","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers an electron beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an electron beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Electron beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Déclenche un rayon d'électrons.{a}*Quand un rayon touche un peg, le peg donne {b}% de son #.{a}*Les rayons n'éclatent PAS les pegs.",
"item_desc53","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits a god ray.{a}*The god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cet item émet un rayon divin.{a}*Le rayon divin éclate un peg 1 fois pour chaque fois que l'objet en [#ffb3ff]EMPLACEMENT #1 [#ffffff]s'est activé ce tour ci.",
"item_desc54","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Déclenche l'atout le plus récemment obtenu.{a}(Actuellement {b})",
"item_desc55","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Le peg avec le plus petit # donne des points égaux à {b}x son #.{a}*Si le peg avec le plus petit # est de {d} ou moins, il donnera +{c} points à la place.",
"item_desc56","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque un ballon de plage qui émet {b} jets de confettis quand ils éclatent.{a}*Les pegs éclatés par les ballons de plage donnent {c}% de leur #.",

"item_desc57","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc58","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to a copy of himself.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby enfante d'une copie de lui même.",
"item_desc59","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de doubler le peg avec le plus grand #.",
"item_desc60","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Emet un jet de sang pour chaque {b} fois que Nubby est mort cette partie.{a}*Quand un peg est touché par le sang, [#ffd500]{c}Passe l'objectif de la manche [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] les objets et les atouts se déclencheront.{a}(Actuellement émet {d})",
"item_desc61","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all items in your inventory... Good luck!","[#ffffff]{a}*Change aléatoirement tous les objets de l'inventaire... Bonne chance!",
"item_desc62","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Contient un objet commun aléatoire du Nubby-Marché.",
"item_desc63","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Contient un objet commun aléatoire du marché noir.",
"item_desc64","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common food item.","[#ffffff]*Contient un objet commun aléatoire.",
"item_desc65","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*Pour chaque fois que la planche a été réapprovisionnée, gagne +{b} points.{a}(Actuellement +{c} points)",
"item_desc66","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un peg aléatoire émet une {b}Supernova{b}.{a}*Quand un peg est touché par une supernova, compte pour {c} peg éclatés au lieu d'un.",
"item_desc67","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Quand il est déclenché de force, transfère le déclenchement à [#ffb3ff]L'OBJET A MA GAUCHE[#ffffff].{a}*A {c}% chance d'ajouter +1 déclenchement de plus.",
"item_desc68","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points four times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Eclate un peg aléatoire. Quand ce peg éclate, il donnera des points 4 fois.",

"item_desc69","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc70","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quills that fall from the sky and pop {c} peg each.{a}*10% chance to summon one additional quill (3 total).","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque {b} épines qui tombent du ciel et éclatent {c} peg chacune.{a}*10% chance d'invoquer une épine de plus (3 au total).",
"item_desc71","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un peg aléatoire explosera et éclatera {b} (maximum) pegs proches.",
"item_desc72","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to double the value of a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}*Chaque objet de l'inventaire le double des points de la valeur d'un peg aléatoire",
"item_desc73","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}disease-orb{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby est toujours en vie, invoque une {b}boule de pestilence{b} qui vont aggressivement flotter et éclater des pegs.{a}*Les boules de pestilence meurent quand Nubby meurt.",
"item_desc74","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.{a}*{d} in {e} chance to double all pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} sur {c} chance de doubler TOUS les pegs.{a}*{d} sur {e} chance de doubler tous les pegs 2 fois.",

"item_desc75","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc76","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot rockets{b} that pop any pegs they pass through twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un peg aléatoire va émettre {c} {b}bombes de morve{b} qui éclatent tous les pegs qu'ils traversent 2 fois.",
"item_desc77","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*+Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque une paille qui éclate un peg.{a}*Les pegs éclatés par des pailles donne +{b}% en plus de leur #.{a}*+Gagne +{c}% pour chaque fois que tu as mélangé les pegs cette partie.",
"item_desc78","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to quadruple the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tous les pegs vont donner le quadruple de la valeur du peg avec le plus petit #",
"item_desc79","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de créer une explosion géante qui éclate tous le spegs d'un coup.{a}*{c}% chance si tu es sur ton dernier tir.",
"item_desc80","[#ffffff]{a}*ALL peg spaces will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tous les espaces de peg donneront autant de points que de pegs ont été éclatés cette manche",
"item_desc81","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items in your inventory.{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Rend tous les déclencheurs des objets de l'inventaire aléatoires.{a}*Ce changement ne peut pas être annulé.",
"item_desc82","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Eclate {b} pegs aléatoires.",
"item_desc83","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiplie le total des points par {b}x.",
"item_desc84","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to double the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby donne autant de points que le double de fois que Nubby a rebondit cette manche.",
"item_desc85","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sword-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque un lancé d'épée qui éclate un peg aléatoire {b} fois.",

"item_desc86","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc87","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc88","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an ostrich-egg missile that falls from the sky an causes an explosion that pops 1 row and 1 column of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby est toujours en vie, invoque un missile oeuf d'autruche qui tombe du ciel et cause une explosion qui eclate une rangée et une colonne de pegs.",
"item_desc89","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the two lowest # pegs, twice each.","[#ffffff]{a}*Eclate les 2 plus petit # pegs, 2 fois chacun.",
"item_desc90","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{d}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de ne rien faire.{a}*{c}% chance de doubler un peg aléatoire.{a}*{d}% chance de diviser par 2 un peg aléatoire.",
"item_desc91","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne +{b} points pour chaque fois que cet objet a été déclenché cette manche.{a}*{c} sur {d} chance de se métamorphoser.",
"item_desc92","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a high-voltage chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de créer une chaine d'éclair à haut voltage qui éclate un groupe de pegs 2 fois",
"item_desc93","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}disease-orbs{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby est toujours en vie, invoque {c} {b}boule de pestilence{b} qui vont flotter aggressivement et éclater des pegs.{a}*Les boules de pestilence meurent quand Nubby meurt.",

