"item_desc107","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random rare or ultra-rare item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Se transforme en un objet rare ou ultra-rare aléatoire qui n'est pas actuellement dans l'inventaire pour le reste de la manche.",
"item_desc108","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de doubler un peg aléatoire.",
"item_desc109","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% chance to halve the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% chance de diviser par 2 le peg avec le #plus grand.{a}*Double le peg avec le # le plus bas {b} fois.",
"item_desc110","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay prisms.{a}*If a clay prism bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay prisms die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque {b} prismes d'argile.{a}*Si un prisme d'argile rebondit sur un mur OU un peg, il comptera comme un déclenchement [#ffd500]{d}Nubby touche un mur [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff].{a}*Les prismes d'argile meurt après {c} rebonds.",
"item_desc111","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Copie l'effet amélioré de l'objet [#ffb3ff]CASE #{b}[#ffffff], mais garde son propre déclencheur.",
"item_desc112","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gagne +{b} points.{a}*Si tu es à la manche {d} ou plus, gagne +{c} points à la place.",

"item_desc113","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc114","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc115","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si le premier peg éclaté est celui avec le plus grand #, multiplie le score total par {b}x.",
"item_desc116","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs, twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Eclate {b} pegs aléatoires, 2 fois.",
"item_desc117","[#ffffff]{a}*The two lowest # pegs become copies of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Les 2 pegs avec les # les plus petit deviennent des copies du peg avec le plus grand #.",

"item_desc118","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc119","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Réduit l'objectif de manche par -{b}%.{a}*Divise tous les pegs par 2.",
"item_desc120","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers a hyper-beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an hyper-beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Hyper-beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Déclenche un hyper-rayon qui traverse les pegs.{a}*Quand un hyper-rayon touche un peg, le peg donnera {b}% de son #.{a}*Les hyper-rayons n'éclatent pas les pegs.",
"item_desc121","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits two god rays.{a}*Each god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cet objet émet 2 rayons divins.{a}*Chaque rayon divin éclate rapidement un peg aléatoire pour chaque fois que l'objet en [#ffb3ff]CASE #1 [#ffffff]a été déclenché durant cette manche.",
"item_desc122","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk twice.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Déclenche l'atout obtenu le plus récemment 2 fois.{a}(Actuellement {b})",
"item_desc123","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Le peg avec le # le plus petit donne autant de points que {b}x son #.{a}*Si le peg avec le # le plus petit est de {d} ou moins, il donnera +{c} points à la place.",
"item_desc124","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a MEGA beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque un MEGA ballon de plage qui émet {b} jets de confettis quand il éclate.{a}*Les pegs éclatés par des confettis donnet {c}% de leur #.",

"item_desc125","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty Description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc126","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to two copies of himself.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby enfante de 2 copies de lui même.",
"item_desc127","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de doubler le peg avec le plus grand #.",
"item_desc128","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Emet un jet de sang pour chaque {b} fois que Nubby est mort cette partie.{a}*Quand un peg est touché par un jet de sang, les objets et atouts [#ffd500]{c}Passe l'objectif de manche [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] se déclencheront.{a}(Actuellement émet {d})",
"item_desc129","[#ffffff]{a}*Temporarily upgrades cafe foods that are currently available for purchase.","[#ffffff]{a}*Améliore temporairement les aliments du café qui sont disponible.",

"item_desc130","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc131","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc132","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc133","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*Pour chaque fois que la planche a été réapprovisionnée cette partie, gagne +{b} points.{a}(Acteullement +{c} points)",
"item_desc134","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Giant Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a giant cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un peg aléatoire émet une {b}Supernova Géante{b}.{a}*Quand un peg est éclaté par une supernova géante, il compte pour {c} peg éclatés à la place d'un.",
"item_desc135","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Quand il est déclenché de force, il transfère le déclenchement à l' [#ffb3ff]OBJET A MA GAUCHE[#ffffff].{a}*A {c}% de chance d'ajouter +1 déclenchement forcé.",
"item_desc136","[#ffffff]{a}*If you have less than maximum lives, restores +1 life.{a}*Otherwise, gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si tu as moins que le nombre maximal de vies, récupère +1 vie.{a}*Sinon donne +1 actualisation du nubby café.",
"item_desc137","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.{a}*This does not increase odds of ultra-rare items.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gagne +{b}% de chances pou rle sobjets rares à travers tous les magasins.{a}*Cela n'augmente pas les chances des objets ultra-rares.",
"item_desc138","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fournit un objet ultra-rare aléatoire.",
"item_desc139","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Contient un objet rare du Nubby-Marché.",
"item_desc140","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Contient un objet rare du marché noir.",
"item_desc141","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Contient un aliment rare.",
"item_desc142","[#ffffff]*Contains a copy of a random item in your inventory.{a}*If you have no items, this will give a random common item.","[#ffffff]*Contient une copie d'un objet aléatoire de l'inventaire.{a}*Si tu n'as pas d'objets, cela donnera un objet commun aléatoire.",
"item_desc143","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Contient un objet ultra-rare du Nubby-Marché.",
"item_desc144","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Contient un objet ultra-rare du marché noir.",
"item_desc145","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Contient un aliment ultra-rare.",
"item_desc146","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +1 additional time per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tu peux mélanger les pegs +1 fois de plus par tour.",
"item_desc147","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne +1 actualisation du nubby café.",
"item_desc148","[#ffffff]{a}*Deletes the left-most item.{a}*The right-most item transforms into a squid.{a}*If the right-most item is upgraded, it transforms into an upgraded squid.","[#ffffff]{a}*Supprime l'objet le plus à gauche.{a}*L'objet le plus à droite se transforme en poulpe.{a}*Si l'objet le plus à droite est amélioré, il le transforme en poulpe amélioré.",
"item_desc149","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de déclencher de force [#ffb3ff]LES DEUX OBJETS A MA DROITE ET A MA GAUCHE[#ffffff].{a}*Les chances diminuent de {c}% chaque fois que cela se déclenche.{a}*Les chances reviennet à {b}% quand la manche est terminée.",
"item_desc150","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de déclencher de force [#ffb3ff]LES DEUX OBJETS A MA DROITE ET A MA GAUCHE[#ffffff].{a}*Les chances diminuent de {c}% chaque fois que cela se déclenche.{a}*Les chances reviennet à {b}% quand la manche est terminée.",
"item_desc151","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tous les atouts déclenchent de force [#ffb3ff]L'OBJET A MA GAUCHE[#ffffff] une fois.",
"item_desc152","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.{a}*Each perk has a {b}% chance to force trigger the item twice instead of once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tous les atouts déclenchent de force [#ffb3ff]L'OBJET A MA GAUCHE[#ffffff] une fois.{a}*Chaque atout à {b}% chance de déclencher l'objet de force 2 fois au lieu d'une.",
"item_desc153","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Copie l'effet amélioré de l'aliment mangé le plus récemment{a}*Copiera: {c}{b}{c}. {d}",
"item_desc154","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Can give up to {c} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gagne +{b} pièces pour chaque fraise mangée durant cette partie.{a}*Peut donner jusqu'a {c} pièces.",
"item_desc155","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the two right-most items in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Améliore les 2 objets les plus à droite de l'inventaire.",
"item_desc156","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Jelly-Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne +1 {b}Atout du croissant en gélatine{b}.",
"item_desc157","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives two copies of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne 2 copies de l'atout obtenu le plus récemment.{a}(Actuellement {b})",
"item_desc158","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for each remaining life.{a}*Bonus +{c} coins if you have all lives remaining.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gagne +{b} pièces pour chaque vie restante.{a}*Bonus de +{c} pièces s'il te reste toutes tes vies.",
"item_desc159","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double total coins.{a}*{c}% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance de doubler tes pièces.{a}*{c}% chance de mettre le total des pièces à 0.",
"item_desc160","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Spicy Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne +1 {b}Atout du kebab épicé{b}",
"item_desc161","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fournit un aliment rare aléatoire.",
"item_desc162","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +{b} rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*En retournant au Nubby Café, gagne +{b} actualisations.",
"item_desc163","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all common items in your inventory.{a}*Rare and ultra-rare items are unaffected.","[#ffffff]{a}*Remplace tous les objets commun de l'inventaire aléatoirement.{a}*Les objets rares et ultra-rares ne sont pas affectés.",
"item_desc164","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items except the [#ffb3ff]ITEM IN SLOT #1[#ffffff].{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Remplace tous les déclencheurs excepté [#ffb3ff]L'OBJET DE LA CASE #1[#ffffff].{a}*Ce changement ne peut pas être annulé.",
"item_desc165","[#ffffff]{a}*Permanently upgrades all foods that are currently available for purchase.{a}*From now on, these items will only appear as their upgraded version.","[#ffffff]{a}*Améliore de façon permanante tous les aliments qui sont actuellement disponibles.{a}*A partir de maintenant, ces objet apparaitront seulement dans leur version améliorée.",
"item_desc166","[#ffffff]{a}*Restores +1 life and gives +2 rerolls in the cafe.","[#ffffff]{a}*Rend +1 vie et donne +2 actualisations dans le café.",
"item_desc167","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gagne +{b}% de chances pour les objets rares à travers les magasins.",
"item_desc168","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Fournit un aliment ultra-rare aléatoire.",
"item_desc169","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +{b} additional times per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Tu peux mélanger les pegs +{b} fois de plus par tour.",
"item_desc170","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +2 cafe nubby rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Donne +2 actualisations du Nubby Café.",
"item_desc171","[#ffffff]{a}*Creates an upgraded squid in the right-most empty item slot in your inventory.{a}*If you have no empty item slots, this does nothing.","[#ffffff]{a}*Crée un poulpe amélioré dans la case vide la plus à droite de l'inventaire.{a}*Si tu n'as pas de cases vides, cela ne fait rien.",
"item_desc172","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits an anti-particle that halves the first peg it hits.","[#ffffff]{a}*Emet un anti-particule qui divise par 2 le premier peg qu'il touche.",
"item_desc173","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped was NOT the highest # peg, {b} random pegs become 1-pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si le premier peg éclaté n'était PAS le peg avec le plus grand #, {b} pegs aléatoires deviennent 1-pegs.",
"item_desc174","[#ffffff]{a}*Destroys [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].","[#ffffff]{a}*Détruit [#ffb3ff]LES 2 OBJETS A MA DROITE ET MA GAUCHE[#ffffff].",
"item_desc175","[#ffffff]{a}*If the round goal has been passed more than once, this kills nubby. (This is an extremely painful death for him)","[#ffffff]{a}*Si l'objectif de la manche a été dépasse plus d'une fois, cela tue nubby. (C'est une mort extrêmemement douloureuse pour lui)",
"item_desc176","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Perd {b}% des points totaux.",
"item_desc177","[#ffffff]{a}*Disables the left-most non-disabled item, besides itself. (Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.)","[#ffffff]{a}*Désactive l'objet le plus à gauche qui n'est pas désactivé, à part lui même. (Les objets désactivés ne peuvent plus se déclencher jusqu'a la fin de la manche.)",
"item_desc178","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons an eggsac.{a}*Eggsacs bounce and pop pegs like Nubby.{a}*Pegs popped by eggsacs give NO points!","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoque un sac d'oeuf.{a}*Les sac d'oeufs rebondissent et éclatent les peg comme Nubby.{a}*Les pegs éclaté par les sacs d'oeufs ne donnne PAS de points!",
"item_desc179","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Remplace l'objet le plus à droite de l'inventaire par le dernier objet acheté dans le Nubby-Marché ou le marché noir.{a}(Actuellement: {b})",
"item_desc180","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the upgraded version of the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Remplace l'objet le plus à droite de l'inventaire par la version améliorée du dernier objet acheté dans le Nubby-Marché ou le marché noir.{a}(Actuellement: {b})",
"item_desc181","[#ffffff]{a}*A giant finger appears over the first peg popped's column.{a}*All pegs in this column subtract points equal to their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un doigt géant apparait au dessu de la colonne du premier peg éclaté.{a}*Tous les pegs de cette colonne soustraient des points égaux à leur #.",
"item_desc182","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Perd {b}% des points totaux.",

