"newgame","New{a}Game!","Nouvelle{a}Partie!",
		
"roundinfo","Round {a}","Manche {a}",	

"tut1","Hey. You must be the new employee they were telling me about.","Salut. Tu dois être le nouvel employé dont on m'a parlé.",		
"tut2","My name is Tony and I'm gonna be your supervisor.","Mon nom est Tony et je serais ton superviseur.",		
"tut3","My job is to show you how to run the factory.","Mon travail est de te montrer comment gérer l'usine.",	
"tut4","I don't really care about your name or anything so let's just get into this.","Je me fout un peu de ton nom et tout le reste, donc autant commencer.",		
"tut5","First things first, welcome aboard to Nubby's Number Factory - the world's leading number manufacturer!","Tout d'abord, bienvenue à bord de L'usine à Nombre de Nubby - Le premier manufactureur mondial de nombres!",		
"tut6","This is the main control center of the factory.","Ceci est le centre principal de controle de l'usine.",		
"tut7","Your first task is to launch our mascot, Nubby, down the peg board.","Ta première tâche est de lancer notre mascotte, Nubbby, sur la planche à peg.",		
"tut8","Hold down [{a}] and press [{b}] to launch Nubby.","Presse [{a}] et appuie sur [{b}] pour lancer Nubby.",		
"tut9","Wow, you're really good at this.","Wow, t'es vraiment bon pour faire ça.",		
"tut10","At this factory, your only job is to make big numbers...","Dans cette usine, ton seul travail est de faire de grands nombres...",		
"tut11","By launching Nubby at these pegs, you will earn however many points are shown on the peg.","En lançant Nubby sur ces pegs, tu vas gagner le nombre de points mintré sur le peg.",		
"tut12","This number shows how many points you made in a round.","Ce nombre montre combien de points tu as fait cette manche.",		
"tut13","The number on the bottom is the goal. If you beat the goal, the board will restock.","Le nombre en bas est l'objectif. Si tu dépasse l'objectif, la planche va se réapporvisionner.",		
"tut14","If you get a REALLY high score, the board can restock multiple times in a single round.","Si tu fais un VRAIMENT grand score, la planche se réapprovisionnera plusieurs fois en une seule manche.",		
"tut15","Oh wait.. I forgot to tell you what a restock even is!","Ah et attend.. J'ai oublié de te dire ce qu'est un réapprovisionnement!",		
"tut16","Well listen up, because restocks are an important thing!","Ok écoute, parce que les réapprovisionnements sont très importants!",		
"tut17","When the board restocks, a bunch of NEW pegs will fall from the sky and fill all your empty spaces.","Quand la planche se réapprovisionne, plein de NOUVEAUX pegs vont tomber du ciel et remplir les emplacments vides.",		
"tut18","Soon after, pairs of pegs with the same number will merge into one greater peg.","Après, des paires de pegs de même valeur vont fusionner en un peg plus grand.",		
"tut19","Let's try it out. Keep launching Nubby until you beat the goal.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]","On va essayer. Lance Nubby jusqu'à ce que tu dépasses l'objectif.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]",		
"tut20","You can do better than that. Do it again.","Tu peux faire mieux que ça, réessaye.",		
"tut21","Pegtacular! That was pegalicious! You're a star!","Pegtaculaire! Ca c'était Pegalicieux! T'es une star!",		
"tut22","Just kidding, no you're not.","Non je rigole, tu l'es pas vraiment",	
"tut23","Ok. We're almost done. To rearrange your new pegs, press the jumble button.","Ok. On a presque fini. Pour ré-arranger tes nouveaux pegs, clique sur le bouton pour les mélanger.",		
"tut24","Nice. Launch Nubby one more time [{a}] + [{b}]. I wanna show you something.","Bien. Lance Nubby encore une fois [{a}] + [{b}]. Je vais te montrer quelque chose.",		
"tut25","So you might have noticed that Nubby goes through some pegs, but not others.","Donc tu as du remarquer que nubby traverse certains pegs, mais pas d'autres.",		
"tut26","Nubby will break through 1's, but will bounce off any peg greater than 1.","Nubby traversera les 1, mais rebondira sur tous ceux plus grands que 1.",		
"tut27","Alright bud, that's it for the tutorial. You'll figure the rest out for yourself.","Ok mec, c'est tout pour le tutoriel. Tu découvrira le reste tout seul.",		
"tut28","OH! WAIT! WAIT! I FORGOT ONE THING!","AH! ATTEND! ATTEND! J'AI OUBLIE UN TRUC!",		
"tut29","Everytime you launch Nubby, you lose one life. If you run out of lives, the sun will explode.","Chaque fois que tu lances Nubby, tu perds une vie. Si tu n'as plus de vies, le soleil explosera.",		
"tut30","But luckily, everytime the board restocks, you get one life back.","Mais heureusement, chaque fois que la planche se réapprovisionne, tu reçois une vie.",		
"tut31","So as long as you keep making big numbers, nobody gets hurt.","Donc tant que tu fais des grands nombres, personne ne sera blessé.",
"tut32","Ok now I'm done. Thanks for not pressing the {a}skip tutorial{a} button. I know that was difficult for you.","Ok j'ai fini. Merci de ne pas avoir appuyé sur le bouton {a}passer le didactitiel{a}. Je sais que c'était dur pour toi.",	
"tut33","I'll start you off with a fresh, new factory now. Good luck.","Je vais te laisser avec une nouvelle usine flambant neuve. Bonne chance.",

"skiptut","Skip Tutorial","Passer le didactitiel",
		
