"challenge_name_0","{a}Amnesiac{a}","{a}Amnésique{a}",
"challenge_name_1","{a}Stay There!{a}","{a}Reste ici!{a}",
"challenge_name_2","{a}Short on Change{a}","{a}Pauvreté{a}",
"challenge_name_3","{a}Plain Jane{a}","{a}Fatima la fade{a}",
"challenge_name_4","{a}Expiration Date{a}","{a}Date de péremption{a}",
"challenge_name_5","{a}One-Shot McGee{a}","{a}Une balle un mort{a}",
"challenge_name_6","{a}Nubbelocke{a}","{a}Nubbelocke{a}",
"challenge_name_7","{a}Times up!{a}","{a}C'est fini!{a}",
"challenge_name_8","{a}Pol's Bane{a}","{a}L'atout-perdu{a}",
"challenge_name_9","{a}Pheebie-Mode{a}","{a}L'élu{a}",
"challenge_name_10","Nubby Trials: Level {a}","{a}Les épreuves de Nubby: Niveau {a}",

"challenge_wins","Wins: ","Victoires: ",
"supervisor_wins","Wins: ","Victoires: ",

"challenge_highscore","Highscore","Meilleur score",

"challenge_desc_0","*Items in shops are replaced by various mystery boxes.{a}*Mystery boxes give a random item when purchased.","*Les objets du magasin ont été remplacé par des boites mystère.{a}*Les boites mystère donnent un objet aléatoire une fois achetées.",
"challenge_desc_1","*You can jumble pegs once PER GAME.{a}*Rerolling items in shops is disabled.","*Tu peux mélanger les peg une fois PAR PARTIE.{a}*Les actualisations des objets des magasins sont désactivées.",
"challenge_desc_2","*Maximum coins are capped at 10.{a}*Items that cost more than 10 coins have reduced prices.","*Les pièces maximum sont limitées à 10.{a}*Les objets qui coutent plus de 10 pièces ont des prix réduits.",
"challenge_desc_3","*Rare items, foods, and perks cannot be found.","*Les objets rares, aliments, et atouts ne peuvent pas être trouvés.",
"challenge_desc_4","*Items will be deleted 15 rounds after they were obtained.{a}*Upgrading items will reset their expiration date.","*Les objets seront supprimé 15 manches après les avoir obtenus.{a}*Améliorer les objets réinitialise leur date d'expiration.",
"challenge_desc_5","*During restocks, you can only gain +1 life at most - even if you restocked more than once.{a}*You cannot gain lives using any alternative method.","*Durant les réapprovisionnements, tu ne peux gagner qu'une vie - même si tu a réapprovisionné plus de fois.{a}*Tu ne peux gagner des vie autrement.",
"challenge_desc_6","*Failure to meet the quota on any round will result in the left-most item being deleted.","*Ne pas atteindre le quota supprimera l'objet le plus à gauche.",
"challenge_desc_7","*A C-4 is strapped to Nubby.{a}*Nubby will explode and die after 1.5 seconds, causing a big explosion that pops pegs.","*Une C-4 est attachée à Nubby.{a}*Nubby explosera et mourra après 1,5 secondes, causant une grosse explosion qui éclate des pegs.",
"challenge_desc_8","*Perks cannot be obtained.","*Impossible d'obtenir des atouts.",
"challenge_desc_9","*If you start a round with more than 1 item in your inventory, all items will be disabled for the rest of the round.","*Si tu commences la manche avec moins d'un objet dans l'inventaire, tous les objets seront désactivés pour le reste de la manche.",
"challenge_desc_10","*Collect all 5 letters (N.U.B.B.Y.) by completing trials.{a}*You must beat round 80 to complete.{a}*Difficulty: {b}","*Collecte les 5 lettres (N.U.B.B.Y.) en completant les challenges.{a}*Tu dois battre la manche 80 pour les completer.{a}*Difficulté: {b}",

"NubbyTrialsAllLocked","Beat at least 5 challenges to unlock!","Bat au moins 5 challenges pour débloquer!",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Antimatter{d})","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Un objet malfaisant apparait dans la case {c}.{a}({d}Antimatière{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Shell Shocked!{c} boss.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Affronte le boss {c}Coquille électrique!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Items in slots {c} and {d} are destroyed.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Les objets dans les cases {c} et {d} sont détruits.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all coins.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Perd toutes les pièces.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All upgraded items are downgraded.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Tous les objets amélioré seront dégradés.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Dollhead{d})","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Un objet malfaisant apparait dans la case {c}.{a}({d}Tête de poupée{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All items are destroyed, except for evil items.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Tous les objets sont détruits, sauf les objets malfaisants.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Psychic Spider{d})","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Un objet malfaisant apparait dans la case {c}.{a}({d}Araignée psychique{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Bedrock Bash!{c} boss.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Affronte le boss {c}Cogneur de base!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Vies maximales limitées à {c}.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Homunculus{d})","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Un objet malfaisant apparait dans la case {c}.{a}({d}Homoncule{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum coins capped at {c}.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Pièces maximales limitées à {c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All rare and ultra-rare items are destroyed.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Tous les objets rares et ultra-rares sont détruits.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Holiday Cheer!{c} boss.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Affronte le boss {c}Joies des fêtes!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}{c}Homunculus{c} turns into {c}Alphamunculus{c} (harder variant).","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}{c}Homoncule{c} devient {c}Alphamoncule{c} (version plus dûre).",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Broken Figurine{d})","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Un objet malfaisant apparait dans la case {c}.{a}({d}Figurine cassée{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Scary Fingore{d})","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Un objet malfaisant apparait dans la case {c}.{a}({d}Doigt effrayant{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}I've Been Robbed!{c} boss.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Affronte le boss {c}J'ai été volé!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All non-upgraded items are destroyed.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Tous les objets non-améliorés sont détruits.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all but one life.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Perd toutes les vies sauf une.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Vies maximales limitées à {c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Rodent Bones{d})","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Un objet malfaisant apparait dans la case {c}.{a}({d}Ossements de rongeur{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Bottled Tears{d})","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Un objet malfaisant apparait dans la case {c}.{a}({d}Larmes en bouteille{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Pessimism!{c} boss.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Affronte le boss {c}Pessimiste!{c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All perks are destroyed.","A LA MANCHE {b}:{a}Tous les atouts sont détruits.",

