"NubbySkinName0","Nubby","Nubby",
"NubbySkinName1","Frog Nubby","Amphi-nubbien",
"NubbySkinName2","Blubby","Blubby",
"NubbySkinName3","Cheesy Nubby","Nubby le fromage",
"NubbySkinName4","Clown Nubby","Nubby le clown",
"NubbySkinName5","Cyborg Nubby","Nubby le cyborg",
"NubbySkinName6","Parasitic Nubby","Nubby le parasite",
"NubbySkinName7","Bisected Nubby","Nubby le bisecté",
"NubbySkinName8","Ol Chap Nubby","Nubby le vieux garçon",
"NubbySkinName9","Party Nubby","Nubby le fêtard",
"NubbySkinName10","Punk Nubby","Nubby le punk",
"NubbySkinName11","Teratoma Nubby","Nubby le tératome",
"NubbySkinName12","Baby Face Nubby","Nubby à la tête de bébé",
"NubbySkinName13","Goat Nubby","Nubby la chèvre",
"NubbySkinName14","Prototype Nubby","Nubby le prototype",
"NubbySkinName15","Tony Fan Nubby","Nubby le fan de Tony",
"NubbySkinName16","Number Farmer Nubby","Nubby l'éleveur de nombres",
"NubbySkinName17","Flutty Nubby","Nubby Flutty",
"NubbySkinName18","Glass Marble Nubby","Nubby la bille de verre",
"NubbySkinName19","Star-Employee Nubby","Nubby l'employé modèle",
"NubbySkinName20","Car Nubby","Nubby la voiture",

"NubbySkinDesc0","Nubby's classic look!","L'apparence classique de Nubby!",
"NubbySkinDesc1","This frog nubby was sent to us in the mail one day. We have no idea why this frog resembles nubby.","Cette grenouille nous a été envoyée par la poste un jour. On a aucune idée de pourquoi elle ressemble à Nubby.",
"NubbySkinDesc2","An endangered subspecies of nubbies, scientifically known as Nubbicus Aquaticus.","Un sous-espèce de Nubby en voie d'extinction, connue sous le nom scientifique de Nubbicus Aquaticus.",
"NubbySkinDesc3","A failed experiment, resulting from the factory's past attempts to tap into the cheese industry.","Un expérience ratée, résultat des essais de l'usine de s'introduire dans le marché du fromage.",
"NubbySkinDesc4","This nubby stole factory money to follow his dreams at clown college.","Ce Nubby a volé l'argent de l'usine pour pousuivre son rêve d'école de clown.",
"NubbySkinDesc5","This nubby made his own cosplay and thinks he has cyborg strength. Just let the poor guy have a dream...","Ce Nubby a crée son propre costume et pense qu'il a la force d'un cyborg. Laisse le avoir un rêve le pauvre...",
"NubbySkinDesc6","This nubby is also a parasite in the metaphorical sense too. If he asks, don't lend him any money.","Ce Nubby est aussi un parasite dans tous les sens du terme. S'il te demande, ne lui prête pas d'argent.",
"NubbySkinDesc7","In the nubby manufacturing process, things like this happen by accident sometimes.","Dans le processus de manufacture de Nubby, les choses comme ça arrivent par accident parfois.",
"NubbySkinDesc8","This nubby finds joy in Victorian Era live action roleplay. He's not hurting anyone so we let it happen.","Ce Nubby aime faire comme s'il vivait à l'époque Vistorienne. Il ne fait de mal à personne donc on le laisse faire.",
"NubbySkinDesc9","We keep this nubby around to celebrate employee birthdays. He's also super good at playing kazoo.","On garde ce Nubby pour célébrer les anniversaires des employés. Il est aussi super bon pour jouer du mirliton.",
"NubbySkinDesc10","Just for kicks, we sometimes make nubbies that can feel emotion. They all end up forming punk bands.","Just pour s'amuser, on fait ressentir des émotions aux Nubbies. Ils finissent par former des groupes punks.",
"NubbySkinDesc11","The result of our attempts at making self replicating nubbies to save money.","Le résultats de nos essais de réplication de Nubby pour économiser de l'argent.",
"NubbySkinDesc12","Despite his appearance, this nubby is very mature and sophisticated if you get to know him.","Malgrès son apparence, ce Nubby est très mature et sophistiqué si tu apprends à le connaitre.",
"NubbySkinDesc13","Back when the number factory had a petting zoo, this nubby was super popular. Of course, that was before the incident...","Quand l'usine avait un zoo, ce Nubby etait très populaire. Bien sur, c'était avant l'accident...",
"NubbySkinDesc14","One of the very first nubbies we cloned. Made way before we discovered their number harvesting capabilities.","Un des tous premiers Nubbies qu'on a clonés. Fait bien avant que l'on découvre leurs capacités de récolte de nombres.",
"NubbySkinDesc15","Tony thinks it's really funny to brainwash nubbies into thinking he's god.","Tony pense que c'est drôle de laver le cerveau de Nubbies pour qu'ils pensent être dieu.",
"NubbySkinDesc16","The PR team requested a {b}wholesome{b} nubby mascot to slap on all of our advertising and merch to overshadow our non-wholesome practices.","L'équipe de communication a demandé un Nubby {b}sympa{b} comme mascotte pour le mettre sur les publicités comme ça on cache no activités pas-sympa.",
"NubbySkinDesc17","One year we dressed this nubby up as a butterfly for Halloween. Now we have leave the costume on him because he'll try to bite you if you get near him.","Une année on a habillé ce Nubby en papillon pour Halloween. Maintenant on doit le laisser, parce que si tu l'apporches, il te mordra.",
"NubbySkinDesc18","This is just a souvenir that we sell to tourists at the number factory gift shop.","C'est juste un souvenir que l'on vend aux touristes dans la boutique souvenir de l'usine de nombres.",
"NubbySkinDesc19","This Nubby is an official star-employee at the number factory... Just like you!","Ce Nubby est un employé modèle officiel à l'usine de nombres...",
"NubbySkinDesc20","This Nubby angered the car wizard and as punishment he was turned into a car. Despite his curse, he remains joyous.","Ce Nubby à éveillé la colère du sorcier voiture et comme punition, il a été transformé en voiture. Malgrès cet malédiction, il reste joyeux.",

"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","This skin is a mystery...","Ce costume est un mystère...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","Who knows what this could be...","Qui sait ce que ça pourrait être...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","Oooh a mystery nubby...","Oooh un Nubby mystère...",

"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 1","Débloque ceci en battant le challenge de Nubby niveau 1",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 2","Débloque ceci en battant le challenge de Nubby niveau 2",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 3","Débloque ceci en battant le challenge de Nubby niveau 3",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_18","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 4","Débloque ceci en battant le challenge de Nubby niveau 4",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_19","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 5","Débloque ceci en battant le challenge de Nubby niveau 5",

