NubbySkinDesc0,Nubby's classic look!,O icónico Nubby orixinal!,
NubbySkinDesc1,This frog nubby was sent to us in the mail one day. We have no idea why this frog resembles nubby.,Un día mandáronnos esta ra por correo. Non temos nin idea de por que se parece tanto a Nubby.,
NubbySkinDesc2,"An endangered subspecies of nubbies, scientifically known as Nubbicus Aquaticus.","Unha subespecie en perigo de extinción, coñecida no ámbito científico como Nubbicus aquaticus.",
NubbySkinDesc3,"A failed experiment, resulting from the factory's past attempts to tap into the cheese industry.",Un vestixio de cando a fábrica intentou meterse sen éxito na industria queixeira.,
NubbySkinDesc4,This nubby stole factory money to follow his dreams at clown college.,Este Nubby roubou diñeiro da fábrica para cumprir o seu soño e ir ao colexio de pallasos.,
NubbySkinDesc5,This nubby made his own cosplay and thinks he has cyborg strength. Just let the poor guy have a dream...,Este Nubby fixo o seu propio disfrace e agora pensa que ten poderes cibernéticos. Déixao divertirse un pouco...,
NubbySkinDesc6,"This nubby is also a parasite in the metaphorical sense too. If he asks, don't lend him any money.",Este Nubby é un parasito no sentido literal e no sentido figurado. Se che pide cartos non llos deas.,
NubbySkinDesc7,"In the nubby manufacturing process, things like this happen by accident sometimes.",Na cadea de produción de Nubbys ás veces pasan cousas destas.,
NubbySkinDesc8,This nubby finds joy in Victorian Era live action roleplay. He's not hurting anyone so we let it happen.,"Este Nubby pásao en grande facendo rol de vitoriano. Como non lle fai dano a ninguén, deixámolo ser.",
NubbySkinDesc9,We keep this nubby around to celebrate employee birthdays. He's also super good at playing kazoo.,Temos este Nubby para felicitarlle o aniversario aos operarios. Toca o kazoo fenomenalmente.,
NubbySkinDesc10,"Just for kicks, we sometimes make nubbies that can feel emotion. They all end up forming punk bands.","Cando nos aburrimos, creamos Nubbys con capacidade emocional. Por algunha razón, todos forman bandas de música punk.",
NubbySkinDesc11,The result of our attempts at making self replicating nubbies to save money.,O resultado de intentar crear Nubbys autorreplicantes na busca de aforrar diñeiro.,
NubbySkinDesc12,"Despite his appearance, this nubby is very mature and sophisticated if you get to know him.","Malia a súa cara de bebé, este Nubby é moi maduro se falas un pouco con el.",
NubbySkinDesc13,"Back when the number factory had a petting zoo, this nubby was super popular. Of course, that was before the incident...","Cando a fábrica tiña un zoolóxico interactivo para os rapaces, este Nubby era moi popular. Logo pasou... o daquel día...",
NubbySkinDesc14,One of the very first nubbies we cloned. Made way before we discovered their number harvesting capabilities.,Un dos primeiros Nubbys que clonamos. Nin sequera sabiamos nese momento os seus dotes para colleitar números.,
NubbySkinDesc15,Tony thinks it's really funny to brainwash nubbies into thinking he's god.,A Toño faille moita gracia meterlle aos Nubbys na cabeza a idea de que é un deus todopoderoso.,
NubbySkinDesc16,The PR team requested a {b}wholesome{b} nubby mascot to slap on all of our advertising and merch to overshadow our non-wholesome practices.,Os de relacións co público pedíronnos unha mascota {b}bonita{b} para poñer nos anuncios da tele e nas gorras publicitarias para ocultar un pouco as prácticas non tan bonitas do noso negocio.,
NubbySkinDesc17,One year we dressed this nubby up as a butterfly for Halloween. Now we have to leave the costume on him because he'll try to bite you if you get near him.,Hai tempo vestimos de bolboreta a este Nubby polo Entroido. Non lle quitamos o disfrace porque cando te achegas moito inténtache morder a man.,
NubbySkinDesc18,This is just a souvenir that we sell to tourists at the number factory gift shop.,Isto só é unha trapallada que lles vendemos aos turistas na tenda de regalos da fábrica.,
NubbySkinDesc19,This Nubby is an official star-employee at the number factory... Just like you!,Este Nubby foi empregado do mes na fábrica durante dezasete anos... ata que chegaches ti!,
NubbySkinDesc20,"This Nubby angered the car wizard and as punishment he was turned into a car. Despite his curse, he remains joyous.","Este Nubby cabreou o mago automobilístico e o tipo maldiciuno e converteuno nun coche. Aínda así, continúa cheo de ledicia.",
,,,
NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version1,This skin is a mystery...,Este aspecto é todo un misterio...,
NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version2,Who knows what this could be...,Quen sabe que pode ser isto...,
NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version3,Oooh a mystery nubby...,Ooooh... un Nubby misterioso...,
,,,
