ItemSkinDesc0,Transform your seals into dapper gentlemen.,Transforma a túa foca normal e corrente nunha xentilfoca distinguida.,
ItemSkinDesc1,Turn your all-seeing pyramids into poorly drawn ancient artifacts.,Transforma a túa pirámide omnisciente nun artefacto milenario cun debuxo mal feito.,
ItemSkinDesc2,Turn your fake plastic trees into fake plastic trees.,Transforma a túa árbore de mentira nunha falsa árbore de mentira.,
ItemSkinDesc3,"Turn your kidney beans into kidneys, minus the beans.",Transforma a túa faba con forma de ril nun ril con forma de faba.,
ItemSkinDesc4,"Turn your e-blocks into hardened, stone-faced soldiers.",Transforma o teu bloque E nun endurecido artífice do brutalismo.,
ItemSkinDesc5,Turn your avocados into your friends!,Transforma o teu aguacate nun amigo.,
ItemSkinDesc6,Turn your jeans into jorts!,Transforma o teu pantalóns nuns calzóns.,
ItemSkinDesc7,Make your ton of feathers way heavier.,Transforma a túa tonelada de plumas nunha tonelada de ladrillos que pesa máis.,
ItemSkinDesc8,Turn your donut into a drawing of a donut.,Transforma a túa rosca nun garabato dunha rosca.,
ItemSkinDesc9,Fill your mushrooms with compacted C4.,Transforma o teu cogomelo nun cogomelo con C4.,
ItemSkinDesc10,"Replace your normal noodles with shorter, tubular noodles that are bent.",Transforma os teus fideos nuns fideos máis curtos e tubulares.,
ItemSkinDesc11,"Give your mannequin head some style, and a personality too!",Dálle a túa cabeza de manequín un pouco de estilo e personalidade.,
ItemSkinDesc12,Turn your mollusk into an extinct mollusk.,Transforma o teu molusco nun molusco extinto.,
ItemSkinDesc13,Turn your pedro into pedroooooooooooooooo.,Transforma o teu Pedro nun Pedrooooooooooooooooooooooo.,
ItemSkinDesc14,"Turn your clay man into a clay man, except this time he's actually made out of clay.",Transforma o teu homiño de plastilina nun homiño de plastilina feito na vida real.,
ItemSkinDesc15,Give poopbutt a timeout in the magic microwave.,Castiga a Cagacú cunha eternidade no microondas máxico.,
ItemSkinDesc16,"Release your sea cucumbers into the wild, and then make a handcrafted charm to honor their legacy.",Solta o teu cogombro de mar na natureza e fai un recordo a man para honrar o seu legado.,
ItemSkinDesc17,Turn your fish into a fish on a wall!,Transforma o teu peixe nun peixe cravado na parede.,
ItemSkinDesc18,Turn your squids into the best American carnival food!,"Transforma a túa lura nunha salchicha empanada, a americanada suprema!",
,,,
ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version1,A mystery item skin.. what is it?,Un aspecto misterioso para un obxecto...,
ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version2,How mysterious...,Vaia intriga...,
ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version3,I wonder what it is...,Pregúntome que podería ser...,
,,,
ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_15,Unlock this by beating the game at least once with every supervisor.,Acaba o xogo polo menos unha vez con cada supervisor para desbloquear!,
ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_16,Unlock this by reaching round 300 in endless mode on any supervisor.,Alcanza a rolda 300 nunha partida ilimitada calquera para desbloquear!,
ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_17,"Unlock this by beating all challenges, including all nubby trials levels.",Supera todos os desafíos e Probas de Nubby para desbloquear!,
,,,
warehouse_tutorial0,Greetings! The name's Sparkplug.,Bo día! Eu chámome Uxío Buxía.,
warehouse_tutorial1,You've entered my realm... the warehouse!,Entraches no meu dominio... o almacén!,
warehouse_tutorial2,"I'm the manager here, sort of. It's complicated...","Son o xerente deste sitio, creo. Éche unha cousa complicada.",
warehouse_tutorial3,"Anyways, who cares, am I right? I'm gonna show you around real quick.","Boh, tanto terá, non? Vouche facer unha visitiña guiada.",
warehouse_tutorial4,Here we are! The warehouse is where you buy and activate cosmetic nubby skins and item skins.,Velaquí o tes! No almacén podes comprar e usar aspectos para os teus obxectos e para o teu Nubby.,
warehouse_tutorial5,We're currently looking at the nubby skins menu. Press the item skins button to view the item skins menu.,Estás mirando o catálogo de aspectos de Nubby. Preme o botón do catálogo de aspectos de obxectos para cambiar a ese catálogo.,
warehouse_tutorial6,"This is the menu for buying and activating item skins, but we're going to focus on nubby skins for now.",Este é o catálogo para comprar e activar aspectos de obxectos. Mellor enfoquémonos nos aspectos de Nubby polo momento.,
warehouse_tutorial7,Go back to the nubby skins menu by pressing the nubby skins button.,Volve ao catálogo de aspectos de Nubby premendo o botón correspondente.,
warehouse_tutorial8,Use the arrows to page through my collection of cosmetics! Click the arrows a couple times and we'll move on.,Usa as frechas para botarlle unha ollada á colección! Clica nas frechas un par de veces e seguimos.,
warehouse_tutorial9,Good job! Here's 10 free stars as a reward for being so obedient!,Bárbaro! Toma 10 estreliñas por ser tan obediente!,
warehouse_tutorial10,"Now, find a nubby skin you can afford and buy it.",Que che parece se procuras un aspecto para comprar?,
warehouse_tutorial11,Nice. Now hit the green button below to activate it.,Este serve. Agora preme ese botonciño verde para usar o aspecto.,
warehouse_tutorial12,"You can only activate one nubby skin at a time, but you can activate multiple item skins at once.","Só podes usar un aspecto para Nubby á vez, pero podes usar varios aspectos de obxecto ao mesmo tempo.",
warehouse_tutorial13,"Other than that, nubby skins and item skins work the same way.","Polo demais, ambos os tipos de aspecto sonche basicamente o mesmo.",
warehouse_tutorial14,Ok. That's pretty much all I have left to say I think.,Creo que iso é todo o que che teño que contar.,
warehouse_tutorial15,You're probably smart and you can figure the rest out for yourself.,Tes cara de ter moito miolo na cabeza. Seguro que o resto xa o maquinas ti.,
warehouse_tutorial16,I'm not gonna go away though because I don't trust you.,Non marcho aínda porque tamén me tes cara de maleante.,
warehouse_tutorial17,"By the way, did I mention that I'm also the official number factory historian?","Por certo, sabías que son o historiador oficial da empresa?",
warehouse_tutorial18,"If you poke me, I'll tell you a random fact about the number factory. Anyways, have fun!","Dáme un toque e cóntoche algún dato así curioso da fábrica. Ea, agora si, vai pasalo ben.",
,,,
Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome1,"Yeah, sure. Feel free to barge in unannounced.","Si, si, ti entra cando queiras e sen avisar.",
Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome2,"Welcome in! You need to learn to knock, though.","Fas ben en vir, pero farías mellor en petar na porta antes.",
Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome3,Welcome back! I totally wasn't in the middle of something.,"Entra, para nada estaba eu ocupado cunha choia aquí.",
,,,
SparkplugRandomDialogue0,"Nubbies are a species of genetically modified human. They also have DNA from over 300 random mammals, fish, and reptiles.",Os Nubbys son unha especie de humano con modificacións xenéticas. Tamén teñen ADN de 300 mamíferos e peixes e bicharías desas.,
SparkplugRandomDialogue1,"There is no singular nubby. Rather, nubbies are genetically cloned right here at the factory. It's the way we've always done it.","Non existe un só Nubby, así como quen di. Os Nubbys son clonados xeneticamente aquí na fábrica. Sempre o fixemos así.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue2,"Not counting the incubation phase of nubby production, the average nubby life span is 6 seconds.","Sen contar a fase de incubación da produción de Nubbys, a esperanza de vida media dun Nubby é de 6 segundos máis ou menos.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue3,"The nubby production process is a highly guarded secret, we're the only number factory to own the nubby patent.",A produción de Nubbys é cousa de alto segredo. Somos a única fábrica do mundo coa patente dos Nubbys.,
SparkplugRandomDialogue4,Other companies in the number industry try to produce numbers ethically without using nubbies. No other company is as successful as us.,"Outras empresas da industria numerística alardean de producións de números éticas sen facer uso de Nubbys. Aínda así, ninguén ten máis éxito ca nós.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue5,"We produce numbers for the whole world to use in their math problems, computations, and calculations. Without numbers, the laws of physics cease to exist.","Producimos números para o seu uso internacional en problemas de matemáticas, computacións e cálculos. Sen eles, as leis da física cesarían de existir.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue6,"Years ago, I was hired to help remove asbestos from the warehouse. The other employees mistakenly thought I was a manager here, so I just rolled with it and here we are.","Hai xa anos, contratáronme para quitar o amianto do almacén. Os outros traballadores pensaron que eu era o novo encargado do sitio, entón dixen “que lle dean!”, e aquí me ves agora.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue7,"The factory pays me based on how many hours I spend in the warehouse, so I moved in and I haven't left in years.","A empresa págame por cada hora que paso dentro do almacén, entón un día collín e mudeime aquí dentro. Levo anos sen saír.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue8,Sometimes Tony and I listen to music and drive the forklift around to kill time. He's a nice guy once you get to know him.,Ás veces Toño e mais eu escoitamos a radio mentres facemos piruetas coa carreta elevadora para pasar o tempo. É un tipo moi agradábel cando o coñeces máis a fondo.,
SparkplugRandomDialogue9,Nobody's met the boss of the number factory. Nobody knows if there even is one. You could fire Tony and he couldn't do anything about it.,Ninguén viu nunca o xefe da empresa. Non sabemos se sequera temos. Poderían botar a Toño da empresa e o pobre non sería capaz de reclamarllo a ninguén.,
SparkplugRandomDialogue10,"A while ago, Tony covered a bunch of nubbies in paint and threw them at my wall. He's a great artist!","Fai un tempo, Toño meteu un puñado de Nubbys nun bote de pintura e tirounos contra a miña parede. É un artista excepcional!",
SparkplugRandomDialogue11,We don't even store anything in the warehouse. My only job is to explain what the warehouse is to new employees and drive the forklift.,No almacén non almacenamos nada. O meu traballo é explicarlles aos novos funcionarios o propósito deste sitio e conducir a carreta.,
SparkplugRandomDialogue12,"Here at the factory, we don't produce our number pegs - we buy them from the peg factory. they won't tell us what they're made of, so it can't be good.","Nesta fábrica non se producen fichas de números, comprámolas da fábrica de fichas. Non nos queren dicir de que están feitas, polo que probabelmente non sexa algo bonito.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue13,"We protect nubbies from themselves and from our rival companies. If they leave the factory grounds, they self destruct.","Protexemos os Nubbys das empresas rivais e de si mesmos. Se abandonan o polígono, autodestrúense.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue14,"Nubbies usually can't feel emotion, but they all have their own unique personality.","Os Nubbys non son capaces de sentir emocións, pero aínda así cada un ten a súa propia personalidade.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue15,"If nubbies are kept alive for too long, they slowly turn into cubes. We don't know why.","Se un Nubby vive demasiado tempo, comeza a transformarse nun cubo. Aínda non sabemos por que.",
SparkplugRandomDialogue16,Tony and I go way back. I don't know if he's shy or something but I've known him for over a decade and I've never seen him take the glasses off.,Toño e mais eu somos amigos dende hai moito. Non sei se lle dá vergoña ou algo así pero coñézoo dende hai unha década e non o vin nunca sen as lentes esas.,
SparkplugRandomDialogue17,You should really wear a gas mask in here. There's still tons of asbestos everywhere.,Creo que deberías poñer unha máscara de gas aquí dentro. Aínda queda un montón de amianto.,
SparkplugRandomDialogue18,Nubbies are the only known creature that can harvest numbers. Their bodies have the exact shape and texture required to harvest numbers.,Os Nubbys son a única especie coñecida capaz de colleitar números. Os seus corpos teñen a forma e textura necesaria para facer a colleita de números.,
SparkplugRandomDialogue19,I've overheard talks about the number factory getting into letter production as well. Who knows... letters are in high demand these days.,Ouvín rumores que din que a fábrica de números vai comezar tamén a producir letras. Quen sabe... as letras están moi demandadas hoxe en día.,
SparkplugRandomDialogue20,"You didn't hear this from me, but I've heard that nubbies taste like grape candy.","Isto non cho contei eu, pero teño ouvido por aí que os Nubbys saben a zume de uva.",
