"supervisorname_tony","Tony","Toño",
"supervisorname_octopus","Octo-ny","Toño Pulpo",
"supervisorname_tonyjr","Tony Jr.","Toño Jr",
"supervisorname_goblin","Goblony","Toño Duende",
"supervisorname_mutant","Mutant Tony","Toño Mutante",
"supervisorname_glass","Glass Tony","Toño de Cristal",
"supervisorname_hunter","Hunter Tony","Toño Cazador",
"supervisorname_balogna","Balogna Tony","Toño a la Boloñesa",
"supervisorname_criminal","Criminal Tony","ToñoCriminal",
"supervisorname_ceo","C.E.O. Tony","Toño Ejecutivo",
"supervisorname_immortal","Immortal Tony","Toño Inmortal",
"supervisorname_dwarf","Dwarf Tony","Toño Enano",

"supervisordesc_tony","*The standard Nubby experience!","¡La experiencia regular de Nubby!",
"supervisordesc_octopus","*Squids are {b}x more likely to appear in Nubby-Mart.{a}*Squids cost {c}% less.","*Los calamares tienen {b}x mas probabilidad de aparecer en el MercaNubby.{a}*Los calamares cuestan {c}% menos.",
"supervisordesc_tonyjr","*Start the game with {b} coins.{a}*You will enter Nubby-Mart when the game starts.{a}*Rare and ultra rare items are twice as likely to appear in shops.","*Empieza la partida con {b} monedas.{a}*Empezarás la partida en el MercaNubby.{a}*Objetos raros y ultra-raros tendrán el doble de probabilidad de aparecer en las tiendas.",
"supervisordesc_goblin","*You receive +3 coins per restock instead of 1.{a}*Maximum coins limit is raised to {b}.{a}*You lose two lives when you launch Nubby.","Recibes +3 monedas por recarga en vez de 1.{a}*El máximo de monedas será limitado a {b}.{a}*Pierdes 2 vidas cuando lanzas a Nubby.",
"supervisordesc_mutant","*Items have two trigger types.{a}*For example, an item could trigger when the round goal is passed OR when Nubby dies.","Los objetos tendrán dos maneras de activarse.{a}*Por ejemplo, un objeto puede activarse cuando complete la cuota O cuando Nubby muere.",
"supervisordesc_glass","*Maximum lives capped at {b}.{a}*When an item triggers, it triggers twice.{a}*Perks and food items are unaffected.","El máximo de vidas esta limitado a {b}.{a}*Los objetos se activan dos veces en vez de una.{a}*Los perks y comidas no se verán afectados.",
"supervisordesc_hunter","*Adds a moving target to the bottom of the pegboard.{a}*If Nubby hits the target, gain +{b} coins AND double total score.{a}*You cannot gain coins from restocks.","Agrega un objetivo en movimiento al fondo del tablero de las fichas.{a}*Si Nubby acierta el objetivo, adquiere +{b} monedas y TAMBIÉN duplica tu puntaje total.{a}*No ganarás monedas de las recargas.",
"supervisordesc_balogna","*Item and perk triggers are randomized at the start of the run. Don't question it.","La manera en la cual se activan los objetos y los perks serán elegidos aleatoriamente al inicio de cada partida. No preguntes.",
"supervisordesc_criminal","*Black market items can appear in Nubby-Mart and mystery capsules. Black market items cost money in Nubby-Mart.","Los objetos del mercado negro apareceran en el MercaNubby y tambien apareceran capsulas misteriosas. Los objetos del mercado negro cuestan dinero.",
"supervisordesc_ceo","*Start game with {b} coins.{a}*You cannot gain more coins.","Inicia el juego con {b} monedas.{a}*No podras ganar mas monedas.",
"supervisordesc_immortal","*Replaces endless mode with prestige mode.{a}*When you win, you can prestige.{a}*This restarts the game and increases the difficulty for each prestige level.","Reemplaza el modo infinito con el modo prestigio.{a}*Cuando ganes el juego podrás prestigiar.{a}* Esto reinicia la partida e incrementa la dificultad por cada nivel de prestigio.",
"supervisordesc_dwarf","*Every round, spawns helpful {b}Gem Pegs{b} and hurtful {b}Rock Pegs{b}.{a}*These pegs become very chaotic as the game progresses.{a}*No special events or bosses, except for the final boss.","*Cada ronda, aparecen {b}fichas de gema{b} que te ayudarán y también {b}fichas de roca{b} que te perjudicarán.{a}*Estas fichas se convierten más caóticas mientras progresa el juego.",

"txt_nametag","Hello! My name is:","¡Hola! Mi nombre es:",

"svbtn_go","GO!","¡EMPEZAR!",

"customseed_warning","Warning: Using a custom seed disables achievements,stars, and unlocks.","Advertencia: Usar una semilla personalizada desactiva los logros, estrellas y desbloqueos",
                      
