"null","[#ffd500]Error: null","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc0","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Estalla una ficha random. Cuando esta ficha es estallada, te dará el doble de puntos.",		
"item_desc1","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita el efecto no mejorado de la comida más recientemente comprada{a}*Imitara: {c}{b}{c}. {d}",		
"item_desc2","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quill that falls from the sky and pops {c} peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca {b} una pluma que cae del cielo y estalla {c} fichas.",		
"item_desc3","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}* Una ficha random explotara y estallara {b} (máximo) fichas cercanas.",		
"item_desc4","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}* Todos los objetos en tu inventario te darán puntos iguales a un número random de una ficha.",		
"item_desc5","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}meat-orb{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si nubby sigue vivo, invoca una {b}bola de carne{b} que flotara en el tablero y estallara fichas.",		
"item_desc6","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} en {c} de probabilidad de duplicar TODAS las fichas.",		
"item_desc7","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Maxes out at {b} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}* Gana +1 moneda por cada fresa que has comido en la partida.{a}*Se limita a {b} monedas.",		
"item_desc8","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot shots{b} that pop any pegs they pass through.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una ficha random emitirá {c}{b} corrientes de mocos {b} que estallan cualquier ficha que atraviesen.",		
"item_desc9","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca una pajilla que hará estallar una ficha.{a}*Fichas estalladas por las pajillas darán +{b}% adicional de su #.{a}*Adquiere +{c}% por cada vez que se han reacomodado las fichas en la partida.",		
"item_desc10","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to double the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Todas las fichas darán puntos iguales al doble del número de la ficha con el # mas pequeño. ",		
"item_desc11","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de causar una explosión gigante que estalla todas las fichas.",		
"item_desc12","[#ffffff]{a}*Every empty peg space will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada espacio de ficha vacío dará puntos iguales a la cantidad de fichas estalladas esta ronda.",	
"item_desc13","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the right-most item in your inventory.{a}*Deletes the left-most item in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Mejora el objeto que esté hasta la derecha del inventario.{a}*Elimina el objeto que esté hasta la izquierda del inventario.",
"item_desc14","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Estalla {b} ficha random.",		
"item_desc15","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiplica puntos totales por {b}x.",		
"item_desc16","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby da puntos igual al número de veces que ha rebotado esta ronda.",		
"item_desc17","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sharp-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Lanza un filoso disparo que estalla una ficha random.",		
"item_desc18","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}* Da +1 {b}Perk de Croissant{b}.",	
"item_desc19","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives a copy of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Da una copia del ultimo perk obtenido.{a}(Ahora mismo {b})",		
"item_desc20","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an egg missile that falls from the sky and causes an explosion that pops a row of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si nubby sigue vivo, invoca un misil de huevo que cae del cielo y explota una fila de fichas.",		
"item_desc21","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the lowest # peg twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Estalla el peg con el # más bajo dos veces.",	
"item_desc22","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{c}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de no hacer nada.{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de dividir una ficha random.",		
"item_desc23","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +{b} puntos por cada vez este objeto se ha activado esta ronda.{a}*{c} / {d} de probabilidad de hacer metamorfosis.",		
"item_desc24","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de crear una cadena eléctrica que estalla una area de fichas.",		
"item_desc25","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}meat-orbs{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si nubby sigue vivo, invoca {c}{b}orbes de carne{b} que flotaran y estallan fichas.{a}*Los orbes morirán cuando nubby muera.",
		
"item_desc26","[#ffffff]{a}*Test{b}","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
		
"item_desc27","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs will copy the # of the first peg popped.{a}*If this item is in slot #{c}, {d} pegs will be affected instead of {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} fichas copiaran el # de la primera ficha estallada.{a}*Si este objeto está en la casilla #{c}, {d} fichas serán afectadas en vez de {b}.",
"item_desc28","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*da +{b} puntos por cada vez este objeto se ha activado esta ronda.",		
"item_desc29","[#ffffff]{a}*Every peg will give points equal to {b}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada ficha dará puntos iguales al {b}% de su #.",		
"item_desc30","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles a random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Duplica una ficha random.",		
"item_desc31","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into the non-upgraded version of the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Muta a la versión no mejorada del [#ffb3ff]OBJETO A MI IZQUIERDA[#ffffff] por el resto de la ronda.",		
"item_desc32","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a pulse that doubles pegs within close range.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una ficha al azar emite un pulso que duplica el # de las fichas a su alrededor.",	
"item_desc33","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emits a burst of nuclear waste.{a}*Nuclear waste pops any pegs it touches.{a}*If Nubby isn't alive, a random peg will emit the burst.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emite una explosion de residuos nucleares. {a}* Los residuos nucleares estallan cualquier ficha que toquen.{a}* Si nubby no esta vivo, una ficha random emitirá los residuos.",
"item_desc34","[#ffffff]{a}*Marks a random peg.{a}*When a peg is marked, all pegs that have the same number will be doubled.{a}*If no pegs have the same number as the marked peg, a random peg will be doubled.","[#ffffff]{a}*Marca una ficha random.{a}* Cuando una ficha esta marcada, todas las fichas del mismo # serán duplicadas.{a}*Si no hay fichas con el mismo #, una ficha al azar será duplicada.",
"item_desc35","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs get smacked.{a}*When a peg is smacked, it counts as a {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg halved [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] trigger without actually halving it.","[#ffffff]{a}* {b} fichas random son golpeadas.{a}* Cuando una ficha es golpeada, cuenta como una {a}[#ffd500]{c}Ficha dividida [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] sin tener que dividirla",	
"item_desc36","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for each remaining life.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +1 moneda por cada vida que te quede.",	
"item_desc37","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles {c} random pegs whose # is less than {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Duplica {c} fichas random que tengan un # menor que {b}.",	
"item_desc38","[#ffffff]{a}*50% chance to double total coins.{a}*50% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*50% de probabilidad de duplicar todas tus monedas.{a}*50% de probabilidad de eliminar todas tus monedas.",
"item_desc39","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random common item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Muta a un objeto común random que no esté en tu inventario actualmente por el resto de la ronda",
"item_desc40","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de duplicar una ficha random.",
"item_desc41","[#ffffff]{a}*Halves the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times","[#ffffff]{a}*Divide el peg con el # más grande.{a}*Duplica el peg con el # más bajo {b} veces",
"item_desc42","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay balls.{a}*If a clay ball bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay balls die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca {b} bolas de arcilla.{a}*si una bola rebota con una pared o ficha, contará como un [#ffd500]{d}Nubby rebota con pared [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]activado..{a}*Las bolas de arcilla mueren después de {c} rebotes.",
"item_desc43","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita el efecto de la versión no mejorad del objeto en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#ffffff], pero mantiene su propia activación.",
"item_desc44","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +{b} puntos.{a}*Si estás en la ronda {d} o superior, gana +{c} puntos.",
"item_desc45","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Da +1 {b}Perk de Kebab{b}.",
"item_desc46","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Agrega un objeto de comida rara.",
"item_desc47","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si la primera ficha estallada es la del # más alto, multiplica los puntos totales por {b}x.",
"item_desc48","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Estalla {b} pegs random",
"item_desc49","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg becomes a copy of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*El peg con el # más bajo se convierte en el del # más grande.",
"item_desc50","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +1 reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Al volver al Mercanubby, gana +1 cambios.",
"item_desc51","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduce la cuota por -{b}%.{a} Divide todas las fichas.",
"item_desc52","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers an electron beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an electron beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Electron beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa un rayo de electrones que pasa por las fichas,{a} Cuando el rayo pasa por una ficha, la ficha da el {b}% de su #.{a}*El rayo NO estalla fichas.",
"item_desc53","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits a god ray.{a}*The god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Emite un rayo mítico.{a}* el rayo estalla rápidamente una ficha al azar por cada vez que el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #1 [#ffffff] se ha activado esta ronda.",
"item_desc54","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa el perk obtenido más reciente.{a}(ahora mismo {b})",
"item_desc55","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}* La ficha con el # más bajo da puntos igual al {b}x de su #.{a}* si el # más bajo es {d} o menos, dará +{c} puntos.",
"item_desc56","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca una pelota de playa que emite {b} corrientes de confetti cuando estalle.{a}*Fichas estalladas por confetti dan el {c}% de su #.",

"item_desc57","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc58","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to a copy of himself.","[#ffffff]{a}* Nubby da a luz a una copia de sí mismo.",
"item_desc59","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*
{b}% de probabilidad de duplicar la ficha con el # más grande.",
"item_desc60","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Emite una corriente de icor, por cada {b} veces que Nubby haya muerto esta partida.{a}*Cuando una ficha sea golpeada con el icor, [#ffd500]{c}completa la cuota de la ronda [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] objetos y perks se activaran.{a}(ahora mismo emite {d})",
"item_desc61","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all items in your inventory... Good luck!","[#ffffff]{a}*Aleatoriza todos los objetos de tu inventario… Buena suerte!",
"item_desc62","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]{a}*Contiene un objeto común random del Mercanubby.",
"item_desc63","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Contiene un objeto random común del mercado negro.",
"item_desc64","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Contiene un objeto random común de comida.",
"item_desc65","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*Por cada recarga del tablero, gana +{b} puntos.{a}(ahora mismo +{c} puntos)",
"item_desc66","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una ficha random emite un {b}Rayo Cósmico{b}.{a}* cuando una ficha es completamente estallada por el rayo cuenta como {c} fichas estalladas en vez de 1.",
"item_desc67","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cuando esto es activado forzadamente, transfiere la activación forzada al [#ffb3ff]OBJETO A SU IZQUIERDA[#ffffff].{a}*Tiene {c}% de probabilidad de agregar una activación forzada.",
"item_desc68","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points four times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Estalla una ficha al azar. cuando lo hace, dará puntos cuatro veces.",

"item_desc69","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc70","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quills that fall from the sky and pop {c} peg each.{a}*10% chance to summon one additional quill (3 total).","TRANSLATED TEXT GOES HERE",
"item_desc71","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una ficha al azar explota y estalla {b} (máximas) fichas cercanas",
"item_desc72","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to double the value of a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada objeto en tu inventario dará puntos iguales al doble del valor de una ficha al azar.",
"item_desc73","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}disease-orb{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby sigue vivo, invoca un {b} orbe enfermizo{b} que flotara agresivamente y estallara fichas.{a}* Los orbes morirán cuando nubby muera",
"item_desc74","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.{a}*{d} in {e} chance to double all pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} / {c} de probabilidad de duplicar todas las fichas.{a}*{d} / {e} de probabilidad de duplicar todas las fichas dos veces.",

"item_desc75","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc76","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot rockets{b} that pop any pegs they pass through twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*una ficha random emitirá {c} {b} cohetes de moco{b} que estallan cualquier ficha por la que pasen dos veces.",
"item_desc77","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*+Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca una pajilla que estalla una ficha.{a}*Fichas estalladas por pajillas dan un +{b}% adicional de su #.{a}*+Gana +{c} por cada vez que has reacomodado las fichas esta partida",
"item_desc78","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to quadruple the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Todas las fichas dan puntos iguales al cuádruple del # más pequeño de una ficha",
"item_desc79","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de causar una explosion que estalla todas las fichas al mismo tiempo.{a}*{c}% de probabilidad si estás en tu última vida.",
"item_desc80","[#ffffff]{a}*ALL peg spaces will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*TODOS los espacios de ficha te darán puntos iguales a la cantidad de fichas estalladas esta ronda.",
"item_desc81","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items in your inventory.{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Aleatoriza todas las activaciones de los objetos de tu inventario.{a}* Este cambio no puede ser revertido.",
"item_desc82","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*estalla {b} fichas random.",
"item_desc83","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiplica puntos totales por {b}x",
"item_desc84","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to double the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*nubby gana puntos iguales al doble de veces que ha rebotado esta ronda.",
"item_desc85","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sword-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca un disparo de espada que estalla una ficha al azar.",

"item_desc86","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc87","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc88","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an ostrich-egg missile that falls from the sky an causes an explosion that pops 1 row and 1 column of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si nubby sigue vivo, invoca un misil de huevo de avestruz que cae del cielo y causa una explosion que explota una fila y columna de fichas.",
"item_desc89","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the two lowest # pegs, twice each.","[#ffffff]{a}*Estalla las dos fichas con el # más bajo, dos veces cada una.",
"item_desc90","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{d}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de no hacer nada.{a}*{c}% de probabilidad de duplicar una ficha random.",
"item_desc91","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*da +{b} puntos por cada vez que este objeto ha sido activado esta ronda.{a}{c} / {d} de probabilidad de hacer metamorfosis.",
"item_desc92","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a high-voltage chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de crear una corriente de alto voltaje que estalla un área de fichas dos veces.",
"item_desc93","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}disease-orbs{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si Nubby sigue vivo, invoca un {b} orbes enfermizos{b} que flotaran agresivamente y estallan fichas.{a}* Los orbes morirán cuando nubby muera.",

"item_desc94","[[#ffffff]{a}*Test{b}","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc95","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs will copy the # of the first peg popped.{a}*If this item is in slot #{c}, {d} pegs will be affected instead of {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} fichas random copiaran el # de la primera ficha estallada.{a}*Si este objeto está en la casilla #{c}, {d} fichas serán afectadas en vez de {b}.",
"item_desc96","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Da *{b} puntos por cada vez que este objeto se ha activado esta ronda.",
"item_desc97","[#ffffff]{a}*Every peg will give points equal to {b}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Cada ficha da puntos igual al {b}% de su #.",
"item_desc98","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles a random peg twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Duplica una ficha al azar dos veces.",
"item_desc99","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into the upgraded version of the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME [#ffffff] for the rest of the round","[#ffffff]{a}*Muta a la versión mejorada del [#ffb3ff]OBJETO A MI IZQUIERDA[#ffffff] por el resto de la ronda ",
"item_desc100","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a super pulse that doubles pegs within close range twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Una ficha random emite un super pulso que duplica fichas cercanas a ella dos veces.",
"item_desc101","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emits a burst of bouncy {b}unstable waste{b}.{a}*Unstable waste bounces and pops any pegs it touches.{a}*If Nubby isn't alive, a random peg will emit the burst.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emite una explosion de {b}residuos nucleares{b} que rebotan.{a}* Estos residuos estallan cualquier ficha que toquen.{a}*Si Nubby no está vivo, una ficha random emitirá la explosion. ",
"item_desc102","[#ffffff]{a}*Marks a random peg.{a}*When a peg is marked, all pegs that have the same number will be doubled twice.{a}*If no pegs have the same number as the marked peg, a random peg will be doubled twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Marca una ficha random.{a}*Cuando es marcada, todas las fichas que tienen el mismo # serán duplicadas dos veces. {a}* Si ninguna ficha tiene el mismo número que la marcada, una ficha será duplicada dos veces.",
"item_desc103","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs get smacked twice.{a}*When a peg is smacked, it counts as a {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg halved [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] trigger without actually halving it.","[#ffffff]{a}* {b} fichas random son golpeadas.{a}* Cuando una ficha es golpeada, cuenta como una {a}[#ffd500]{c}Ficha dividida [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] sin tener que dividirla.",

"item_desc104","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc105","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles {c} random pegs whose # is less than {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Duplica {c} fichas random que tengan un # menor que {b}.",

"item_desc106","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc107","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random rare or ultra-rare item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Muta a un objeto raro o ultra-raro que no esté actualmente en tu inventario por el resto de la ronda",
"item_desc108","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de duplicar una ficha random.",
"item_desc109","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% chance to halve the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% de probabilidad de dividir la ficha con el # más grande.{a}*Duplica la ficha con el # más bajo {b} veces.",
"item_desc110","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay prisms.{a}*If a clay prism bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay prisms die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca {b} prismas de arcilla.{a}*Si un prisma de arcilla rebota en una pared O ficha, contará como un [#ffd500]{d}Nubby rebota con la pared[spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff] activado.{a}* Los prismas de arcilla mueren después de rebotar {c} veces.",
"item_desc111","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita la versión mejorada del objeto en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#ffffff], pero mantiene su propia activación.",
"item_desc112","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +{b} puntos.{a}* Si estas en la ronda {d} o más alto, ganarás +{c} puntos.",

"item_desc113","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc114","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc115","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si la primera ficha estallada fue la del # mas alto, multiplica la puntuacion total por {b}x.",
"item_desc116","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs, twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Estalla {b} fichas al azar dos veces.",
"item_desc117","[#ffffff]{a}*The two lowest # pegs become copies of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Las dos fichas con el # mas bajo se convierten en las que tengan el # mas alto",

"item_desc118","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc119","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduce la cuota por -{b}%.{a}*Divide todas las fichas.",
"item_desc120","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers a hyper-beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an hyper-beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Hyper-beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa un hyper-rayo que pasa a través de todas las fichas.{a}* Cuando el rayo pasa por una ficha, la ficha da el {b}% de su #.{a}*Los hyper-rayos NO estallan fichas.",
"item_desc121","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits two god rays.{a}*Each god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Este objeto emite dos ratos celestiales.{a}*Cada rayo estalla fichas rapidamente por cada vez que el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #1 [#ffffff] se ha activado esta ronda.",
"item_desc122","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk twice.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Activa el perk obtenido más recientemente dos veces.{a}(ahora mismo {b})",
"item_desc123","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*la ficha con el # más bajo da puntos igual al {b}x de su #.{a}* si el # más bajo es {d} o menos, dara +{c}.",
"item_desc124","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a MEGA beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca una MEGA pelota de playa que al explotar emite {b} corrientes de confetti.{a}*Las fichas estalladas por el confetti daran el {c}% de su #.",

"item_desc125","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty Description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc126","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to two copies of himself.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby da a luz a dos copias de si mismo.",
"item_desc127","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de duplicar la ficha con el # más alto",
"item_desc128","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Emite una corriente de icor, por cada {b} veces que Nubby haya muerto esta partida.{a}*Cuando una ficha sea golpeada con el icor, [#ffd500]{c}Completa la cuota de la ronda [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] objetos y perks se activaran.{a}(ahora mismo emite {d})",
"item_desc129","[#ffffff]{a}*Temporarily upgrades cafe foods that are currently available for purchase.","[#ffffff]{a}*Mejora temporalmente la comida del comedor nubby.",

"item_desc130","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc131","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc132","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc133","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*Por cada vez que el tablero a sido recargado en la partida, gana +{b} puntos.{a}(Actualmente +{c} puntos)",
"item_desc134","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Giant Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a giant cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}* Una ficha random emitirá {b}explosiones-cósmicas gigantes{b}.{a}*Cuando una ficha es estallada por la explosion-cósmica gigante, contara como {c} fichas estalladas en vez de 1.",
"item_desc135","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}* Cuando este objeto es activado forzosamente, la activación forzada se transfiere a [#ffb3ff] EL OBJETO A MI IZQUIERDA[#ffffff].{a}* Tiene un {c}% de probabilidad de adicionar +1 activación forzada adicional.",
"item_desc136","[#ffffff]{a}*If you have less than maximum lives, restores +1 life.{a}*Otherwise, gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}* Si tienes menos que la cantidad máxima de vidas, se agregara +1 vida.{a}*Si ya tienes el maximo de vida, podrás cambiar +1 vez adicional el comedor Nubby.",
"item_desc137","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.{a}*This does not increase odds of ultra-rare items.","[#ffffff]{a}* +{b}% de probabilidad adicional en encontrar objetos raros en todas las tiendas.{a}* Esta comida no incrementa la probabilidad de objetos ultra raros.",
"item_desc138","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Reabastece una comida ultra rara.",
"item_desc139","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Contiene un objeto raro random del Mercanubby.",
"item_desc140","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Contiene un objeto raro random del mercado negro.",
"item_desc141","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Contiene una comida rara random.",
"item_desc142","[#ffffff]*Contains a copy of a random item in your inventory.{a}*If you have no items, this will give a random common item.","[#ffffff]*Contiene una copia random de un objeto de tu inventario.{a}*Si no tiene objetos, te dará un objeto común raro.",
"item_desc143","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Contiene un objeto ultra-raro random del Mercanubby.",
"item_desc144","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Contiene un objeto ultra-raro random del mercado negro.",
"item_desc145","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]*Contiene una comida ultra-rara random.",
"item_desc146","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +1 additional time per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Puedes reacomodar el tablero +1 vez adicional por turno.",
"item_desc147","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Otorga +1 cambio adicional al comedor Nubby.",
"item_desc148","[#ffffff]{a}*Deletes the left-most item.{a}*The right-most item transforms into a squid.{a}*If the right-most item is upgraded, it transforms into an upgraded squid.","[#ffffff]{a}*Elimina el objeto al extremo de la izquierda de tu inventario.{a}*El objeto al extremo a la derecha de tu inventario se transformara en un calamar.{a}* Si el objeto al extremo a la derecha está mejorado, el calamar también estará mejorado.",
"item_desc149","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}*% de probabilidad de activar forzosamente [#ffb3ff]LOS DOS OBJETOS A MI IZQUIERDA Y A MI DERECHA[#ffffff].{a}*Las probabilidades disminuyen un {c}% cada vez que se activa exitosamente.{a}*Las probabilidades se reinician a {b}% cuando la ronda se acabe.",
"item_desc150","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de activar forzosamente [#ffb3ff]LOS DOS OBJETOS A MI IZQUIERDA Y A MI DERECHA[#ffffff].{a}*Las probabilidades disminuyen un {c}% cada vez que se activa exitosamente.{a}*Las probabilidades se reinician a {b}% cuando la ronda se acabe.",
"item_desc151","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Todos los perks activaran forzosamente el [#ffb3ff]OBJETO A MI IZQUIERDA[#ffffff] una vez.",
"item_desc152","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.{a}*Each perk has a {b}% chance to force trigger the item twice instead of once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Todos los perks activaran forzosamente el [#ffb3ff]OBJETO A MI IZQUIERDA[#ffffff] una vez.{a}*Cada perk tiene un {b}% de probabilidad en activarse forzosamente dos veces en vez de una sola vez.",
"item_desc153","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Imita el efecto mejorado de la comida más recientemente comprada{a}*Imitara: {c}{b}{c}. {d}.",
"item_desc154","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Can give up to {c} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Gana +{b} monedas por cada fresa comida en la partida.{a}*Puede dar hasta {c} monedas.",
"item_desc155","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the two right-most items in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Mejora los dos objetos situados a la extrema derecha de tu inventario.",
"item_desc156","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Jelly-Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Otorga +1{b} Perk De Croissant con mermelada{b}.",
"item_desc157","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives two copies of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Otorga 2 copias del perk más recientemente obtenido.{a}(Actualmente {b})",
"item_desc158","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for each remaining life.{a}*Bonus +{c} coins if you have all lives remaining.","[#ffffff]{a}*Otorga +{b} monedas por cada vida restante que tengas.{a}*Bonus +{c} monedas si tienes todas las vidas.",
"item_desc159","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double total coins.{a}*{c}% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de duplicar todas tus monedas.{a}*{c}% de probabilidad de perder todas tus monedas.",
"item_desc160","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Spicy Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Otorga +1 {b} Kebab Picante Perk{b}",
"item_desc161","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Aparece una comida mejorada rara random.",
"item_desc162","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +{b} rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Al regresar al MercaNubby, gana +{a} oportunidades de refrescar el MercaNubby.",
"item_desc163","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all common items in your inventory.{a}*Rare and ultra-rare items are unaffected.","[#ffffff]{a}*Aleatoriza todos los objetos comunes en tu inventario.{a}*Objetos raros y ultra-raros no se verán afectados.",
"item_desc164","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items except the [#ffb3ff]ITEM IN SLOT #1[#ffffff].{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Aleatoriza las activaciones de todos los objetos excepto los [#ffb3ff]OBJETOS EN LA CASILLA #1[#ffffff].{a}*Este cambio no es reversible.",
"item_desc165","[#ffffff]{a}*Permanently upgrades all foods that are currently available for purchase.{a}*From now on, these items will only appear as their upgraded version.","[#ffffff]{a}Mejora permanentemente todas las comidas que están actualmente disponibles para comprar.{a}*Desde ahora en adelante, estos objetos solo aparecerán en su versión mejorada.",
"item_desc166","[#ffffff]{a}*Restores +1 life and gives +2 rerolls in the cafe.","[#ffffff]{a}*Restaura +1 vida y otorga +2 cambios de página en la Nubby cafetería.",
"item_desc167","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.","[#ffffff]{a}*Otorga +{b}% de probabilidad que los objetos raros aparezcan en todas las tiendas. ",
"item_desc168","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Abastece una comida ultra-rara random.",
"item_desc169","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +{b} additional times per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Puedes reacomodar el tablero +{b} adicionales por turno.",
"item_desc170","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +2 cafe nubby rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Otorga +2 reabastecimientos en la Nubby cafetería.",
"item_desc171","[#ffffff]{a}*Creates an upgraded squid in the right-most empty item slot in your inventory.{a}*If you have no empty item slots, this does nothing.","[#ffffff]{a}*Crea un pulpo mejorado en la extrema derecha de tu inventario en espacios libres.{a}*Si no tienes ningún espacio libre, no hará nada.",
"item_desc172","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits an anti-particle that halves the first peg it hits.","[#ffffff]{a}*Emite una antipartícula que divide la primera ficha que estalla.",
"item_desc173","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped was NOT the highest # peg, {b} random pegs become 1-pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Si la primera ficha estallada NO era la ficha con el número más alto, {b} fichas randoms se convierten en fichas -1.",
"item_desc174","[#ffffff]{a}*Destroys [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].","[#ffffff]{a}*Destruye [#ffb3ff]LOS DOS OBJETOS A MI IZQUIERDA Y MI DERECHA[#ffffff].",
"item_desc175","[#ffffff]{a}*If the round goal has been passed more than once, this kills nubby. (This is an extremely painful death for him)","[#ffffff]{a}*Si la cuota de la ronda ha sido superada más de una vez, morirá nubby. (Esto es extremadamente doloroso para el),",
"item_desc176","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Pierde {b}% de tus puntos en total.",
"item_desc177","[#ffffff]{a}*Disables the left-most non-disabled item, besides itself. (Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.)","[#ffffff]{a}*Deshabilita el objeto al extremo a la izquierda que no esté deshabilitado, aparte de este mismo. (Objetos deshabilitados no se pueden activar por el resto de la ronda.",
"item_desc178","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons an eggsac.{a}*Eggsacs bounce and pop pegs like Nubby.{a}*Pegs popped by eggsacs give NO points!","[#ffffff]{a}*Invoca huevecillos.{a}*Los huevecillos rebotan y estallan fichas como Nubby.{a}*Fichas estalladas por los huevecillos NO darán puntos!.",
"item_desc179","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Remplaza el objeto extremo a la derecha de tu inventario con el ultimo objeto que compraste en el MercaNubby o en el mercado negro.{a}(Actualmente: {b})",
"item_desc180","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the upgraded version of the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Reemplaza el objeto el objeto extremo a la derecha de tu inventario con la version mejorada de el ultimo objeto que compraste en el MercaNubby o en el mercado negro.{a}(Actualmente:{b}) ",
"item_desc181","[#ffffff]{a}*A giant finger appears over the first peg popped's column.{a}*All pegs in this column subtract points equal to their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Un dedo gigante aparece sobre la primera columna de fichas estalladas.{a}*Todas las fichas en esta columna restaron puntos iguales a su valor.",
"item_desc182","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Pierde {b}% de tus puntos totales.",

