"perk_desc0","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Empty perk description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",	
	
"perk_desc1","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items.{a}*Disables the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente todos los objetos.{a}*Pero deshabilita el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#e6ffe6].",		
"perk_desc2","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the right-most item in your inventory.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de activar forzosamente el objeto a la extrema derecha de tu inventario.",		
"perk_desc3","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de activar forzosamente el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{c}[#e6ffe6].",		
"perk_desc4","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the round started less than {b} seconds ago, force-triggers the items in slots [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #1, #2, and #3[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si la ronda acaba antes de los {b} segundos, activará forzosamente los objetos en las [#ffb3ff]CASILLAS #1,#2 Y #3[#e6ffe6].",
"perk_desc5","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente los objetos en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#e6ffe6]",	
"perk_desc6","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente todos tus objetos.",	
"perk_desc7","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items in odd-numbered slots.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente todos tus objetos que se encuentren en casillas de número impar.",		
"perk_desc8","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers one random item.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente un objeto random de tu inventario.",		
"perk_desc9","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all {b}[#ffd500]First peg popped [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente todos los objetos {b}[#ffd500]Primera ficha estallada [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b}",	
"perk_desc10","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de activar forzosamente todos los objetos en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{c}[#e6ffe6].",		
"perk_desc11","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #5.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente el objeto en la casilla #5.",		
"perk_desc12","[#e6ffe6]{a}If [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] is empty...{a}*A random item from nubby-mart will appear in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] and force-trigger {c} times.{a}*The new item will disappear at the end of the round.","[#e6ffe6]{a}Si la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#e6ffe6] está vacía…{a}*Un objeto random del MercaNubby aparecerá en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#e6ffe6] y se activará forzosamente {c} veces.{a}*El objeto es temporal y desaparecerá al final de la ronda.",	
"perk_desc13","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], 3 times.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#e6ffe6] 3 veces",		
"perk_desc14","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 time for every {c} coins you have.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 vez por cada {c} monedas que tengas.",		
"perk_desc15","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the items in slots [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #5, #6, and #7[#e6ffe6], {b} times each.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente los objetos en las [#ffb3ff]CASILLAS #5, #6 y7[#e6ffe6] {b} veces cada una.",		
"perk_desc16","[#e6ffe6]{a}If you have 4 or less items... {a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], {c} times","[#e6ffe6]{a}Si tienes 4 o menos objetos… {a}*Activa forzosamente los objetos en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#e6ffe6] {c} veces.",		
"perk_desc17","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the round goal was passed {b} or more times, force-triggers all items and lose {c}% of total points.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si la cuota de la ronda es completada {b} o más veces, activa forzosamente todos los objetos pero pierde {c}% de tus puntos en total.",	
"perk_desc18","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If you have passed the round goal this round, force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], twice.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si completaste la cuota de esta ronda se activaran forzosamente el objeto en la [#ffb3ff]CASILLA #{b}[#e6ffe6] dos veces.",	
"perk_desc19","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the leftmost item x times.{a}*Jumbling pegs increases x by +{b}.{a}*This value resets after each round.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente el objeto al extremos a la izquierda x veces.{a}*Recargar el tablero aumenta x por +{b}.{a}*Este valor se reinicia después de cada ronda.",
"perk_desc20","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the left-most item in your inventory.{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente el objeto a la extrema derecha de tu inventario.{a}*Pero pierdes {b}% de tus puntos en total.",
"perk_desc21","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all {b}[#ffd500]x pegs popped [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente todos los {b}[#ffd500]x fichas estalladas [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} objetos.",
"perk_desc22","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items that summon anything.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente todos los objetos que invocan cualquier cosa.",
"perk_desc23","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the first peg popped was the highest # peg, force-triggers the items in [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #1, and #2[#e6ffe6], {b} times each.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Si la primera ficha estallada es la ficha con el # más alto, activa forzosamente los objetos en las  [#ffb3ff]CASILLAS #1 y #2[#e6ffe6] {b} veces cada uno.",
"perk_desc24","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 2 times for each empty inventory slot.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente los objetos en las [#ffb3ff]CASILLAS #{b}[#e6ffe6] 2 veces por cada espacio vacío en el inventario.",
"perk_desc25","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 time for each perk you have.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente los objetos en las [#ffb3ff]CASILLAS #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 vez por cada perk que tengas.",
"perk_desc26","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all non-upgraded items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente todos los objetos que no estén mejorados.",
"perk_desc27","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force triggers all {b}[#ffd500]Nubby Dies [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items again.","[#e6ffe6]{a}* Activa forzosamente todos los {b}[#ffd500]Nubby muere [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} objetos otra vez.",
"perk_desc28","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #{b}, 1 time for every {c} food items you've consumed.{a}(Foods eaten: {d})","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente el objeto en la casilla #{b} 1 vez por cada {c} alimentos que hayas comido.{a}(Alimentos comidos: {d})",
"perk_desc29","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #{b}, 1 time for every {c} rounds you've passed.{a}(Current force-triggers: {d})","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Activa forzosamente el objeto en la casilla #{b}, 1 vez por cada {c} rondas que hayas pasado.{a}(Activaciones forzadas actuales: {d})",
"perk_desc30","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Has an x% chance to force-trigger the item in slot #{b}.{a}*For each remaining life, gain +{c}% odds.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Tiene un x% de probabilidad de activar forzosamente el objeto en la casilla #{b}.{a}*Por cada vida restante se agrega +{c}% de probabilidad.",
"perk_desc31","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Has an x% chance to force-trigger the item in slot #{b}.{a}*For each remaining life, gain +{c}% odds.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Tiene un x% de probabilidad de activar forzsoamente el objeto en la casilla #{b}.{a}*Por cada vida restante se agrega +{c}% de probabilidad.",
"perk_desc32","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the right-most item in your inventory.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% de probabilidad de activar forzosamente el objeto a la extrema derecha de tu inventario.",

