"finalboss_desc1","Blood drops will rapidly rain down from above and halve the first peg they come in contact with.","Gotas de sangre caerán rápidamente desde el cielo, dividiendo la primera ficha con la que entren en contacto.",
"finalboss_desc2","The side walls of the factory turn into brimstone. When Nubby hits brimstone, lose {a}% of your total points","Las paredes de los lados de la fábrica se han convertido en azufre. Cuando nubby venga en contacto con el azufre perderás {a}% de tus puntos en total.",
"finalboss_desc3","Tony shoots lazers from his eyes! If a peg is hit by a lazer, its number will be reduced to 1.","¡Toño dispara láseres de sus ojos! Si la ficha entra en contacto con el láser su número será reducido a 1.",

"shoperror1","All item slots full.{a}Sell items to make room!{a}{a}[Press {b} items to sell]","Todos los espacios del inventario están llenos.{a}¡Vende objetos para hacer espacio!{a}{a}[Presiona {b} objetos para vender]",					
"shoperror4","Too poor! Get more money to buy this!","¡Demasiado pobre! ¡Consigue más dinero para poder comprarlo!",				
"shoperror6","Drag and drop an item over this button to freeze them!{a}(Frozen items won't go away when you reroll or leave the shop.)","¡Arrastra y suelta el objeto sobre este botón para congelarlo!{a}(Objetos congelados no se desaparecen cuando refresques el MercaNubby.",
"shoperror7","Beat the game at least once to unlock!","¡Termina el juego por primera vez para desbloquear!",
"shoperror8","Must play at least one game to unlock!","¡Debes de jugar una partida para desbloquear!",
"shoperror9","Not enough stars! Play the game and take on challenges to get stars!","¡No tienes suficientes estrellas! ¡Juega partidas y completa los desafíos para conseguir estrellas!",
"shoperror10","Stars are a currency used to unlock things. You can obtain stars by doing well in-game!","Las estrellas son la moneda con la que desbloqueas cosas. ¡Puedes obtener estrellas por jugar bien en las partidas!",
"shoperror11","Your autosaved run is no longer compatible in the current game version.","Tu carga automática de la partida ya no es compatible con la versión actual del juego.",
"shoperror12","You must beat the previous difficulty level to unlock!","¡Tienes que haber completado la dificultad previa para desbloquear este nivel!",

"pausemenuerror1","The round must be over to save and quit.","La ronda se debe de haber acabado para guardar y salir.",
	
"lootdirections","Click to open!","Click para abrir!",

"bmdoorprompt","A mysterious door appears...","Una puerta misteriosa aparece...",

"bmdoor_usekey","Use key?","¿Usar la llave?",

"perkwarning","Note: Perks are permanent. You cannot sell or get rid of them.","Recordatorio:Los perks son permanentes. No puedes venderlos o deshacerte de ellos.",
		
"nohighscore","Score: {b}{a}Highscore: {c}","Puntuación: {b}{a} Puntuación más alta: {c}",
		
"highscore","New Highscore!{a}{b}","¡Nueva puntuación más alta!{a}{b}",
"nohighscore_challenge","Score: {b}{a}Challenge Highscore: {c}","Puntuación: {b}{a}Puntuación del desafío: {c}",
"supervisor_highscore","Highscore: {a}","Puntuación más alta: {a}",		
"highscore_challenge","New Challenge Highscore!{a}{b}","¡Nueva puntuación más alta del desafío!{a}{b}",
		
"btn_gainslot","+1 item slot!","¡+1 casilla de objetos!",

"btn_bm_enter","Enter?","¿Entrar?",
	
"soldout","Sold out!","¡Vendido!",
		
"newgame","New{a}Game!","¡Nueva{a}Partida!",
		
"roundinfo","Round {a}","Ronda {a}",	

"tut1","Hey. You must be the new employee they were telling me about.","Que pedo. Debes de ser el nuevo empleado que me mencionan.",		
"tut2","My name is Tony and I'm gonna be your supervisor.","Me llamo Toño, yo seré tu supervisor.",		
"tut3","My job is to show you how to run the factory.","Mi trabajo es enseñarte a cómo administrar la fábrica.",	
"tut4","I don't really care about your name or anything so let's just get into this.","Realmente no me importa tu nombre o cualquier cosa tuya, así que hay que empezar.",		
"tut5","First things first, welcome aboard to Nubby's Number Factory - the world's leading number manufacturer!","Primero lo primero, bienvenido a la Fábrica de Números de Nubby; ¡la maquiladora líder de números!",		
"tut6","This is the main control center of the factory.","Este es el centro de control principal de la fábrica.",		
"tut7","Your first task is to launch our mascot, Nubby, down the peg board.","Tu primer trabajo es lanzar a nuestra mascota, Nubby, por el tablero de fichas.",		
"tut8","Hold down [{a}] and press [{b}] to launch Nubby.","Sosten [{a}] y presiona [{b}] para lanzar a Nubby.",		
"tut9","Wow, you're really good at this.","Wow, eres muy bueno en esto..",		
"tut10","At this factory, your only job is to make big numbers...","En esta fabrica tu unico trabajo es hacer números grandes.",		
"tut11","By launching Nubby at these pegs, you will earn however many points are shown on the peg.","Al lanzar a Nubby contra estas fichas ganarás los puntos del número de la ficha.",		
"tut12","This number shows how many points you made in a round.","Este número muestra cuántos puntos has hecho esta ronda.",		
"tut13","The number on the bottom is the goal. If you beat the goal, the board will restock.","El número en la esquina es la cuota. Si completas la cuota el tablero se recargará.",		
"tut14","If you get a REALLY high score, the board can restock multiple times in a single round.","Si consigues una puntuación MUY grande, el tablero se recargara múltiples veces en una ronda.",		
"tut15","Oh wait.. I forgot to tell you what a restock even is!","Ah si.. Se me olvido decirte que era una recarga.",		
"tut16","Well listen up, because restocks are an important thing!","¡Pon atención porque las recargas son muy importantes!",		
"tut17","When the board restocks, a bunch of NEW pegs will fall from the sky and fill all your empty spaces.","Cuando el tablero es recargado, múltiples NUEVAS fichas caerán del cielo y llenarán los espacios vacíos.",		
"tut18","Soon after, pairs of pegs with the same number will merge into one greater peg.","Después de esto, las fichas pares del mismo número se unirán y crearan una ficha con un número más grande.",		
"tut19","Let's try it out. Keep launching Nubby until you beat the goal.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]","Hay que probarlo. Mantén lanzando a Nubby hasta completar la cuota.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]",		
"tut20","You can do better than that. Do it again.","Mi abuela tiraba mejor. Intenta otra vez.",		
"tut21","Pegtacular! That was pegalicious! You're a star!","¡Fichatacular! ¡Eso fue fichalicioso! ¡Eres una fichestrella!",		
"tut22","Just kidding, no you're not.","Jaja mentira, no lo eres.",	
"tut23","Ok. We're almost done. To rearrange your new pegs, press the jumble button.","Ok, ya casi acabamos.. Para reacomodar las fichas nuevas, presiona el botón de reacomodo.",		
"tut24","Nice. Launch Nubby one more time [{a}] + [{b}]. I wanna show you something.","Bien. Lanza a Nubby una vez más[{a}] + [{b}]. Te quiero enseñar algo..",		
"tut25","So you might have noticed that Nubby goes through some pegs, but not others.","Espero que hayas notado que Nubby atraviesa algunas fichas, pero no por otras.",		
"tut26","Nubby will break through 1's, but will bounce off any peg greater than 1.","Nubby romperá las fichas de 1, pero rebotara de cualquier otra ficha mayor a 1.",		
"tut27","Alright bud, that's it for the tutorial. You'll figure the rest out for yourself.","Bueno amigo, eso es el tutorial. Tu averiguaras el resto.",		
"tut28","OH! WAIT! WAIT! I FORGOT ONE THING!","¡OH! ¡ESPERA! ¡ESPERA! ¡SE ME OLVIDO DECIRTE ALGO!",		
"tut29","Everytime you launch Nubby, you lose one life. If you run out of lives, the sun will explode.","Cada vez que lanzas a Nubby perderás una vida. Si se te acaban las vidas el sol explotara.",		
"tut30","But luckily, everytime the board restocks, you get one life back.","Pero por suerte cada vez que recargues el tablero, conseguirás una vida de regreso.",		
"tut31","So as long as you keep making big numbers, nobody gets hurt.","Así que mientras hagas números grandes nadie saldrá lastimado.",
"tut32","Ok now I'm done. Thanks for not pressing the {a}skip tutorial{a} button. I know that was difficult for you.","Bueno, ahora si ya termine. Gracias por no picarle al botón de {a}saltarse el tutorial{a}. Yo se que fue difícil para ti.",	
"tut33","I'll start you off with a fresh, new factory now. Good luck.","Empezarás con una fábrica nueva y reluciente. Buena suerte.",

"skiptut","Skip Tutorial","Saltarse el tutorial",
		
