"supervisor_wins","Wins: ","Victorias:",

"challenge_highscore","Highscore","Puntuación más alta:",

"challenge_desc_0","*Items in shops are replaced by various mystery boxes.{a}*Mystery boxes give a random item when purchased.","*Los objetos en la tienda serán reemplazados por cajas misteriosas.{a}*Las cajas misteriosas te otorgaran un objeto random cuando las compres.",
"challenge_desc_1","*You can jumble pegs once PER GAME.{a}*Rerolling items in shops is disabled.","Puedes recargar el tablero UNA VEZ POR JUEGO.{a}*Reabastecer los objetos en el mercado está deshabilitado.",
"challenge_desc_2","*Maximum coins are capped at 10.{a}*Items that cost more than 10 coins have reduced prices.","*La cantidad máxima de monedas estará limitada a 10.{a}*Objetos que cuesten más de 10 tendrán el precio reducido.",
"challenge_desc_3","*Rare items, foods, and perks cannot be found.","Los objetos, comida y perks raros no estarán disponibles.",
"challenge_desc_4","*Items will be deleted 15 rounds after they were obtained.{a}*Upgrading items will reset their expiration date.","Los objetos serán borrados cada 15 rondas desde que fueron adquiridos.{a}* Mejorar los objetos reseteara la fecha de caducidad.",
"challenge_desc_5","*During restocks, you can only gain +1 life at most - even if you restocked more than once.{a}*You cannot gain lives using any alternative method.","Durante las recargas, solo ganaras +1 vida - incluso si ganas mas que una.{a}*No puedes ganar vidas con métodos alternativos.",
"challenge_desc_6","*Failure to meet the quota on any round will result in the left-most item being deleted.","En caso de fallar la cuota en cualquier ronda resultará en la destrucción del objeto a la izquierda extrema.",
"challenge_desc_7","*A C-4 is strapped to Nubby.{a}*Nubby will explode and die after 1.5 seconds, causing a big explosion that pops pegs.","Un C-4 esta amarrado a Nubby.{a}*Nubby explotara y morira despues de 1.5 segundos, causando una gran explosion que estallara las fichas.",
"challenge_desc_8","*Perks cannot be obtained.","Los perks no se pueden obtener.",
"challenge_desc_9","*If you start a round with more than 1 item in your inventory, all items will be disabled for the rest of the round.","Si inicias la ronda con más de 1 objeto en tu inventario, todos los objetos serán desactivados por el resto de la ronda.",
"challenge_desc_10","*Collect all 5 letters (N.U.B.B.Y.) by completing trials.{a}*You must beat round 80 to complete.{a}*Difficulty: {b}","Colecta las 5 letras (N.U.B.B.Y.) para poder completar los juicios.{a}*Debes de llegar a la ronda 80 para poder completarlos.{a}Dificultad: {b}",

"NubbyTrialsAllLocked","Beat at least 5 challenges to unlock!","¡Vence al menos 5 retos para poder desbloquearlo!”",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Antimatter{d})","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto malévolo aparecerá en la casilla {c}.{a}({d}Antimateria{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Shell Shocked!{c} boss.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Enfrenta al jefe {c}¡Aturdimiento de Cascaron!{c}",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Items in slots {c} and {d} are destroyed.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Objetos en las casillas {c} y {d} serán destruidas.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all coins.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Pierde todas las monedas.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All upgraded items are downgraded.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Todos los objetos mejorados serán deteriorados. ",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Dollhead{d})","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto malévolo aparecerá en la casilla {c}.{a}({d}Cabeza de Muñeca{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All items are destroyed, except for evil items.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Todos los objetos serán destruidos, excepto los objetos malignos.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Psychic Spider{d})","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto malévolo aparecerá en la casilla {c}.{a}({d}Araña psíquica{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Bedrock Bash!{c} boss.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Enfrenta al jefe {c}¡Golpe de Duramadre!{c}",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}La cantidad máxima de vida limitada a {c}.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Homunculus{d})","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto malévolo aparecerá en la casilla {c}.{a}({d}Homúnculo{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum coins capped at {c}.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}La máxima cantidad de monedas limitada a {c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All rare and ultra-rare items are destroyed.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Todos los objetos raros y ultra raros serán destruidos",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Holiday Cheer!{c} boss.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Enfrenta al jefe {c}¡Celebración de festividad{c}!",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}{c}Homunculus{c} turns into {c}Alphamunculus{c} (harder variant).","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}{c}Homúnculo{c} se convierte en {c}Alfamúnculo{c}",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Broken Figurine{d})","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto malévolo aparecerá en la casilla {c}.{a}({d}Figurín roto{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Scary Fingore{d})","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto malévolo aparecerá en la casilla {c}.{a}({d}Dedón grotesco{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}I've Been Robbed!{c} boss.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Enfrenta al jefe {c}¡Me robaron!{c}",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All non-upgraded items are destroyed.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Todos los objetos no mejorados serán destruidos.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all but one life.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Pierde todas las vidas a excepción de una.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Cantidad máxima de vidas limitada a {c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Rodent Bones{d})","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto malévolo aparecerá en la casilla {c}{a}({d}Huesos de rata{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Bottled Tears{d})","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Un objeto malévolo paracera en la casilla {c}{a}({d}Lagrimas Embotelladas{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Pessimism!{c} boss.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Enfrenta al jefe {c}¡Pesimismo!{c}",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All perks are destroyed.","EN LA RONDA {b}:{a}Todos los perks serán destruidos.",

