"NubbySkinDesc0","Nubby's classic look!","¡La apariencia de un galán!",
"NubbySkinDesc1","This frog nubby was sent to us in the mail one day. We have no idea why this frog resembles nubby.","Un día recibimos esta nubby rana por paqueteria. No tenemos idea porque esta rana se parece a nubby",
"NubbySkinDesc2","An endangered subspecies of nubbies, scientifically known as Nubbicus Aquaticus.","Una subespecie en peligro de extinción de nubbis, científicamente conocida como Nubbicus Auaticus.",
"NubbySkinDesc3","A failed experiment, resulting from the factory's past attempts to tap into the cheese industry.","Es un experimento fallido de una aventura previa de la fábrica en un intento de entrar al mercado de quesos.",
"NubbySkinDesc4","This nubby stole factory money to follow his dreams at clown college.","Este nubby robo dinero de la fábrica para poder seguir sus sueños y graduarse del colegio de payasos. ;)",
"NubbySkinDesc5","This nubby made his own cosplay and thinks he has cyborg strength. Just let the poor guy have a dream...","Este nubby hizo su propio cosplay y piensa que tiene superfuerza. No le digas que no es cierto, tambien tiene sentimientos...",
"NubbySkinDesc6","This nubby is also a parasite in the metaphorical sense too. If he asks, don't lend him any money.","Este nubby es parásito, también en el sentido metafórico. No le prestes feria al vato.",
"NubbySkinDesc7","In the nubby manufacturing process, things like this happen by accident sometimes.","En el proceso de manufactura de nubby, cosas como estas pasan... a veces.",
"NubbySkinDesc8","This nubby finds joy in Victorian Era live action roleplay. He's not hurting anyone so we let it happen.","Este nubby encuentra felicidad en el roleplay de la Era Victoriana. No hace nada malo asi que no vemos porque no puede hacerlo.",
"NubbySkinDesc9","We keep this nubby around to celebrate employee birthdays. He's also super good at playing kazoo.","Mantenemos a este nubby para celebrar el cumpleaños de los empleados. Sabe bailar bachata, yo le enseñe.",d
"NubbySkinDesc10","Just for kicks, we sometimes make nubbies that can feel emotion. They all end up forming punk bands.","A veces dejamos que los nubbis puedan sentir emociones. Todas terminan haciendo bandas punk y dejan de bañarse.",
"NubbySkinDesc11","The result of our attempts at making self replicating nubbies to save money.","Este es el resultado de nuestros intentos en hacer un nubbis que se puedan replicar solos... para ahorrar dinero.",
"NubbySkinDesc12","Despite his appearance, this nubby is very mature and sophisticated if you get to know him.","A pesar de su apariencia, este nubby es muy maduro y sofisticado cuando lo llegas a conocer, siempre estara para ti.",
"NubbySkinDesc13","Back when the number factory had a petting zoo, this nubby was super popular. Of course, that was before the incident...","Hace mucho la fábrica tenía un zoológico con animales para interactuar, este nubby era super popular. Pero el zoológico cerro por el incidente...",
"NubbySkinDesc14","One of the very first nubbies we cloned. Made way before we discovered their number harvesting capabilities.","Uno de los primeros nubbis que clonamos. Dio paso antes que descubrieramos sus capacidades para recolectar numeros.",
"NubbySkinDesc15","Tony thinks it's really funny to brainwash nubbies into thinking he's god.","Toño piensa que es chistoso lavarles el cerebro a los nubbis y hacerlos pensar que es dios.",
"NubbySkinDesc16","The PR team requested a {b}wholesome{b} nubby mascot to slap on all of our advertising and merch to overshadow our non-wholesome practices.","El equipo de mercadotecnia pidió una mascota nubby {a}adorable{a} para poner en todos nuestros anuncios y mercancía para ocultar nuestras prácticas de mala fama...",
"NubbySkinDesc17","One year we dressed this nubby up as a butterfly for Halloween. Now we have leave the costume on him because he'll try to bite you if you get near him.","Un año vestimos este nubby como mariposa para Halloween. Ahora no se quiere quitar el disfraz por nada en el mundo y te morderá si se lo intentas quitar.",
"NubbySkinDesc18","This is just a souvenir that we sell to tourists at the number factory gift shop.","Solo es un souvenir que vendemos a turistas en la tienda de regalos de la fábrica de números.",
"NubbySkinDesc19","This Nubby is an official star-employee at the number factory... Just like you!","Este Nubby es un super-empleado oficial en la fábrica de números… ¡Como tu!",
"NubbySkinDesc20","This Nubby angered the car wizard and as punishment he was turned into a car. Despite his curse, he remains joyous.","Este Nubby enojo al gran mago de los automóviles y a consecuencia lo convirtieron en uno. A pesar de su maldición, se mantiene alegre.",

"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","This skin is a mystery...","Esta apariencia es un misterio...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","Who knows what this could be...","Quien sabe que podria ser esto...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","Oooh a mystery nubby...","uuuuuuu… un nubby misterioso…..",

"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 1","Desbloquea esto superando los Juicios de Nubby nivel 1.",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 2","Desbloquea esto superando los Juicios de Nubby nivel 2.",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 3","Desbloquea esto superando los Juicios de Nubby nivel 3.",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_18","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 4","Desbloquea esto superando los Juicios de Nubby nivel 4.",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_19","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 5","Desbloquea esto superando los Juicios de Nubby nivel 5.",

