"ItemSkinDesc0","Transform your seals into dapper gentlemen.","Transforma tus focas en galanes de verdad (Los buenos modales no están incluidos).",
"ItemSkinDesc1","Turn your all-seeing pyramids into poorly drawn ancient artifacts.","Convierte tus pirámides omnipotentes en artefactos malamente dibujados.",
"ItemSkinDesc2","Turn your fake plastic trees into fake plastic trees.","Convierte tus árboles de plástico en palmeras de plástico.",
"ItemSkinDesc3","Turn your kidney beans into kidneys, minus the beans.","Cambia tu riñón de habichuela en un riñón de verdad (No preguntes en donde los conseguimos).",
"ItemSkinDesc4","Turn your e-blocks into hardened, stone-faced soldiers.","Transforma tus bloques E en soldados valientes.",
"ItemSkinDesc5","Turn your avocados into your friends!","Convierte tu aguacate en nuestros amigos.",
"ItemSkinDesc6","Turn your jeans into jorts!","Convierte tus pantalones en unos jorts.",
"ItemSkinDesc7","Make your ton of feathers way heavier.","Haz tu tonelada de plumas mucho más pesada.",
"ItemSkinDesc8","Turn your donut into a drawing of a donut.","Convierte tu dona en una rosquilla.",
"ItemSkinDesc9","Fill your mushrooms with compacted C4.","Rellena tu hongo con un sabor explosivo (No apto para consumo).",
"ItemSkinDesc10","Replace your normal noodles with shorter, tubular noodles that are bent.","Reemplaza tus fideos ordinarios con fideitos torcidos, un sabor inigualable.",
"ItemSkinDesc11","Give your mannequin head some style, and a personality too!","Dale a tu cabeza de maniquí un poco de estilo, y también sentimientos ;(",
"ItemSkinDesc12","Turn your mollusk into an extinct mollusk.","Convierte a tu molusco en un molusco de una era que ya no es más.",
"ItemSkinDesc13","Turn your pedro into pedroooooooooooooooo.","Haz tu pedrito a un pedrote.",
"ItemSkinDesc14","Turn your clay man into a clay man, except this time he's actually made out of clay.","Transforma a tu Señor Hombre Arcilla a un hombre de arcilla, ¡de verdad!",
"ItemSkinDesc15","Give poopbutt a timeout in the magic microwave.","Dale a tu culo con caca un tiempo libre en su microondas especial.",
"ItemSkinDesc16","Release your sea cucumbers into the wild, and then make a handcrafted charm to honor their legacy.","Libera tu pepino de mar a la naturaleza y haz una manualidad para honrar su sacrificio a la causa.",
"ItemSkinDesc17","Turn your fish into a fish on a wall!","Convierte tu pescado en un verdadero logro para admirar.",
"ItemSkinDesc18","Turn your squids into the best American carnival food!","Convierte tu calamar en una comida infantil.",

"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","A mystery item skin.. what is it?","Una apariencia misteriosa... ¿Qué es?",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","How mysterious...","Que misterioso...",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","I wonder what it is...","Me pregunto que sera...",

"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating the game at least once with every supervisor.","Desbloquea esta apariencia al completar una partida mínimo una vez con todos los supervisores.",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by reaching round 300 in endless mode on any supervisor.","Desbloquea esta apariencia al llegar a la ronda 300 en el modo infinito con cualquier supervisor.",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating all challenges, including all nubby trials levels.","Desbloquea esta apariencia al completar todos los retos, incluyendo todos los niveles de los juicios de nubby.",

"warehouse_tutorial0","Greetings! The name's Sparkplug.","¡Hola cara de bola! Soy Jaimito.",
"warehouse_tutorial1","You've entered my realm... the warehouse!","Entraste a mi rincón… ¡el almacén!",
"warehouse_tutorial2","I'm the manager here, sort of. It's complicated...","Yo soy el encargado, bueno, más o menos. Puede ser complicado…",
"warehouse_tutorial3","Anyways, who cares, am I right? I'm gonna show you around real quick.","De todos modos a quién le importa? Dejame te doy una pequeña guia por aquí.",
"warehouse_tutorial4","Here we are! The warehouse is where you buy and activate cosmetic nubby skins and item skins.","¡Aquí estamos! En el almacén, puedes apreciar los cosméticos, que se pueden comprar y desbloquear, de Nubby y de los objetos.",
"warehouse_tutorial5","We're currently looking at the nubby skins menu. Press the item skins button to view the item skins menu.","En este momento estamos viendo el menú de las apariencias de Nubby.",
"warehouse_tutorial6","This is the menu for buying and activating item skins, but we're going to focus on nubby skins for now.","Este es el menú para comprar y desbloquear apariencias de objetos, pero por ahora nos enfocaremos en Nubby.",
"warehouse_tutorial7","Go back to the nubby skins menu by pressing the nubby skins button.","Regresa a los atuendos de Nubby presionando el botón de los atuendos de Nubby.",
"warehouse_tutorial8","Use the arrows to page through my collection of cosmetics! Click the arrows a couple times and we'll move on.","Usa las flechitas para descubrir más atuendos de mi colección de cosméticos. Presiona las flechitas y seguiremos…",
"warehouse_tutorial9","Good job! Here's 10 free stars as a reward for being so obedient!","¡Enhorabuena! Aquí están 10 estrellas (¡¡grátis!!) por ser muy obediente.",
"warehouse_tutorial10","Now, find a nubby skin you can afford and buy it.","Ahora, busca un atuendo de Nubby que puedas comprar y adquierela.",
"warehouse_tutorial11","Nice. Now hit the green button below to activate it.","Perfecto, ahora presiona el botón verde para poder activarlo.",
"warehouse_tutorial12","You can only activate one nubby skin at a time, but you can activate multiple item skins at once.","Sólo puedes activar un atuendo de Nubby a la vez, pero puedes tener múltiples atuendos y apariencias.",
"warehouse_tutorial13","Other than that, nubby skins and item skins work the same way.","De la misma manera, las apariencias de nubby y de los objetos funcionan igualmente.",
"warehouse_tutorial14","Ok. That's pretty much all I have left to say I think.","Bueno, creo que eso es todo lo que tenía que decirte…",
"warehouse_tutorial15","You're probably smart and you can figure the rest out for yourself.","Probablemente eres lo suficientemente inteligente de averiguar el resto de cosas por tu cuenta.",
"warehouse_tutorial16","I'm not gonna go away though because I don't trust you.","Eso si.. no me voy a ningún lado, no confio en ti.",
"warehouse_tutorial17","By the way, did I mention that I'm also the official number factory historian?","¿Por cierto, si te mencione que también soy el historiador oficial de la fábrica de números de Nubby?",
"warehouse_tutorial18","If you poke me, I'll tell you a random fact about the number factory. Anyways, have fun!","Si me haces clic te diré un hecho random de la fábrica.",

"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome1","Yeah, sure. Feel free to barge in unannounced.","Si claro, siéntete el jefe de aqui y entra por los...",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome2","Welcome in! You need to learn to knock, though.","¡Bienvenido! Deberías aprender a pedir permiso para entrar...",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome3","Welcome back! I totally wasn't in the middle of something.","¡Bienvenido! No es como que estaba ocupado con algo....",

"SparkplugRandomDialogue0","Nubbies are a species of genetically modified human. They also have DNA from over 300 random mammals, fish, and reptiles.","Los nubbis son una especie genéticamente modificada de los humanos. Ellos también tienen ADN de más de 300 mamíferos, pescados y reptiles random.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue1","There is no singular nubby. Rather, nubbies are genetically cloned right here at the factory. It's the way we've always done it.","No existe un nubby singular, si no que los nubbis son genéticamente clonados aquí en la fábrica. Es lo que siempre hemos hechos.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue2","Not counting the incubation phase of nubby production, the average nubby life span is 6 seconds.","Sin contar las fases de incubación en el proceso de producción de nubby, el promedio de vida de un nubby es de 6 segundos.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue3","The nubby production process is a highly guarded secret, we're the only number factory to own the nubby patent.","El proceso de producción de nubby es altamente secreta, somos la única fábrica de números en ser dueños del patente de nubby.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue4","Other companies in the number industry try to produce numbers ethically without using nubbies. No other company is as successful as us.","Mientras otras compañías intentan producir números de manera ética sin nubbis. Ninguna otra compañía es igual de exitosa como la nuestra.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue5","We produce numbers for the whole world to use in their math problems, computations, and calculations. Without numbers, the laws of physics cease to exist.","Producimos números para todo el mundo, ya sea para problemas matemáticos, computacionales, cálculos y muchas otras cosas más. Sin números, las leyes de la física dejarían de existir.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue6","Years ago, I was hired to help remove asbestos from the warehouse. The other employees mistakenly thought I was a manager here, so I just rolled with it and here we are.","Hace muchos años me habían contratado para remover los asbestos del almacén. Los otros empleados pensaban que yo era el encargado de aqui asi que me quede chambeando aquí.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue7","The factory pays me based on how many hours I spend in the warehouse, so I moved in and I haven't left in years.","La fabrica me paga dependiendo de las horas que paso en el almacén. Lógicamente, me mude a vivir aquí hace muchos años.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue8","Sometimes Tony and I listen to music and drive the forklift around to kill time. He's a nice guy once you get to know him.","A veces Toño y yo escuchamos música mientras conducimos el montacargas para pasar el tiempo. Es un wey buena onda cuando ya lo conoces bien.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue9","Nobody's met the boss of the number factory. Nobody knows if there even is one. You could fire Tony and he couldn't do anything about it.","Nadie conoce al jefe de la fábrica de números. Nadie sabe si en primer lugar existe uno. Podrías despedir a Toño y no podría hacer nada al respecto.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue10","A while ago, Tony covered a bunch of nubbies in paint and threw them at my wall. He's a great artist!","Hace un rato Toño lleno de pintura a varios nubbis y los tiró a mi pared. ¡Es un estupendo artista!",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue11","We don't even store anything in the warehouse. My only job is to explain what the warehouse is to new employees and drive the forklift.","Ni tenemos una tienda en el almacén. Mi unico trabajo es explicarle a los nuevos empleados que es el almacén y conducir el montacargas.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue12","Here at the factory, we don't produce our number pegs - we buy them from the peg factory. they won't tell us what they're made of, so it can't be good.","Aqui en la fábrica de números no producimos las fichas de números, las compramo de la fábrica de fichas. No nos quieren decir cómo las producen así que no puede ser bueno...",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue13","We protect nubbies from themselves and from our rival companies. If they leave the factory grounds, they self destruct.","Protegemos nuestros nubbis de ellos mismos y también de las compañías rivales. Si pisan fuera de los límites de la fábrica se autodestruyen.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue14","Nubbies usually can't feel emotion, but they all have their own unique personality.","Los nubbis usualmente no sienten emociones, pero cada uno tiene una personalidad única.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue15","If nubbies are kept alive for too long, they slowly turn into cubes. We don't know why.","Si los nubbis son mantenidos vivos lo suficiente se convertirán en cubos. Aún no sabes porque.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue16","Tony and I go way back. I don't know if he's shy or something but I've known him for over a decade and I've never seen him take the glasses off.","Toño y yo somos amigos desde hace mucho. No se si sea timido o algo por el estilo porque lo conozco por más de una década y nunca lo e visto quitarse los lentes.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue17","You should really wear a gas mask in here. There's still tons of asbestos everywhere.","Deberías usar una máscara de gas. Aún hay mucho asbestos en el ambiente.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue18","Nubbies are the only known creature that can harvest numbers. Their bodies have the exact shape and texture required to harvest numbers.","Los nubbis son la única criatura conocida que puede recolectar números. Sus cuerpos tienen la figura exacta y la textura requerida para poder recolectar números.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue19","I've overheard talks about the number factory getting into letter production as well. Who knows... letters are in high demand these days.","E escuchado charlas acerca de la fábrica de números empezar la producción de letras. Quien sabe... las letras están en alta demanda estos días.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue20","You didn't hear this from me, but I've heard that nubbies taste like grape candy.","No le digas a nadie pero... e escuchado que los nubbis saben a dulce de uva.",





























