"NubbySkinName0","Nubby","Nubby",
"NubbySkinName1","Frog Nubby","Nubby Żaba",
"NubbySkinName2","Blubby","Blubby",
"NubbySkinName3","Cheesy Nubby","Serowy Nubby",
"NubbySkinName4","Clown Nubby","Nubby Klaun",
"NubbySkinName5","Cyborg Nubby","Nubby Cyborg",
"NubbySkinName6","Parasitic Nubby","Nubby Pasożyt",
"NubbySkinName7","Bisected Nubby","Przepołowiony Nubby",
"NubbySkinName8","Ol Chap Nubby","Nubby Jegomość",
"NubbySkinName9","Party Nubby","Nubby Imprezowicz",
"NubbySkinName10","Punk Nubby","Nubby Punk",
"NubbySkinName11","Teratoma Nubby","Nubby Potworniak",
"NubbySkinName12","Baby Face Nubby","Pyzaty Nubby",
"NubbySkinName13","Goat Nubby","Nubby Koza",
"NubbySkinName14","Prototype Nubby","Nubby Prototyp",
"NubbySkinName15","Tony Fan Nubby","Nubby Fan Tony'ego",
"NubbySkinName16","Number Farmer Nubby","Farmer Liczbowy Nubby",
"NubbySkinName17","Flutty Nubby","Nubby Flutty",
"NubbySkinName18","Glass Marble Nubby","Szklany Nubby",
"NubbySkinName19","Star-Employee Nubby","Nubby Prymus",
"NubbySkinName20","Car Nubby","Nubby Auto",

"NubbySkinDesc0","Nubby's classic look!","Ikoniczny wygląd nubby'ego!",
"NubbySkinDesc1","This frog nubby was sent to us in the mail one day. We have no idea why this frog resembles nubby.","Wysłano nam kiedyś tą żabę pocztą. Nie mamy pojęcia, czemu wygląda jak nubby.",
"NubbySkinDesc2","An endangered subspecies of nubbies, scientifically known as Nubbicus Aquaticus.","Zagrożony podgatunek nubbych, znany pod naukową nazwą Nubbicus Aquaticus.",
"NubbySkinDesc3","A failed experiment, resulting from the factory's past attempts to tap into the cheese industry.","Nieudany eksperyment po naszej próbie wejścia na rynek serowy.",
"NubbySkinDesc4","This nubby stole factory money to follow his dreams at clown college.","Ten nubby ukradł pieniądze z fabryki, żeby się spełniać jako klaun.",
"NubbySkinDesc5","This nubby made his own cosplay and thinks he has cyborg strength. Just let the poor guy have a dream...","Ten nubby przebrał się za cyborga i teraz myśli, że ma super-siłę. Marzyć zawsze miło...",
"NubbySkinDesc6","This nubby is also a parasite in the metaphorical sense too. If he asks, don't lend him any money.","Ten nubby jest pasożytem także w przenośni. Nie pożyczaj mu pieniędzy.",
"NubbySkinDesc7","In the nubby manufacturing process, things like this happen by accident sometimes.","Czasem tak się dzieje podczas produkcji nubbych.",
"NubbySkinDesc8","This nubby finds joy in Victorian Era live action roleplay. He's not hurting anyone so we let it happen.","Ten nubby lubuje się w odgrywaniu ery wiktoriańskiej. Nikomu to nie przeszkadza, więc na to pozwalamy.",
"NubbySkinDesc9","We keep this nubby around to celebrate employee birthdays. He's also super good at playing kazoo.","Trzymamy tego nubby'ego do świętowania urodzin pracowników. Gra też nieźle na kazoo.",
"NubbySkinDesc10","Just for kicks, we sometimes make nubbies that can feel emotion. They all end up forming punk bands.","Czasem dajemy niektórym nubbym emocje, tak dla zabawy. Wszystkie zakładają zespoły punkowe.",
"NubbySkinDesc11","The result of our attempts at making self replicating nubbies to save money.","Wynik naszych prób stworzenia samo-klonujących się nubbych w ramach cięcia kosztów.",
"NubbySkinDesc12","Despite his appearance, this nubby is very mature and sophisticated if you get to know him.","Mimo jego wyglądu, ten nubby jest dojrzały i wyrafinowany, jak go lepiej poznasz.",
"NubbySkinDesc13","Back when the number factory had a petting zoo, this nubby was super popular. Of course, that was before the incident...","Za czasów, gdy fabryka była tylko małym zoo, ten nubby był bardzo popularny. To było przed wypadkiem, rzecz jasna...",
"NubbySkinDesc14","One of the very first nubbies we cloned. Made way before we discovered their number harvesting capabilities.","Jeden z pierwszych sklonowanych przez nas nubbych. Powstał dużo przed tym, zanim odkryliśmy ich możliwości produkcji liczb.",
"NubbySkinDesc15","Tony thinks it's really funny to brainwash nubbies into thinking he's god.","Tony'ego bardzo bawi zmuszanie nubbych do wyznawania go jako boga.",
"NubbySkinDesc16","The PR team requested a {b}wholesome{b} nubby mascot to slap on all of our advertising and merch to overshadow our non-wholesome practices.","Pijar nalegał na wyprodukowanie {b}uroczej{b} maskotki, którą użyjemy, by zamaskować nasze niemoralne praktyki.",
"NubbySkinDesc17","One year we dressed this nubby up as a butterfly for Halloween. Now we have leave the costume on him because he'll try to bite you if you get near him.","Raz przebraliśmy tego nubby'ego za motyla na Halloween. Zostawiliśmy mu ten kostium, bo gryzie jak się do niego zbliżasz.",
"NubbySkinDesc18","This is just a souvenir that we sell to tourists at the number factory gift shop.","To tylko pamiątka, którą sprzedajemy turystom w naszym sklepiku.",
"NubbySkinDesc19","This Nubby is an official star-employee at the number factory... Just like you!","Ten Nubby jest przykładowym pracownikiem w fabryce... Tak jak ty!",
"NubbySkinDesc20","This Nubby angered the car wizard and as punishment he was turned into a car. Despite his curse, he remains joyous.","Ten Nubby wkurzył czarodzieja samochodowego i za karę został zmieniony w auto. Pozostaje radosny, mimo jego klątwy.",

"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","This skin is a mystery...","Ta skórka to tajemnica...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","Who knows what this could be...","Kto wie, co to jest...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","Oooh a mystery nubby...","Uuu, tajemniczy nubby...",

"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 1","Odblokuj ten przedmiot przechodząc Poziom 1 Wyzwań Nubby'ego",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 2","Odblokuj ten przedmiot przechodząc Poziom 2 Wyzwań Nubby'ego",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 3","Odblokuj ten przedmiot przechodząc Poziom 3 Wyzwań Nubby'ego",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_18","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 4","Odblokuj ten przedmiot przechodząc Poziom 4 Wyzwań Nubby'ego",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_19","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 5","Odblokuj ten przedmiot przechodząc Poziom 5 Wyzwań Nubby'ego",

"NubbySkinCredit","Made by {a}","Stworzone przez {a}",
