"classicmode_description","Classic Mode:{a}------{a}*Achievements enabled.{a}*Random game seed.","Klasický mód:{a}------{a}*Úspechy povolené.{a}*Náhodný seed hry.",

"abortround_btn","End!","Ukončiť!",

"txt_supervisor","Choose your supervisor!","Vyber si dozorcu!",

"unlock_supervisor_button","Unlock:","Odomknúť:",

"supervisorname_tony","Tony","Tony",
"supervisorname_octopus","Octo-ny","Chobo-tony",
"supervisorname_tonyjr","Tony Jr.","Tony Jr.",
"supervisorname_goblin","Goblony","Goblony",
"supervisorname_mutant","Mutant Tony","Mutant Tony",
"supervisorname_glass","Glass Tony","Sklenený Tony",
"supervisorname_hunter","Hunter Tony","Lovec Tony",
"supervisorname_balogna","Balogna Tony","Salámový Tony",
"supervisorname_criminal","Criminal Tony","Zlodej Tony",
"supervisorname_ceo","C.E.O. Tony","C.E.O. Tony",
"supervisorname_immortal","Immortal Tony","Nesmrtelný Tony",
"supervisorname_dwarf","Dwarf Tony","Trpaslík Tony",

"supervisordesc_tony","*The standard Nubby experience!","Štandardný Nubby zážitok!",
"supervisordesc_octopus","*Squids are {b}x more likely to appear in Nubby-Mart.{a}*Squids cost {c}% less.","*Chobotnice majú {b} násobne vyššiu šancu objaviť sa v Nubby-Marte.{a}*Chobotnice stoja o {b}% menej.",
"supervisordesc_tonyjr","*Start the game with {b} coins.{a}*You will enter Nubby-Mart when the game starts.{a}*Rare and ultra rare items are twice as likely to appear in shops.","*Začneš hru s {b} mincami. {a}*Vstúpiš do Nubby-Martu po začatí hry. {a}* Vzácne a ultra-vzácne položky majú dvojnásobnú šancu sa objaviť v obchodoch.",
"supervisordesc_goblin","*You receive +3 coins per restock instead of 1.{a}*Maximum coins limit is raised to {b}.{a}*You lose two lives when you launch Nubby.","*Získaš +3 mince za doplnenie namiesto +1.{a}*Maximálne množstvo mincí je zvýšené na {b}.{a}*Keď vystrelíš Nubbyho, stratíš dva životy.",
"supervisordesc_mutant","*Items have two trigger types.{a}*For example, an item could trigger when the round goal is passed OR when Nubby dies.","*Položky majú dva typy spúšťačov.{a}*Napríklad položka môže byť spustená keď Nubby zomrie ALEBO keď prekonáš cielové skóre.",
"supervisordesc_glass","*Maximum lives capped at {b}.{a}*When an item triggers, it triggers twice.{a}*Perks and food items are unaffected.","*Maximálny počet životov je zmenený na {b}.{a}*Keď sa položka spustí, účinkuje dvakrát.{a}*Neovplyvňuje perky a jedlo.",
"supervisordesc_hunter","*Adds a moving target to the bottom of the pegboard.{a}*If Nubby hits the target, gain +{b} coins AND double total score.{a}*You cannot gain coins from restocks.","*Pridá pohyblivý terč na spodok dosky.{a}*Ak Nubby trafí terč, získaš +{b} mincí a ZÁROVEŇ sa ti zdvojnásobí celkové skóre.{a}*Nemôžes získať peniaze z doplnenia.",
"supervisordesc_balogna","*Item and perk triggers are randomized at the start of the run. Don't question it.","*Položky a perky majú na začiatku hry náhodne nastavené spušťače. Nepýtaj sa.",
"supervisordesc_criminal","*Black market items can appear in Nubby-Mart and mystery capsules. Black market items cost money in Nubby-Mart.","*Položky z čierneho trhu sa môžu objaviť v Nubby-Marte a v kapsuliach s prekvapením. Položky z čierneho trhu môžeš kúpiť v Nubby-Marte za peniaze.",
"supervisordesc_ceo","*Start game with {b} coins.{a}*You cannot gain more coins.","*Začneš hru s {b} mincami.{a}*Nemôžeš získať viac mincí.",
"supervisordesc_immortal","*Replaces endless mode with prestige mode.{a}*When you win, you can prestige.{a}*This restarts the game and increases the difficulty for each prestige level.","*Nahradí nekonečný mód módom Prestíže.{a}*Keď vyhráš, postúpiš na vyššiu prestíž.{a}*Toto reštartuje hru a zvýši obtiažnosť na základe levelu prestíže.",
"supervisordesc_dwarf","*Every round, spawns helpful {b}Gem Pegs{b} and hurtful {b}Rock Pegs{b}.{a}*These pegs become very chaotic as the game progresses.{a}*No special events or bosses, except for the final boss.","*V každej úrovni sa zjavia nápomocné {b}Drahokamové Kolíky{b} a škodlivé {b}Kamenné Kolíky{b}.{a}*Tieto kolíky sa stávajú velmi nepredvídatelnými v priebehu hry.{a}*Žiadne špeciálne údalosti ani bossovia, okrem finálneho bossa.",

"txt_nametag","Hello! My name is:","Ahoj! Volám sa:",

"svbtn_go","GO!","HRAJ!",

"customseed_warning","Warning: Using a custom seed disables achievements,stars, and unlocks.","Upozornenie: Pri použití vlastného seedu nemôžeš získať úspechy, hviezdy a odomykať nové veci.",
                      
"gameversion","NNF Full Version {a}","NNF Plná Verzia {a}",
	
