"null","[#ffd500]Error: null","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc0","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Praskne náhodný kolík. Keď tento kolík praskne, dá body dvakrát.",		
"item_desc1","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Napodobní nevylepšený efekt naposledny zjedeného jedla.{a}*Napodobní: {c}{b}{c}.",		
"item_desc2","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quill that falls from the sky and pops {c} peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Z neba spadne pichliač, ktorý praskne {c} kolík.",		
"item_desc3","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodný kolík vybuchne a praskne (max) {b} kolíkov v blízkosti.",		
"item_desc4","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}*Za každú položku v inventári získaš hodnotu rovnú náhodnemu číslu kolíka.",		
"item_desc5","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}meat-orb{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak je Nubby stále nažive, vyvolá {b}mäsovú gulu{b}, ktorá volne poletuje a praská kolíky, cez ktoré prejde.{a}*Keď Nubby zomrie, mäsové gule zmiznú.",		
"item_desc6","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} z {c} šanca zdvojnásobiť všetky kolíky.",		
"item_desc7","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Maxes out at {b} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +1 mincu za každú zjedenú jahodu počas tejto hry.{a}*Maximálne {b} mincí.",		
"item_desc8","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot shots{b} that pop any pegs they pass through.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodný kolík vystrelí {c} {b}soplové strely{b}, ktoré prasknú každý kolík, cez ktorý prejdú.",		
"item_desc9","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dá vznik slamke, ktorá praskne jeden kolík.{a}*Kolíky prasknuté slamkou získajú +{b}% naviac z ich hodnoty.{a}*Hodnota sa zvýši o +{c}% za každé premiešanie v tejto hre.",		
"item_desc10","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to double the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Všetky kolíky ti dajú hodnotu bodov rovnú dvojnásobku najnižšieho kolíka.",		
"item_desc11","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca, že nastane obrovský výbuch, ktorý raz praskne všetky kolíky.{a}*{c}% šanca ak si na poslednom živote.",		
"item_desc12","[#ffffff]{a}*Every empty peg space will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Za každé prázdne miesto na doske získaš počet bodov rovný počtu prasknutých kolíkov v tomto kole.",	
"item_desc13","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the right-most item in your inventory.{a}*Deletes the left-most item in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vylepší najviac vpravo umiestnenú položku v tvojom inventári.{a}*Vymaže najviac vlavo umiestnenú položku v tvojom inventári.",
"item_desc14","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Praskne {b} náhodný kolík.",		
"item_desc15","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vynásobí všetky body {b} krát.",		
"item_desc16","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby získa počet bodov rovný počtu Nubbyho odrazení v tomto kole.",		
"item_desc17","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sharp-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vyvolá špendlík, ktorý praskne náhodny kolík {b} krát.",		
"item_desc18","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +1 {b}Kroisant Perk{b}.",	
"item_desc19","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives a copy of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš kópiu naposledy získaného perku.{a}(Momentálne {b}) ",		
"item_desc20","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an egg missile that falls from the sky and causes an explosion that pops a row of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak je Nubby stále nažive, vystrelí vajcovú bombu, ktorá praskne radu kolíkov.",		
"item_desc21","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the lowest # peg twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Praskne kolík s najmenším číslom dva razy.",	
"item_desc22","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{d}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca nič nespraviť.{a}*{c}% šanca zdvojnásobiť náhodný kolík.{a}*{d}% šanca rozpoliť náhodný kolík.",		
"item_desc23","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +{b} bodov za každú aktiváciu tejto položky počas kola.{a}*{c} z {d} šanca premeniť sa.",		
"item_desc24","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca na vytvorenie elektrického výboja, ktorý praskne skupinku kolíkov.",		
"item_desc25","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}meat-orbs{b} that will float around and pop pegs.{a}*Meat-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak je Nubby stále nažive, vyvolá {b}mäsovú gulu{b}, ktorá volne poletuje a praská kolíky, cez ktoré prejde.{a}*Keď Nubby zomrie, mäsové gule zmiznú.",
		
"item_desc26","[#ffffff]{a}*Test{b}","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
		
"item_desc27","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs will copy the # of the first peg popped.{a}*If this item is in slot #{c}, {d} pegs will be affected instead of {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} náhodných kolíkov skopíruje číslo prvého prasknutého kolíka.{a}*Ak je táto položka v slote #{c}, premení {d} kolíky namiesto {b}.",
"item_desc28","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Za každú aktiváciu tejto položky počas tohto kola získaš +{b} bodov.",		
"item_desc29","[#ffffff]{a}*Every peg will give points equal to {b}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Každý kolík ti dá body v hodnote {b}% jeho čísla.",		
"item_desc30","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles a random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Zdvojnásobí náhodný kolík.",		
"item_desc31","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into the non-upgraded version of the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Premení sa na nevylepšenú verziu položky [#ffb3ff]NALAVO ODO MŇA[#ffffff] do konca kola.",		
"item_desc32","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a pulse that doubles pegs within close range.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodný kolík vylúči pulz, ktorý zdvojnásobí kolíky v blízkosti.",	
"item_desc33","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emits a burst of nuclear waste.{a}*Nuclear waste pops any pegs it touches.{a}*If Nubby isn't alive, a random peg will emit the burst.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby vypustí zo seba dávku nukleárneho odpadu.{a}*Ak Nubby nie je nažive, odpad bude vypustený náhodným kolíkom.",
"item_desc34","[#ffffff]{a}*Marks a random peg.{a}*When a peg is marked, all pegs that have the same number will be doubled.{a}*If no pegs have the same number as the marked peg, a random peg will be doubled.","[#ffffff]{a}*Označí náhodný kolík.{a}*Každý kolík s rovnakým číslom ako označený kolík bude zdvojnásobený.{a}*Ak žiadny kolík nemá rovnaké číslo, zdvojnásobí náhodný kolík.",		
"item_desc35","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs get smacked.{a}*When a peg is smacked, it counts as a {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg halved [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] trigger without actually halving it.","[#ffffff]{a}*Plesne {b} náhodné kolíky. Keď je kolík plesnutý, ráta sa ako {a}[#ffd500]{c}Kolík rozpolený [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] spúšťač, napriek tomu, že kolík nerozpolí.",		
"item_desc36","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +1 coin for each remaining life.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +1 mincu za každý život.",	
"item_desc37","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles {c} random pegs whose # is less than {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Zdvojnásobí {c} náhodné kolíky, ktorých číslo je menšie ako {b}",	
"item_desc38","[#ffffff]{a}*50% chance to double total coins.{a}*50% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*50% šanca zdvojnásobenia tvojho počtu mincí.{a}*50% šanca nastavenia počtu mincí na 0.",
"item_desc39","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random common item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Zmutuje sa na náhodnú bežnú položku, ktorá momentálne nie je v tvojom inventári, do konca kola.",
"item_desc40","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca zdvojnásobiť jeden náhodný kolík.",
"item_desc41","[#ffffff]{a}*Halves the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times","[#ffffff]{a}*Rozpolí najvyšší kolík.{a}*Zdvojnásobí číslo najnižšieho kolíka {b} krát.",
"item_desc42","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay balls.{a}*If a clay ball bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay balls die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vytvorí {b} hlinené gúle.{a}*Ak sa hlinená gula odrazí od kolíka ALEBO od steny, ráta sa ako [#ffd500]{d}Nubby trafí stenu [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]spúšťač.{a}*Hlinené gule sa zničia po {c} odrazeniach.",
"item_desc43","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the non-upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Napodobní nevylepšený efekt položky v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], ale ponechá si svoj spúšťač.",
"item_desc44","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +{b} bodov.{a}*Ak si na úrovni {d} alebo vyššie, získaš +{c} bodov.",
"item_desc45","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +1 {b}Kebabový Perk{b}",
"item_desc46","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Doloží nahodné vzácne jedlo.",
"item_desc47","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak ako prvý praskneš kolík s najvyšším číslom, vynásobí sa celkové skóre {b} krát.",
"item_desc48","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Praskne {b} náhodné kolíky.",
"item_desc49","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg becomes a copy of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Kolík s najnižším číslom sa premení na kópiu kolíka s najvyšším číslom.",
"item_desc50","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +1 reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Po vrátení do Nubby-Martu získaš +1 obnovenie.",
"item_desc51","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Zníži cielové skóre o -{b}%. {a}Rozpolí všetky kolíky.",
"item_desc52","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers an electron beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an electron beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Electron beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vypustí elektrónový lúč, ktorý prechádza cez kolíky.{a}*Keď lúč trafí kolík, získaš {b}% jeho hodnoty.{a}*Elektrónový lúč NEPRASKÁ kolíky.",
"item_desc53","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits a god ray.{a}*The god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Táto položka vyžaruje Božský lúč.{a}*Božský lúč rapídne praskne náhodný kolík tolko krát, kolko bola položka v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]aktivovaná v tomto kole.",
"item_desc54","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Spustí naposledy získaný perk.{a}(Momentálne {b})",
"item_desc55","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Kolík s najnižším číslom dá počet bodov v hodnote {b} násobku jeho čísla.{a}*Ak je najnižšie číslo kolíka {d} alebo menej, namiesto toho získaš +{c} bodov.",
"item_desc56","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vyvolá plážovú loptu, ktorá vylučuje {b} konfetti keď praskne.{a}*Kolíky prasknuté pomocou konfetti dajú {c}% hodnoty ich čísla.",

"item_desc57","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc58","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to a copy of himself.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby porodí kópiu seba.",
"item_desc59","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca zdvojnásobiť kolík s najvyšším číslom.",
"item_desc60","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffffff]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Vylúči jeden prúd ichoru za každých {b} Nubbyho smrtí počas tejto hry.{a}*Ak ichor trafí kolík, aktivujú sa položky a perky so spúšťačom [#ffd500]{c}Dosiahni cielové skóre [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff].{a}(Momentálne vylučuje {d})",
"item_desc61","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all items in your inventory... Good luck!","[#ffffff]{a}Zmení všetky položky v tvojom inventári na náhodné... Vela šťastia!",
"item_desc62","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]*Obsahuje náhodnú bežnú položku z Nubby-Martu.",
"item_desc63","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common item from the black market.","[#ffffff]*Obsahuje náhodnú bežnú položku z čierneho trhu.",
"item_desc64","[#ffffff]*Contains a random common food item.","[#ffffff]*Obsahuje náhodné bežné jedlo.",
"item_desc65","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*Za každé doplnenie dosky v tejto hre získaš +{b} bodov.{a}(Momentálne +{c} bodov)",
"item_desc66","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodný kolík vylúči {b}Kozmický Lúč{b}.{a}*Keď kozmický lúč praskne kolík, ráta sa ako {c} prasknutia namiesto 1.",
"item_desc67","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Keď sa táto položka nasilu spustí, presmeruje spustenie na položku [#ffb3ff]NALAVO ODO MŇA[#ffffff].{a}*{c}% šanca pridať +1 spustenie navyše.",
"item_desc68","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops a random peg. When this peg pops, it will give points four times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Praskne náhodný kolík. Keď tento kolík praskne, dostaneš zaň body 4 krát.",

"item_desc69","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc70","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons {b} quills that fall from the sky and pop {c} peg each.{a}*10% chance to summon one additional quill (3 total).","[#ffffff]{a}*Z neba spadnú {b} pichliače, každý praskne {c} kolíky.{a}*10% šanca zhodiť jeden pichliač naviac (3 max).",
"item_desc71","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will explode and pop {b} (maximum) nearby pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodný kolík vybuchne a praskne (max) {b} kolíkov v blízkosti.",
"item_desc72","[#ffffff]{a}*Every item in your inventory gives points equal to double the value of a random peg's number.","[#ffffff]{a}*Každá položka v tvojom invetári ti dá body v hodnote dvojnásobku náhodného kolíka.",
"item_desc73","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons a {b}disease-orb{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak je Nubby nažive, vyvolá {b}gulu choroby{b}, ktorá agresívne poletuje a praská kolíky, cez ktoré prejde.{a}*Keď Nubby zomrie, gule choroby zmiznú.",
"item_desc74","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} in {c} chance to double ALL pegs.{a}*{d} in {e} chance to double all pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} z {c} šanca zdvojnásobiť VŠETKY kolíky.{a}*{d} z {e} šanca dvojnásobiť všetky kolíky dva razy.",

"item_desc75","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc76","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg will emit {c} {b}snot rockets{b} that pop any pegs they pass through twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodný kolík vylúči {c} {b}soplové strely{b}, ktoré dva razy prasknú každý kolík, cez ktorý prejdú.",
"item_desc77","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons one straw that pops one peg.{a}*Pegs popped by straws give an additional +{b}% of their #.{a}*+Gains +{c}% for every time you've jumbled pegs in this game.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dá vznik slamke, ktorá praskne jeden kolík.{a}*Kolíky prasknuté slamkou získajú +{b}% naviac z ich hodnoty.{a}*Hodnota sa zvýši o +{c}% za každé premiešanie v tejto hre.",
"item_desc78","[#ffffff]{a}*All pegs will give points equal to quadruple the number on the lowest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Všetky kolíky ti dajú hodnotu bodov rovnú štvornásobku najnižšieho kolíka.",
"item_desc79","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance cause a giant explosion that pops all pegs once.{a}*{c}% chance if you are on your last shot.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca, že nastane obrovský výbuch, ktorý praskne všetky kolíky naraz.{a}*{c}% šanca ak si na poslednom živote.",
"item_desc80","[#ffffff]{a}*ALL peg spaces will give points equal to the total amount of pegs that have been popped this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Za VŠETKY miesta na doske získaš počet bodov rovný počtu prasknutých kolíkov v tomto kole.",
"item_desc81","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items in your inventory.{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Premení spušťače položiek v tvojom inventári na náhodné.{a}*Táto zmena je nevratná.",
"item_desc82","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Praskne {b} náhodné kolíky.",
"item_desc83","[#ffffff]{a}*Multiply total points by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vynásobí celkový počet bodov {b} krát.",
"item_desc84","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives points equal to double the number of times that Nubby has bounced this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby získa počet bodov rovný dvojnásobku počtu Nubbyho odrazení v tomto kole.",
"item_desc85","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a sword-shot that will pop a random peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vyvolá meč, ktorý praskne náhodný kolík {b} krát.",

"item_desc86","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc87","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc88","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summon an ostrich-egg missile that falls from the sky an causes an explosion that pops 1 row and 1 column of pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak je Nubby stále nažive, zhodí pštrosie vajce, ktoré vybuchne a praskne 1 radu 1 stlpec kolíkov.",
"item_desc89","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops the two lowest # pegs, twice each.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dva razy praskne 2 kolíky s najnižšími číslami.",
"item_desc90","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to do nothing.{a}*{c}% chance to double one random peg.{a}*{d}% chance to halve one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca nič nespraviť.{a}*{c}% šanca zdvojnásobiť náhodný kolík.{a}*{d}% šanca rozpoliť náhodný kolík.",
"item_desc91","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.{a}*{c} in {d} chance to metamorphosize.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +{b} bodov za každú aktiváciu tejto položky počas kola.{a}*{c} z {d} šanca premeniť sa.",
"item_desc92","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to create a high-voltage chain bolt that pops a cluster of pegs twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca na vytvorenie elektrického výboja s vysokým napätím, ktorý praskne skupinku kolíkov dva razy.",
"item_desc93","[#ffffff]{a}*If Nubby is still alive, summons {c} {b}disease-orbs{b} that will aggresively float around and pop pegs.{a}*Disease-orbs die when Nubby dies.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak je Nubby nažive, vyvolá {b}gulu choroby{b}, ktorá agresívne poletuje a praská kolíky, cez ktoré prejde.{a}*Keď Nubby zomrie, gule choroby zmiznú.",

"item_desc94","[[#ffffff]{a}*Test{b}","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc95","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs will copy the # of the first peg popped.{a}*If this item is in slot #{c}, {d} pegs will be affected instead of {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} náhodné kolíky skopírujú číslo prvého prasknutého kolíka.{a}*Ak je táto položka v slote #{c}, premení sa {d} kolíkov namiesto {b}.",
"item_desc96","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +{b} points for every time this item has triggered during this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +{b} bodov za každú aktiváciu tejto položky počas kola.",
"item_desc97","[#ffffff]{a}*Every peg will give points equal to {b}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Každý kolík ti dá body v hodnote {b}% jeho čísla.",
"item_desc98","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles a random peg twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Zdvojnásobí náhodný kolík dva razy.",
"item_desc99","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into the upgraded version of the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME [#ffffff] for the rest of the round","[#ffffff]{a}*Premení sa na vylepšenú verziu položky [#ffb3ff]NALAVO ODO MŇA[#ffffff] do konca kola.",
"item_desc100","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a super pulse that doubles pegs within close range twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodný kolík vylúči super pulz, ktorý zdvojnásobí kolíky v blízkosti dva razy. ",
"item_desc101","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby emits a burst of bouncy {b}unstable waste{b}.{a}*Unstable waste bounces and pops any pegs it touches.{a}*If Nubby isn't alive, a random peg will emit the burst.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby vylúči zo seba dávku skákajúceho {b}nestabilného odpadu{b}.{a}*Nestabilný odpad praskne kolíky, ktorých sa dotkne.{a}*Ak Nubby nie je nažive, odpad bude vylúčený z náhodného kolíka.",
"item_desc102","[#ffffff]{a}*Marks a random peg.{a}*When a peg is marked, all pegs that have the same number will be doubled twice.{a}*If no pegs have the same number as the marked peg, a random peg will be doubled twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Označí náhodný kolík.{a}*Každý kolík s rovnakým číslom ako označený kolík bude zdvojnásobený dva razy.{a}*Ak žiadny kolík nemá rovnaké číslo, zdvojnásobí náhodný kolík dva razy.",
"item_desc103","[#ffffff]{a}*{b} random pegs get smacked twice.{a}*When a peg is smacked, it counts as a {a}[#ffd500]{c}Peg halved [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] trigger without actually halving it.","[#ffffff]{a}*Plesne {b} náhodné kolíky dva razy.{a}*Keď je kolík plesnutý, ráta sa ako {a}[#ffd500]{c}Kolík rozpolený [spr_ITArrow,0]{c} [#ffffff] spúšťač, napriek tomu, že kolík nerozpolí.",

"item_desc104","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc105","[#ffffff]{a}*Doubles {c} random pegs whose # is less than {b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Zdvojnásobí {c} náhodné kolíky, ktorých číslo je menšie ako {b}.",

"item_desc106","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc107","[#ffffff]{a}*Mutates into a random rare or ultra-rare item that is not currently in your inventory for the rest of the round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Do konca kola sa premení na náhodnú vzácnu alebo extra-vzácnu položku, ktorá momentálne nie je v tvojom inventári.",
"item_desc108","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double one random peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca zdvojnásobiť jeden náhodný kolík.",
"item_desc109","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% chance to halve the highest # peg.{a}*Doubles the lowest # peg {b} times.","[#ffffff]{a}*{c}% šanca znížiť najvyšší kolík na polovicu. {a}Zdvojnásobí kolík s najnižším čislom {b} krát.",
"item_desc110","[#ffffff]{a}*Summon {b} clay prisms.{a}*If a clay prism bounces off a wall OR peg, it will count as a [#ffd500]{d}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]trigger.{a}*Clay prisms die after {c} bounces.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vyvolá {b} hlinené hranoly.{a}*Ak sa hranol odrazí od steny ALEBO kolíka, ráta sa ako [#ffd500]{d}Nubby sa odrazí o steny [spr_ITArrow,0]{d} [#ffffff]spúšťač.{a}*Hlinené hranoly sa rozbijú po {c} odrazoch.",
"item_desc111","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], but keeps its own trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Napodobní vylepšený efekt položky v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#ffffff], ale ponechá si svoj spúšťač.",
"item_desc112","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} points.{a}*If you are on round {d} or higher, gain +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +{b} bodov.{a}*Ak si na úrovni {d} alebo vyššie, získaš +{c} bodov.",

"item_desc113","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc114","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc115","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped is the highest # peg, multiply total score by {b}x.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak ako prvý praskneš kolík s najvyšším číslom, vynásobí sa celkové skóre {b} krát.",
"item_desc116","[#ffffff]{a}*Pops {b} random pegs, twice.","[#ffffff]{a}*Praskne {b} náhodné kolíky, dva razy.",
"item_desc117","[#ffffff]{a}*The two lowest # pegs become copies of the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dva kolíky s najmenším číslom skopírujú kolík s najvyšším číslom.",

"item_desc118","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc119","[#ffffff]{a}*Reduces round goal by -{b}%.{a}*Halves all pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Zníži cielové skóre o -{b}%.{a}*Rozpolí všetky kolíky.",
"item_desc120","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers a hyper-beam that passes through pegs.{a}*When an hyper-beam hits a peg, the peg will give {b}% of its #.{a}*Hyper-beams do NOT pop pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vypustí hyper-elektrónový lúč, ktorý prechádza cez kolíky.{a}*Keď lúč trafí kolík, získaš {b}% jeho hodnoty.{a}*Elektrónový lúč NEPRASKÁ kolíky.",
"item_desc121","[#ffffff]{a}*This item emits two god rays.{a}*Each god ray rapidly pops a random peg once for each time the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]has triggered in this round.","[#ffffff]{a}*Táto položka vylučuje dve Božie osvietenia.{a}*Každé Božie osvietenie rapídne praskne náhodný kolík tolko krát, kolko bola položka v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1 [#ffffff]aktivovaná v tomto kole.",
"item_desc122","[#ffffff]{a}*Triggers the most recently obtained perk twice.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Spustí naposledy získaný perk, dva razy.{a}(Momentálne {b})",
"item_desc123","[#ffffff]{a}*The lowest # peg gives points equal to {b}x its #.{a}*If the lowest # peg is {d} or less, it will give +{c} points instead.","[#ffffff]{a}*Kolík s najnižším číslom dá počet bodov v hodnote {b} násobku jeho čísla.{a}*Ak je najnižšie číslo kolíka {d} alebo menej, namiesto toho získaš +{c} bodov.",
"item_desc124","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons a MEGA beach ball that emits {b} streams of confetti when it pops.{a}*Pegs popped by confetti give {c}% of their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vytvorí MEGA plážovú loptu, ktorá vylučuje {b} konfetti keď praskne. {a}*Kolíky prasknuté pomocou konfetti dajú {c}% hodnoty ich čísla.",

"item_desc125","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty Description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc126","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby gives birth to two copies of himself.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nubby porodí dve kópie seba.",
"item_desc127","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double the highest # peg.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca zdvojnásobiť kolík s najvyšším číslom.",
"item_desc128","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits one ichor stream for every {b} times Nubby has died in this game.{a}*When a peg is hit by ichor, [#ffd500]{c}Pass round goal [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] items and perks will trigger.{a}(Currently emits {d})","[#ffffff]{a}*Vylúči jeden prúd ichoru za každú Nubbyho smrť v tejto hre ({b}).{a}*Ak ichor trafí kolík, položky a perky so spúšťačom [#ffd500]{c}Dosiahni cielové skóre [spr_ITArrow,0]{c}[#ffffff] sa aktivujú.{a}(Momentálne vylučuje {d})",
"item_desc129","[#ffffff]{a}*Temporarily upgrades cafe foods that are currently available for purchase.","[#ffffff]{a}*Dočasne vylepší momentálne dostupné jedlá v kaviarni.",

"item_desc130","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc131","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",
"item_desc132","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"item_desc133","[#ffffff]{a}*For every time the board has restocked this game, gain +{b} points.{a}(Currently +{c} points)","[#ffffff]{a}*Za každé doplnenie dosky v tejto hre získaš +{b} bodov.{a}(Momentálne +{c} bodov)",
"item_desc134","[#ffffff]{a}*A random peg emits a {b}Giant Cosmo-Blast{b}.{a}*When a peg is popped by a giant cosmo-blast, it counts as {c} peg pops instead of 1.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodný kolík vylúči {b}Gigantický Kozmický Lúč{b}.{a}*Keď gigantický kozmický lúč praskne kolík, ráta sa ako {c} prasknutia namiesto 1.",
"item_desc135","[#ffffff]{a}*When this is force-triggered, it transfers the force-trigger to the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Has a {c}% chance to add on +1 additional force-trigger.","[#ffffff]{a}*Keď je táto položka nasilu spustená, presmeruje spustenie na položku [#ffb3ff]NALAVO ODO MŇA[#ffffff].{a}*{c}% šanca pridať +1 spustenie navyše.",
"item_desc136","[#ffffff]{a}*If you have less than maximum lives, restores +1 life.{a}*Otherwise, gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak máš menej ako maximum životov, dostaneš +1 život.{a}*Ak nie, dostaneš +1 obnovenie v kaviarni.",
"item_desc137","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.{a}*This does not increase odds of ultra-rare items.","[#ffffff]{a}*Zvyši o +{b}% šancu objavenia vzácnych položiek v obchode a kaviarni.{a}*Nemá efekt na ultra vzácne položky.",
"item_desc138","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Doloží náhodné ultra vzácne jedlo.",
"item_desc139","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]{a}*Obsahuje náhodnú vzácnu položku z Nubby-Martu.",
"item_desc140","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]{a}*Obsahuje náhodnú vzácnu položku z čierneho trhu.",
"item_desc141","[#ffffff]*Contains a random rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Obsahuje náhodné vzácne jedlo.",
"item_desc142","[#ffffff]*Contains a copy of a random item in your inventory.{a}*If you have no items, this will give a random common item.","[#ffffff]*Obsahuje kópiu náhodnej položky v tvojom inventári.{a}*Ak nemáš žiadne položky, získaš náhodnú bežnú položku.",
"item_desc143","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from Nubby Mart.","[#ffffff]{a}*Obsahuje náhodnú ultra-vzácnu položku z Nubby-Martu.",
"item_desc144","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare item from the black market.","[#ffffff]{a}*Obsahuje náhodnú ultra-vzácnu položku z čierneho trhu.",
"item_desc145","[#ffffff]*Contains a random ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Obsahuje náhodné ultra-vzácne jedlo.",
"item_desc146","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +1 additional time per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Každé kolo môžeš premiešať kolíky +1 krát.",
"item_desc147","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 cafe nubby reroll.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +1 obnovenie v kaviarni.",
"item_desc148","[#ffffff]{a}*Deletes the left-most item.{a}*The right-most item transforms into a squid.{a}*If the right-most item is upgraded, it transforms into an upgraded squid.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vymaže najviac vlavo umiestnenú položku.{a}*Premení najviac vpravo umiestnenú položku na chobotnicu.{a}*Ak je najviac vpravo uložená položka vylepšená, premení sa na vylepšenú chobotnicu.",
"item_desc149","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca nasilu spustiť [#ffb3ff]POLOŽKU NAPRAVO A NALAVO ODO MŇA[#ffffff].{a}*Šanca sa znižuje o {c}% po každej úspešnej aktivácii.{a}*Pravdepodobnosť sa nastáví naspäť na {b}% na začiatku kola.",
"item_desc150","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].{a}*Odds decrease by {c}% for each time this successfully triggers.{a}*Odds reset to {b}% when the round is over.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca nasilu spustiť [#ffb3ff]POLOŽKU NAPRAVO A NALAVO ODO MŇA[#ffffff].{a}*Šanca sa znižuje o {c}% po každej úspešnej aktivácii.{a}*Pravdepodobnosť sa nastáví naspäť na {b}% na začiatku kola.",
"item_desc151","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Všetky perky raz nasilu spustia [#ffb3ff]POLOŽKU NALAVO ODO MŇA[#ffffff].",
"item_desc152","[#ffffff]{a}*All perks force-trigger the [#ffb3ff]ITEM TO THE LEFT OF ME[#ffffff] once.{a}*Each perk has a {b}% chance to force trigger the item twice instead of once.","[#ffffff]{a}*Všetky perky raz nasilu spustia [#ffb3ff]POLOŽKU NALAVO ODO MŇA[#ffffff].{a}*Každý perk má {b}% šancu spustiť položku dva razy.",
"item_desc153","[#ffffff]{a}*Mimics the upgraded effect of the most recently eaten food item{a}*Will mimic: {c}{b}{c}. {d}","[#ffffff]{a}*Napodobní vylepšený účinok naposledy zjedeného jedla.{a}*Napodobní: {c}{b}{c}. {d}",
"item_desc154","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for every strawberry eaten during this game.{a}*Can give up to {c} coins.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +{b} mincí za každú zjedenú jahodu počas tejto hry.{a}*Môžeš získať najviac {c} mincí.",
"item_desc155","[#ffffff]{a}*Upgrades the two right-most items in your inventory.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vylepší dve najviac vpravo uložené položky v tvojom inventári.",
"item_desc156","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Jelly-Croissant Perk{b}.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +1 {b}Želatínový Kroisant Perk{b}.",
"item_desc157","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives two copies of the most recently obtained perk.{a}(Currently {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš dve kópie naposledy získaného perku.{a}(Momentálne {b})",
"item_desc158","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b} coins for each remaining life.{a}*Bonus +{c} coins if you have all lives remaining.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +{b} mince za každý život, ktorý máš.{a}*Bonus +{c} mincí, ak máš maximálny počet životov.",
"item_desc159","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% chance to double total coins.{a}*{c}% chance to set total coins to 0.","[#ffffff]{a}*{b}% šanca zdvojnásobenia tvojho počtu mincí.{a}*{c}% šanca nastavenia počtu mincí na 0.",
"item_desc160","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +1 {b}Spicy Kebab Perk{b}","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +1 {b}Štiplavý Kebab Perk{b}",
"item_desc161","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Doloží náhodné vylepšené vzácne jedlo.",
"item_desc162","[#ffffff]{a}*Upon returning to Nubby-Mart, gain +{b} rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Po návrate do Nubby-Martu získaš {b} obnovenia.",
"item_desc163","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes all common items in your inventory.{a}*Rare and ultra-rare items are unaffected.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodne premení všetky bežné položky v tvojom inventári.{a}*Neovplyvňuje vzácne a ultra vzácne položky.",
"item_desc164","[#ffffff]{a}*Randomizes triggers for all items except the [#ffb3ff]ITEM IN SLOT #1[#ffffff].{a}*This change cannot be undone.","[#ffffff]{a}*Náhodne zmení spúšťače všetkých položiek okrem [#ffb3ff]POLOŽKY V SLOT #1[#ffffff].{a}*Táto zmena sa nedá vrátiť.",
"item_desc165","[#ffffff]{a}*Permanently upgrades all foods that are currently available for purchase.{a}*From now on, these items will only appear as their upgraded version.","[#ffffff]{a}*Permanentne vylepší momentálne dostupné jedlo.{a}*Od tohto momentu budú tieto jedlá vždy dostupné vo vylepšenej forme.",
"item_desc166","[#ffffff]{a}*Restores +1 life and gives +2 rerolls in the cafe.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš +1 život a +2 doplnenia v kaviarni.",
"item_desc167","[#ffffff]{a}*Gain +{b}% odds for rare items across all shops.","[#ffffff]{a}*Zvyši o +{b}% šancu objavenia vzácnych položiek v obchode a kaviarni.",
"item_desc168","[#ffffff]{a}*Stocks a random upgraded ultra-rare food item.","[#ffffff]{a}*Doplní náhodné ultra vzácne vylepšené jedlo.",
"item_desc169","[#ffffff]{a}*You can jumble pegs +{b} additional times per turn.","[#ffffff]{a}*Môžes premiešať kolíky +{b} krát počas kola.",
"item_desc170","[#ffffff]{a}*Gives +2 cafe nubby rerolls.","[#ffffff]{a}*Získaš 2+ obnovenia v kaviarni.",
"item_desc171","[#ffffff]{a}*Creates an upgraded squid in the right-most empty item slot in your inventory.{a}*If you have no empty item slots, this does nothing.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vloží vylepšenú chobotnicu do najviac vpravo uloženého volného slotu.{a}*Ak nemáš volný slot, nič nenastane.",
"item_desc172","[#ffffff]{a}*Emits an anti-particle that halves the first peg it hits.","[#ffffff]{a}*Vylúči anti-časticu, ktorá rozpolí prvý kolík, do ktorého narazí.",
"item_desc173","[#ffffff]{a}*If the first peg popped was NOT the highest # peg, {b} random pegs become 1-pegs.","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak prvý prasknutý kolík NEMAL najvyššie číslo, {b} náhodné kolíky sa zmenia na jednotkové.",
"item_desc174","[#ffffff]{a}*Destroys [#ffb3ff]BOTH ITEMS TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT OF ME[#ffffff].","[#ffffff]{a}*Zničí [#ffb3ff]POLOŽKU NAPRAVO A NALAVO ODO MŇA[#ffffff].",
"item_desc175","[#ffffff]{a}*If the round goal has been passed more than once, this kills nubby. (This is an extremely painful death for him)","[#ffffff]{a}*Ak si dosiahol viac ako dvojnásobok cielového skóre, Nubby zomrie. (Je to velmi bolestivá smrť pre neho.)",
"item_desc176","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Stratíš {b}% celkových bodov.",
"item_desc177","[#ffffff]{a}*Disables the left-most non-disabled item, besides itself. (Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.)","[#ffffff]{a}*Deaktivuje najviac vlavo umiestnenú ne-deaktivovanú položku, okrem seba. (Deaktivoané položky nemôžu byť spustené do konca kola.)",
"item_desc178","[#ffffff]{a}*Summons an eggsac.{a}*Eggsacs bounce and pop pegs like Nubby.{a}*Pegs popped by eggsacs give NO points!","[#ffffff]{a}*Vyvolá vajíčka chrobákov.{a}*Vajíčka sa odrážajú a praskajú kolíky ako Nubby.{a}*Za kolíky prasknuté vajíčkami NEDOSTANEŠ body.",
"item_desc179","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Nahradí najviac vpravo umiestnenú položku v tvojom inventári naposledy kúpenou položkou z Nubby-Martu alebo čierneho trhu.{a}(Momentálne: {b})",
"item_desc180","[#ffffff]{a}*Replaces the right-most item in your inventory with the upgraded version of the last item you purchased from nubby mart or the black market.{a}(Currently: {b})","[#ffffff]{a}*Nahradí najviac vpravo uloženú položku v tvojom inventári vylepšenou verziou naposledy kúpenej položky z Nubby-Martu alebo čierneho trhu.{a}(Momentálne: {b}).",
"item_desc181","[#ffffff]{a}*A giant finger appears over the first peg popped's column.{a}*All pegs in this column subtract points equal to their #.","[#ffffff]{a}*Nad stlpcom prvého prasknutého kolíka sa zjaví obrovský prst.{a}*Všetky kolíky v tomto stlpci odčítajú body v hodnote ich čísla.",
"item_desc182","[#ffffff]{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#ffffff]{a}*Stratíš {b}% celkových bodov.",

"item_desc183","[#ffffff]{a}*Empty description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

