"peg_desc0","Missing description.","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",	
	
"peg_desc1","[#ffffcc]*This peg will give +{a} coin when popped for the first time.","[#ffffcc]*Keď prvýkrát praskneš tento kolík, získaš +{a} mincu.",		
"peg_desc2","[#ffe6e6]*This peg can only be popped once it's stone layer has been popped {a} times.","[#ffe6e6]*Tento kolík môže byť prasknutý, až keď je kamenná vrstva prasknutá {a} krát.",		
"peg_desc3","[#ffffcc]*When popped for the first time, this peg will trigger a mega explosion that pops all pegs once.","[#ffffcc]*Tento kolík po prvom prasknutí spôsobí výbuch, ktorý jedenkrát praskne všetky kolíky.",		
"peg_desc4","[#ffffcc]*This peg will pop the highest # peg when popped. (will not pop itself)","[#ffffcc]*Keď tento kolík praskne, praskne namiesto neho kolík s najvysším číslom.",
"peg_desc5","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will subtract points instead of adding points when popped.","[#ffe6e6]*Keď tento kolík praskne, odčíta body",		
"peg_desc6","[#ffffcc]*This peg will force-trigger the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{a} [#ffffcc]when popped.","[#ffffcc]*Tento kolík nasilu aktivuje položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{a} [#ffffcc]keď praskne.",		
"peg_desc7","[#ffffcc]*This peg will multiply your total points by {a}x when popped for the first time.","[#ffffcc]*Tento kolík vynásobí tvoje skóre {a} krát po prvom prasknutí.",		
"peg_desc8","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will break after it has been popped for the first time.","[#ffe6e6]*Tento kolík sa zničí po prvom prasknutí.",		
"peg_desc9","[#ffffcc]*This peg will explode and pop {a} pegs in a cross-pattern when popped for the first time.","[#ffffcc]*Tento kolík vybuchne a praskne {a} kolíkov do kríža po prvom prasknutí.",		
"peg_desc10","[#ffffcc]*When popped for the first time, all other pegs will be doubled ({a}% chance) OR halved ({b}% chance)","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí buď zdvojnásobí všetky kolíky ({a}% šanca) ALEBO ich rozpolí ({b}% šanca).",		
"peg_desc11","[#ffffcc]*This peg will multiply your total points by {a}x when fully popped.","[#ffffcc]*Keď je tento kolík zničený, vynásobí tvoje skóre {a} krát.",		
"peg_desc12","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will kill nubby and end the round when fully popped.","[#ffe6e6]*Keď zničíš tento kolík, Nubby zomrie a kolo skončí.",	
"peg_desc13","[#ffe6e6]*This peg will disable a random item when fully popped.{a}*Disabled items cannot trigger for the rest of the round.","[#ffe6e6]*Keď zničíš tento kolík, deaktivuje sa ti náhodná položka.{a}*Deaktivované položky nemôžu byť spustené do konca kola.",		
"peg_desc14","[#ffffcc]*This peg gives points twice when popped.","[#ffffcc]*Keď praskneš tento kolík, získaš dvojnásobok bodov.",

"peg_desc15","[#ffffcc]*No description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",

"peg_desc16","[#ffffcc]*All psychic pegs will give points equal to their # when any psychic peg is popped.","[#ffffcc]*Všetky jasnovidecké kolíky ti dajú hodnotu rovnú ich číslu, keď praskne ktorýkolvek jasnovidecký kolík.",
"peg_desc17","[#ffffcc]*When popped, this peg will emit 2 {b}snot-shots{b} that pop any pegs they pass through.","[#ffffcc]Po prasknutí vystrelí 2 {b}soplové strely{b}, ktoré prasknú každý kolík, cez ktorý prejdú.",
"peg_desc18","[#ffe6e6]*When popped, all pegs will copy this peg's #.","[#ffe6e6]*Keď praskne, všetky kolíky skopírujú číslo tohto kolíka",
"peg_desc19","[#ffe6e6]*When fully popped, the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #2[#ffe6e6] will be sold.","[#ffe6e6]*Po zničení kolíka bude položka v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #2[#ffe6e6] predaná.",
"peg_desc20","[#ffffcc]*When popped, it counts as a [#ffd500]{a}Nubby hits wall [spr_ITArrow,0]{a} [#ffffcc] trigger.","[#ffffcc]*Keď praskne, ráta sa ako [#ffd500]{a}Nubby trafí stenu [spr_ITArrow,0]{a} [#ffffcc] spúštač.",
"peg_desc21","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, gain +x coins, equal to the round number.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí získaš počet mincí, rovný číslu úrovne.",
"peg_desc22","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, increase total coins by +{a}%.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí sa zvýši celkový počet mincí o +{a}%.",
"peg_desc23","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, if nubby is still alive, duplicates nubby.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí rozdvojí Nubbyho (ak je nažive).",
"peg_desc24","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles {a} random pegs.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí zdvojnásobí {a} náhodné kolíky.",
"peg_desc25","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers all perks once.{a}*If no perks exist, force triggers all items once.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí nasilu spustí všetky perky.{a}*Ak nemáš perky, nasilu spustí všetky položky.",
"peg_desc26","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, gives a non-temporary random common item from nubby mart in the first empty inventory slot.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí ti vloží do volného slotu inventára náhodnú bežnú položku z Nubby-Martu.",
"peg_desc27","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, two copies of every summon in the game are summoned.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí vyvolá 2 kópie všetkých vyvolaných objektov v tejto hre.",
"peg_desc28","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles all pegs twice, lose {a}% of total points.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí zdvojnásbí všetky kolíky dva razy a stratíš {a}% celkových bodov.",
"peg_desc29","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, a random item in your inventory that summons anything force triggers {a} times.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí nasilu spustí náhodnú položku v tvojom inventári, ktorá niečo vyvoláva, {a} krát.",
"peg_desc30","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers item in slot {a}, {b} times.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí nasilu spustí položku v slote {a}, {b} krát.",
"peg_desc31","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers item in slot {b}, {c} times.{a}*Can force trigger corrupted items.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí nasilu spustí položku v slote {b}, {c} krát.{a}*Môže spustiť narušené položky.",
"peg_desc32","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, force triggers all items {a} times.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí nasilu spustí všetky položky {a} krát.",
"peg_desc33","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles the highest # peg {a} times.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí zdvojnásobí kolík s najvyšším číslom {a} krát.",
"peg_desc34","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, doubles all pegs {a} times.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí zdvojnásobí všetky kolíky {a} krát.",
"peg_desc35","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, all items temporarily turn into random upgraded ultra-rare items.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí sa dočasne premenia všetky položky na ultra vzácne vylepšené položky.",
"peg_desc36","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, summons {a} crazy straw summons.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí vyvolá {a} šialené slamky.",
"peg_desc37","[#ffffcc]*When popped once, multiplies total points by {a}x.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí vynásobí celkové skóre {a} krát.",
"peg_desc38","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, sets total points to {a}.","[#ffe6e6]*Po prvom prasknutí nastaví počet bodov na {a}.",
"peg_desc39","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, temporarily disables items in slots {a},{b}, and {c}.","[#ffe6e6]*Po prvom prasknutí dočasne deaktivuje položky v slotoch {a},{b}, a {c}.",
"peg_desc40","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, lose {a} coins.","[#ffe6e6]*Po prvom prasknutí stratíš {a} mincí.",
"peg_desc41","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, temporarily randomizes all items in your inventory.","[#ffe6e6]*Po prvom prasknutí dočasne náhodne premení všetky položky v tvojom inventári.",
"peg_desc42","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, {a} random pegs become 1-pegs.","[#ffe6e6]*Po prvom prasknutí premení {a} kolíky na kolíky s hodnotou 1.",
"peg_desc43","[#ffe6e6]*When popped once, halves all pegs.","[#ffffcc]*Po prvom prasknutí rozpolí všetky kolíky.",

"btn_skiploot_part1","Skip!","Preskočiť!",
"btn_skiploot_part2","Gives +{a}[spr_ITCoin,0]","Dostaneš +{a}[spr_ITCoin,0]",
	
