"perk_name32","The Spicy Kebab Perk","Štiplavý Kebab Perk",

"perk_desc0","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Empty perk description","***NO TRANSLATION NEEDED, LEAVE THIS TEXT HERE***",	
	
"perk_desc1","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items.{a}*Disables the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí všetky položky.{a}*Znefunkční položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].",		
"perk_desc2","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the right-most item in your inventory.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% šanca nasilu spustiť položku uloženú najviac napravo v tvojom inventári.",		
"perk_desc3","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% šanca nasilu spustiť položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].",		
"perk_desc4","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the round started less than {b} seconds ago, force-triggers the items in slots [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #1, #2, and #3[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Ak kolo začalo pred menej ako {b} sekundami, nasilu spustí položky v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1, #2, a #3[#e6ffe6].",
"perk_desc5","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6].",	
"perk_desc6","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí všetky položky.",	
"perk_desc7","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items in odd-numbered slots.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí všetky položky v nepárnych slotoch.",		
"perk_desc8","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers one random item.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí jednu náhodnú položku",		
"perk_desc9","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all {b}[#ffd500]First peg popped [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí všetky {b}[#ffd500]Prvý kolík prasknutý [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} položky.",	
"perk_desc10","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% šanca nasilu spustiť položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{c}[#e6ffe6].",		
"perk_desc11","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #5.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí položku v slote #5.",		
"perk_desc12","[#e6ffe6]{a}If [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] is empty...{a}*A random item from nubby-mart will appear in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] and force-trigger {c} times.{a}*The new item will disappear at the end of the round.","[#e6ffe6]{a}Ak je [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] prázdny...{a}*Náhodná položka z Nubby-Martu sa objaví v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] a spustí sa nasilu {c} krát.{a}*Nová položka zmizne na konci kola.",		
"perk_desc13","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], 3 times.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], 3 krát,",		
"perk_desc14","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 time for every {c} coins you have.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Položka v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] sa raz nasilu spustí za každých {c} mincí čo máš.",		
"perk_desc15","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the items in slots [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #5, #6, and #7[#e6ffe6], {b} times each.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí položky v slotoch [#ffb3ff]SLOT #5, #6 a #7[#e6ffe6], každú {b} krát.",		
"perk_desc16","[#e6ffe6]{a}If you have 4 or less items... {a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], {c} times","[#e6ffe6]{a}Ak máš 4 položky alebo menej... {a}*Nasilu spustí položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] {c} krát."
"perk_desc17","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the round goal was passed {b} or more times, force-triggers all items and lose {c}% of total points.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Ak si prekonal cielové skóre {b} alebo viac krát, nasilu spustí všetky položky a stratíš {c}% celkového skóre.",	
"perk_desc18","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If you have passed the round goal this round, force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], twice.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Ak si v tomto kole dosiahol cielové skóre, nasilu spustí položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6], dva krát.",	
"perk_desc19","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the leftmost item x times.{a}*Jumbling pegs increases x by +{b}.{a}*This value resets after each round.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí najviac vlavo položenú položku x krát.{a}*Zamiešanie kolíkov zvyšuje x o +{b}.{a}*Táto hodnota sa resetuje po každom kole.",
"perk_desc20","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the left-most item in your inventory.{a}*Lose {b}% of your total points.","[#e6ffe6]{a}Nasilu spustí najviac vlavo umiestnenú položku v tvojom inventári.{a}*Stratíš {b}% z celkových bodov."
"perk_desc21","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all {b}[#ffd500]x pegs popped [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí všetky {b}[#ffd500]x kolíkov prasknutých [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} položky.",
"perk_desc22","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all items that summon anything.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí všetky položky, ktoré niečo vyvolávajú.",
"perk_desc23","[#e6ffe6]{a}*If the first peg popped was the highest # peg, force-triggers the items in [#ffb3ff]SLOTS #1, and #2[#e6ffe6], {b} times each.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Ak ako prvý praskneš kolík s najvyšším číslom, tak sa nasilu spustia položky v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #1, a #2[#e6ffe6], {b} krát každú.",
"perk_desc24","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 2 times for each empty inventory slot.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Dva razy nasilu spustí položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] za každé prázdne miesto v inventári.",
"perk_desc25","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 time for each perk you have.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí položku v [#ffb3ff]SLOT #{b}[#e6ffe6] 1 krát za každý perk, ktorý vlastníš.",
"perk_desc26","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers all non-upgraded items.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí všetky nevylepšené položky.",
"perk_desc27","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force triggers all {b}[#ffd500]Nubby Dies [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} items again.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí všetky {b}[#ffd500]Nubby Zomrie [spr_ITArrow,0][#e6ffe6]{b} položky znova.",
"perk_desc28","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #{b}, 1 time for every {c} food items you've consumed.{a}(Foods eaten: {d})","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí položku v slote #{b}, 1 krát za každých {c} zjedených jediel.{a}(Zjedené jedlá: {d})",
"perk_desc29","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Force-triggers the item in slot #{b}, 1 time for every {c} rounds you've passed.{a}(Current force-triggers: {d})","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Nasilu spustí položku v slote #{b}, 1 krát za každých {c} prejdených kôl.",
"perk_desc30","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Has an x% chance to force-trigger the item in slot #{b}.{a}*For each remaining life, gain +{c}% odds.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*x% šanca nasilu spustiť položku v slot #{b}.{a}*Za každý život sa šanca zvýši o +{c}%.",
"perk_desc31","[#e6ffe6]{a}*Has an x% chance to force-trigger the item in slot #{b}.{a}*For each remaining life, gain +{c}% odds.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*x% šanca nasilu spustiť položku v slot #{b}.{a}*Za každý život sa šanca zvýši o +{c}%.",
"perk_desc32","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% chance to force-trigger the right-most item in your inventory.","[#e6ffe6]{a}*{b}% šanca nasilu spustiť najviac vpravo umiestnenú položku v tvojom inventári.",

