"finalboss_desc1","Blood drops will rapidly rain down from above and halve the first peg they come in contact with.","Kvapky krvi začnú pršať z neba a rozpolia prvý kolík, ktorého sa dotknú.",
"finalboss_desc2","The side walls of the factory turn into brimstone. When Nubby hits brimstone, lose {a}% of your total points","Steny továrne sa premenia na síru. Keď sa Nubby dotkne síry, stratíš {a}% z celkových bodov.",
"finalboss_desc3","Tony shoots lazers from his eyes! If a peg is hit by a lazer, its number will be reduced to 1.","Tony striela laser z očí! Ak laser trafí kolík, jeho číslo bude zredukované na 1.",

"shoperror1","All item slots full.{a}Sell items to make room!{a}{a}[Press {b} items to sell]","Všetky sloty sú zaplnené.{a}Predaj položku, pre vytvorenie miesta!{a}{a}[Stlač {b} na predanie položky]",					
"shoperror4","Too poor! Get more money to buy this!","Si chudobný! Zarob viac peňazí, aby si si to mohol dovoliť!",				
"shoperror6","Drag and drop an item over this button to freeze them!{a}(Frozen items won't go away when you reroll or leave the shop.)","Stlač a pretiahni položku na toto tlačidlo, aby si ju zmrazil!{a}(Zmrazené položky nezmiznú, keď obnovíš tovar alebo odídeš z obchodu.)",
"shoperror7","Beat the game at least once to unlock!","Vyhraj hru aspoň raz na odomknutie!",
"shoperror8","Must play at least one game to unlock!","Musíš si zahrať aspoň jednu hru na odomknutie!",
"shoperror9","Not enough stars! Play the game and take on challenges to get stars!","Nemáš dostatok hviezd! Hraj hru a poraz výzvy pre získanie hviezd!",
"shoperror10","Stars are a currency used to unlock things. You can obtain stars by doing well in-game!","Hviezdy sú použité na odomykanie vecí. Hviezdy môžeš získať, keď sa ti darí v hre!",
"shoperror11","Your autosaved run is no longer compatible in the current game version.","Tvoja automaticky uložená hra nie je kompatibilná s momentálnou verziou hry.",
"shoperror12","You must beat the previous difficulty level to unlock!","Musíš poraziť predchádzajúcu obtiažnosť na odomknutie!",

"pausemenuerror1","The round must be over to save and quit.","Kolo musí byť ukončené, ak chceš odísť a uložiť hru.",
	
"lootdirections","Click to open!","Klikni pre otvorenie!",

"bmdoorprompt","A mysterious door appears...","Objavili sa záhadné dvere...",

"bmdoor_usekey","Use key?","Použiť klúč?",

"perkwarning","Note: Perks are permanent. You cannot sell or get rid of them.","Poznámka: Výhody sú permanetné. Nemôžeš ich predať ani sa ich zbaviť.",
		
"nohighscore","Score: {b}{a}Highscore: {c}","Skóre: {b}{a}Najvyššie Skóre: {c}",
		
"highscore","New Highscore!{a}{b}","Nové najvyššie skóre!{a}{b}",
"nohighscore_challenge","Score: {b}{a}Challenge Highscore: {c}","Skóre: {b}{a}Najvyššie skóre výzvy: {c}",
"supervisor_highscore","Highscore: {a}","Najvyššie skóre: {a}",		
"highscore_challenge","New Challenge Highscore!{a}{b}","Nové najvyššie skóre vo výzve!{a}{b}",
		
"btn_gainslot","+1 item slot!","+1 slot na položky!",

"btn_bm_enter","Enter?","Vstúpiť?",
	
"soldout","Sold out!","Vypredané!",
		
"newgame","New{a}Game!","Nová{a}Hra!",
		
"roundinfo","Round {a}","Úroveň {a}",	

"tut1","Hey. You must be the new employee they were telling me about.","Čau. Ty musíš byť ten nový zamestnanec, o ktorom mi hovorili.",		
"tut2","My name is Tony and I'm gonna be your supervisor.","Moje meno je Tony a budem tvojim dozorcom.",		
"tut3","My job is to show you how to run the factory.","Mojou úlohou je ti ukázať ako pracovať s továrňou.",	
"tut4","I don't really care about your name or anything so let's just get into this.","Je mi jedno ako sa voláš alebo kto si, takže poďme rovno na to.",		
"tut5","First things first, welcome aboard to Nubby's Number Factory - the world's leading number manufacturer!","Predovšetkým vítaj na palube Nubbyho Továrne na Čísla - celosvetový líder vo vytváraní čísel!",		
"tut6","This is the main control center of the factory.","Toto je hlavné ovládacie centrum továrne.",		
"tut7","Your first task is to launch our mascot, Nubby, down the peg board.","Tvojou prvou úlohou je vystreliť nášho maskota "Nubbyho" dole na dosku s kolíkmi.",		
"tut8","Hold down [{a}] and press [{b}] to launch Nubby.","Podrž [{a}] a stlač [{b}] pre vystrelenie Nubbyho.",		
"tut9","Wow, you're really good at this.","Wau, ide ti to riadne dobre.",		
"tut10","At this factory, your only job is to make big numbers...","V tejto továrni je tvojou jedinou úlohou tvoriť velké čísla...",		
"tut11","By launching Nubby at these pegs, you will earn however many points are shown on the peg.","Keď vystrelíš Nubbyho na tieto kolíky, dostaneš body v hodnote čísla na kolíku.",		
"tut12","This number shows how many points you made in a round.","Toto číslo ukazuje kolko bodov si zarobil počas tohto kola.",		
"tut13","The number on the bottom is the goal. If you beat the goal, the board will restock.","To číslo dole je tvoj ciel. Ak prekonáš ciel, doska sa doplní.",		
"tut14","If you get a REALLY high score, the board can restock multiple times in a single round.","Ak dosiahneš NAOZAJ vysoké skóre, doska sa môze doplniť niekolkokrát v jednom kole.",		
"tut15","Oh wait.. I forgot to tell you what a restock even is!","Ach počkať... Zabudol som ti povedať čo vôbec to doplnenie znamená!",		
"tut16","Well listen up, because restocks are an important thing!","Počúvaj ma sem, pretože doplnenia sú doležité!",		
"tut17","When the board restocks, a bunch of NEW pegs will fall from the sky and fill all your empty spaces.","Keď sa doska doplní, niekolko NOVÝCH kolíkov spadne z neba a zaplnia prázdne miesta.",		
"tut18","Soon after, pairs of pegs with the same number will merge into one greater peg.","Krátko potom sa páry kolíkov s rovnakým číslom spoja do jedného väčšieho kolíka.",		
"tut19","Let's try it out. Keep launching Nubby until you beat the goal.{a}[{b}] + [{c}]","Poďme to vyskúšať. Spúšťaj Nubbyho, dokým neprekonáš cielové skóre. {a}[{b}] + [{c}]",		
"tut20","You can do better than that. Do it again.","Zvládneš to aj lepšie. Sprav to znova.",		
"tut21","Pegtacular! That was pegalicious! You're a star!","Ohromné! To bolo cool-ikovité! Si hviezda!",		
"tut22","Just kidding, no you're not.","Robím si srandu, nie si.",	
"tut23","Ok. We're almost done. To rearrange your new pegs, press the jumble button.","Okej, už sme skoro hotoví. Ak chceš preusporiadať kolíky, stlač tlačidlo zamiešania.",		
"tut24","Nice. Launch Nubby one more time [{a}] + [{b}]. I wanna show you something.","Pekne. Vystrel Nubbyho ešte raz [{a}] + [{b}]. Chcem ti ukázať niečo.",		
"tut25","So you might have noticed that Nubby goes through some pegs, but not others.","Mohol si si všimnúť, že Nubby prejde cez niektoré kolíky a cez iné zas nie.",		
"tut26","Nubby will break through 1's, but will bounce off any peg greater than 1.","Nubby zničí kolíky s hodnotou 1, ale od kolíkov s hodnotou vyššiou ako 1 sa odrazí.",		
"tut27","Alright bud, that's it for the tutorial. You'll figure the rest out for yourself.","Dobre kamarát, to je koniec tutoriálu. Ako funguje zvyšok zistíš sám.",		
"tut28","OH! WAIT! WAIT! I FORGOT ONE THING!","JAJ! POČKAJ! POČKAJ! ZABUDOL SOM JEDNU VEC!",		
"tut29","Everytime you launch Nubby, you lose one life. If you run out of lives, the sun will explode.","Vždy keď vystrelíš Nubbyho, stratíš jeden život. Keď ti dojdú životy, Slnko vybuchne.",		
"tut30","But luckily, everytime the board restocks, you get one life back.","Našťastie, vždy keď sa doplní doska, dostaneš jeden život naspäť.",		
"tut31","So as long as you keep making big numbers, nobody gets hurt.","Takže pokial tvoríš velké čísla, si vpohode .",
"tut32","Ok now I'm done. Thanks for not pressing the {a}skip tutorial{a} button. I know that was difficult for you.","Okej, končím. Ďakujem, že si nestlačil {a}Preskočiť Tutoriál{a}. Viem, že to bolo náročné pre teba.",	
"tut33","I'll start you off with a fresh, new factory now. Good luck.","Pripravím ti čerstvú, novú továreň. Vela šťastia.",

"skiptut","Skip Tutorial","Preskočiť Tutoriál",
		
"tutdir","(Click to continue)","(Klikni pre pokračovanie)",
	
"tutdir_getstars","(Click to get stars)","(Klikni pre získanie hviezd)",
	
"pmbtn_settings","Settings","Nastavenia",		
"pmbtn_restart","Restart Game","Reštartovať Hru",
	
"btn_credits","Credits","Titulky",

"translation","Translation{a}{a}","Preklad {a}{a}",

"startdirection","Aim - [{a}]   Launch Nubby [{b}]","Namier - [{a}]   Vystrel Nubbyho [{b}]",

"seizurewarn","This game has the potential to induce seizures{a}with people who have photosensitive epilepsy.","Táto hrá môže spôsobiť epileptické záchvaty{a}u ludí s fotosenzitívnou epilepsiou.",

"warning","WARNING:","UPOZORNENIE:",

