"challenge_wins","Wins: ","Výhry: ",
"supervisor_wins","Wins: ","Výhry: ",

"challenge_highscore","Highscore","Najvyššie skóre",

"challenge_desc_0","*Items in shops are replaced by various mystery boxes.{a}*Mystery boxes give a random item when purchased.","*Položky v obchode sú nahradené krabicami s prekvapením.{a}*Krabica s prekvapením obsahuje náhodnú položku.",
"challenge_desc_1","*You can jumble pegs once PER GAME.{a}*Rerolling items in shops is disabled.","*Kolíky môžeš zamiešať RAZ počas celej hry.{a}*Nemôžeš obnovovať tovar v obchodoch ani v kaviarni.",
"challenge_desc_2","*Maximum coins are capped at 10.{a}*Items that cost more than 10 coins have reduced prices.","*Maximálny počet mincí je znížený na 10.{a}*Položky, ktoré normálne stoja viac ako 10 mincí, majú znížené ceny.",
"challenge_desc_3","*Rare items, foods, and perks cannot be found.","*Nemôžeš získať vzácne položky, jedlo ani perky.",
"challenge_desc_4","*Items will be deleted 15 rounds after they were obtained.{a}*Upgrading items will reset their expiration date.","*Položky budú vymazané 15 kôl po ich získaní.{a}*Vylepšenie položky obnoví jej životnosť.",
"challenge_desc_5","*During restocks, you can only gain +1 life at most - even if you restocked more than once.{a}*You cannot gain lives using any alternative method.","Za doplnenia dosky žískaš maximálne jeden život.{a}*Nemôžeš si doplniť životy žiadnym iným spôsobom.",
"challenge_desc_6","*Failure to meet the quota on any round will result in the left-most item being deleted.","*Keď sa ti nepodarí dosiahnúť cielové skóre, tvoja najviac vlavo uložená položka bude vymazaná.",
"challenge_desc_7","*A C-4 is strapped to Nubby.{a}*Nubby will explode and die after 1.5 seconds, causing a big explosion that pops pegs.","*C-4 výbušnina je pripevnená k Nubbymu.{a}*Nubby vybuchne po 1,5 sekunde, spôsobujúc výbuch, ktorý praskne všetky kolíky.",
"challenge_desc_8","*Perks cannot be obtained.","*Nemôžeš získať perky.",
"challenge_desc_9","*If you start a round with more than 1 item in your inventory, all items will be disabled for the rest of the round.","*Ak začneš kolo s viac ako jednou položkou v inventári, všetky položky budú deaktivované do konca kola.",
"challenge_desc_10","*Collect all 5 letters (N.U.B.B.Y.) by completing trials.{a}*You must beat round 80 to complete.{a}*Difficulty: {b}","*Pozbieraj všetkých 5 písmen (N.U.B.B.Y.).{a}*Písmená získaš za úspech v skúške.{a}*Pre výhru musíš poraziť úroveň 80.{a}*Obtiažnosť: {b}",

"NubbyTrialsAllLocked","Beat at least 5 challenges to unlock!","Poraz aspoň 5 výziev na odomknutie!",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Antimatter{d})","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Zlovestná položka sa zjaví v slote {c}.{a}({d}Antihmota{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Shell Shocked!{c} boss.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Budeš čeliť {c}Ach, Staroba!{c} údalosti.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Items in slots {c} and {d} are destroyed.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Položky v slotoch {c} a {d} budú zničené.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all coins.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Stratíš všetky peniaze.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L1T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All upgraded items are downgraded.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Všetky vylepšené položky sa vrátia na nevylepšené verzie.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Dollhead{d})","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Zlovestná položka sa zjaví v slote {c}.{a}({d}Hlava Bábiky{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All items are destroyed, except for evil items.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Všetky položky, okrem zlovestných, budú zničené",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Psychic Spider{d})","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Zlovestná položka sa zjaví v slote {c}.{a}({d}Jasnovidiaci Pavúk{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Bedrock Bash!{c} boss.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Budeš čeliť {c}Kameňolom!{c} údalosti.", 
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L2T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Maximálny počet životov je nastavený na {c}.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Homunculus{d})","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Zlovestná položka sa zjaví v slote {c}.{a}({d}Homunkulus{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum coins capped at {c}.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Maximálny počet mincí nastavený na {c}.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All rare and ultra-rare items are destroyed.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Všetky vzácne a ultra vzácne položky budú zničené.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Holiday Cheer!{c} boss.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Budeš čeliť {c}Sviatočná Oslava!{c} údalosti.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L3T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}{c}Homunculus{c} turns into {c}Alphamunculus{c} (harder variant).","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}{c}Homunkulus{c} sa premení na {c}Alfamunkulus{c} (ťažšia varianta).",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Broken Figurine{d})","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Zlovestná položka sa zjaví v slote {c}.{a}({d}Rozbitá Figurína{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}.{a}({d}Scary Fingore{d})","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Zlovestná položka sa zjaví v slote {c}.{a}({d}Strašidelné Prstisko{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}I've Been Robbed!{c} boss.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Budeš čeliť {c}Okradli ma!{c} údalosti.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All non-upgraded items are destroyed.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Všetky nevylepšené položky budú zničené",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L4T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Lose all but one life.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Stratíš všetky okrem jedného života.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T1","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Maximum lives capped at {c}.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Maximálny počet životov je nastavený na {c}",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T2","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Rodent Bones{d})","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Zlovestná položka sa zjaví v slote {c}.{a}({d}Kosti Hlodavca{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T3","AT ROUND {b}:{a}An evil item spawns in slot {c}{a}({d}Bottled Tears{d})","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Zlovestná položka sa zjaví v slote {c}.{a}({d}Slzy vo Flaši{d})",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T4","AT ROUND {b}:{a}Face {c}Pessimism!{c} boss.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Budeš čeliť {c}Pesimizmus!{c} údalosti.",
"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_L5T5","AT ROUND {b}:{a}All perks are destroyed.","NA ÚROVNI {b}:{a}Všetky perky budú zničené.",

"NubbyTrials_challenge_desc_complete","All trials complete! Beat the final boss to win!","Všetky skúšky hotové! Poraz posledného bossa, aby si vyhral!",
