"NubbySkinName0","Nubby","Nubby",
"NubbySkinName1","Frog Nubby","Žabací Nubby",
"NubbySkinName2","Blubby","Blubby",
"NubbySkinName3","Cheesy Nubby","Syrový Nubby",
"NubbySkinName4","Clown Nubby","Klaun Nubby",
"NubbySkinName5","Cyborg Nubby","Kyborg Nubby",
"NubbySkinName6","Parasitic Nubby","Parazit Nubby",
"NubbySkinName7","Bisected Nubby","Rozdvojený Nubby",
"NubbySkinName8","Ol Chap Nubby","Nóbl Nubby",
"NubbySkinName9","Party Nubby","Párty Nubby",
"NubbySkinName10","Punk Nubby","Punkáč Nubby",
"NubbySkinName11","Teratoma Nubby","Nubby s Teratómom",
"NubbySkinName12","Baby Face Nubby","Bábätkovský Nubby",
"NubbySkinName13","Goat Nubby","Kozí Nubby",
"NubbySkinName14","Prototype Nubby","Prototyp Nubbyho",
"NubbySkinName15","Tony Fan Nubby","Fanúšik Tonyho Nubby",
"NubbySkinName16","Number Farmer Nubby","Farmár Čísel Nubby",
"NubbySkinName17","Flutty Nubby","Motýliak Nubby",
"NubbySkinName18","Glass Marble Nubby","Sklenená Gulôčka Nubby",
"NubbySkinName19","Star-Employee Nubby","Vyznamenaný Zamestnanec Nubby",
"NubbySkinName20","Car Nubby","Auto Nubby",

"NubbySkinDesc0","Nubby's classic look!","Nubbyho klasický vzhlad!",
"NubbySkinDesc1","This frog nubby was sent to us in the mail one day. We have no idea why this frog resembles nubby.","Táto žaba nám raz prišla do schránky. Nikto nevie prečo sa podobá na Nubbyho.",
"NubbySkinDesc2","An endangered subspecies of nubbies, scientifically known as Nubbicus Aquaticus.","Ohrozený druh Nubbyho, odborne známy ako Nubbicus Aquaticus.",
"NubbySkinDesc3","A failed experiment, resulting from the factory's past attempts to tap into the cheese industry.","Zlyhaný experiment, ktorý vznikol následkom pokusu továrne vtrhnúť do syrového priemysla.",
"NubbySkinDesc4","This nubby stole factory money to follow his dreams at clown college.","Tento Nubby ukradol peniaze z továrne, aby mohol dosiahnúť svoje sny na klaunovskej univerzite.",
"NubbySkinDesc5","This nubby made his own cosplay and thinks he has cyborg strength. Just let the poor guy have a dream...","Tento Nubby si vyrobil vlastný kostým a myslí si, že ma silu kyborga. Nechajte chudáka snívať...",
"NubbySkinDesc6","This nubby is also a parasite in the metaphorical sense too. If he asks, don't lend him any money.","Tento Nubby je parazit aj v metaforickom zmysle. Ak si bude pýtať peniaze, nedávaj mu ani cent.",
"NubbySkinDesc7","In the nubby manufacturing process, things like this happen by accident sometimes.","Počas výrobného procesu niekedy vznikajú veci, ako je táto.",
"NubbySkinDesc8","This nubby finds joy in Victorian Era live action roleplay. He's not hurting anyone so we let it happen.","Tento Nubby má radosť, keď môže predstierať, že je z Viktoriánskej Éry. Nikomu tým neubližuje, tak ho neriešime. ",
"NubbySkinDesc9","We keep this nubby around to celebrate employee birthdays. He's also super good at playing kazoo.","Tohto Nubbyho používame na oslavách narodenín našich zamestnancov. Dokonca vie fantasticky hrať na kazoo.",
"NubbySkinDesc10","Just for kicks, we sometimes make nubbies that can feel emotion. They all end up forming punk bands.","Zo srandy niekedy vytvoríme Nubbyho, ktorý je schopný cítiť emócie. Vždy skončia v nejakej punkovej kapele.",
"NubbySkinDesc11","The result of our attempts at making self replicating nubbies to save money.","Výsledok našich pokusov o zhotovenie samo-klonovacieho Nubbbyho. Chceli sme ušetriť.",
"NubbySkinDesc12","Despite his appearance, this nubby is very mature and sophisticated if you get to know him.","Napriek jeho vzhladu je tento Nubby velmi sofistikovaný a vyspelý.",
"NubbySkinDesc13","Back when the number factory had a petting zoo, this nubby was super popular. Of course, that was before the incident...","Kedysi, keď továreň na čísla mala kontaktnú zoo, bol tento Nubby velmi populárny. To bolo ešte pred tým incidentom...",
"NubbySkinDesc14","One of the very first nubbies we cloned. Made way before we discovered their number harvesting capabilities.","Jeden z prvých naklonovaných Nubbov. Vyrobený dávno predtým, ako sme zistili ich potenciál na vyrábanie čísel.",
"NubbySkinDesc15","Tony thinks it's really funny to brainwash nubbies into thinking he's god.","Tonymu príde vtipné presviedčať Nubbov, že je ich Bohom.",
"NubbySkinDesc16","The PR team requested a {b}wholesome{b} nubby mascot to slap on all of our advertising and merch to overshadow our non-wholesome practices.","PR tím si vyžiadal {b}milého{b} Nubby maskota, ktorého môžu plesnúť na reklamy a tovar, aby prekryli naše nekalé praktiky.",
"NubbySkinDesc17","One year we dressed this nubby up as a butterfly for Halloween. Now we have leave the costume on him because he'll try to bite you if you get near him.","Raz sme prezliekli Nubbyho za motýla na Halloween. Teraz ho nechávame v kostýme, pretože sa pokúša uhryznúť každého, kto sa k nemu priblíži.",
"NubbySkinDesc18","This is just a souvenir that we sell to tourists at the number factory gift shop.","Tohto Nubbyho predávame turistom v obchode so suvenírnmi v našej továrni na čísla",
"NubbySkinDesc19","This Nubby is an official star-employee at the number factory... Just like you!","Tento Nubby je náš oficiálne vyznamenaný zamestnanec v továrni na čísla... Presne ako ty!",
"NubbySkinDesc20","This Nubby angered the car wizard and as punishment he was turned into a car. Despite his curse, he remains joyous.","Tento Nubby naštval autového čarodejníka a bol premenený na auto. Napriek jeho prekliatiu je v živote štastný.",

"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","This skin is a mystery...","Tento vzhlad je záhadou...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","Who knows what this could be...","Kto vie čo by to mohlo byť...",
"NubbySkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","Oooh a mystery nubby...","Uuuuu záhadný Nubby...",

"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 1","Odomkne sa po porazení Skúšky Level 1",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 2","Odomkne sa po porazení Skúšky Level 2",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 3","Odomkne sa po porazení Skúšky Level 3",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_18","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 4","Odomkne sa po porazení Skúšky Level 4",
"NubbySkin_Unlock_Instructions_19","Unlock this by beating Nubby Trials Level 5","Odomkne sa po porazení Skúšky Level 5",

