"ItemSkinDesc0","Transform your seals into dapper gentlemen.","Premení tvojich tuleňov na šarmantných džentlmenov.",
"ItemSkinDesc1","Turn your all-seeing pyramids into poorly drawn ancient artifacts.","Premení tvoje vševidiace pyramídy na chabo načmárané starodávne artefakty.",
"ItemSkinDesc2","Turn your fake plastic trees into fake plastic trees.","Premeň svoje umelé plastové stromy na umelé plastové stromy.",
"ItemSkinDesc3","Turn your kidney beans into kidneys, minus the beans.","Premení tvoje obličkové fazule na obličky bez fazulí.",
"ItemSkinDesc4","Turn your e-blocks into hardened, stone-faced soldiers.","Premení tvoje E-Kocky na drsných bojovníkov s kamenným srdcom.",
"ItemSkinDesc5","Turn your avocados into your friends!","Premeň avokáda na tvojich kamarátov!",
"ItemSkinDesc6","Turn your jeans into jorts!","Premeň svoje džíny na džortky!",
"ItemSkinDesc7","Make your ton of feathers way heavier.","Spraví tvoju tonu peria o dosť ťažšiu.",
"ItemSkinDesc8","Turn your donut into a drawing of a donut.","Premeň svoju realistickú šišku na umelecké prevedenie šišky.",
"ItemSkinDesc9","Fill your mushrooms with compacted C4.","Naplní tvoje huby výbušninami.",
"ItemSkinDesc10","Replace your normal noodles with shorter, tubular noodles that are bent.","Nahradí normálne rezance ohnutými trubicovitými cestovinami.",
"ItemSkinDesc11","Give your mannequin head some style, and a personality too!","Dodaj štýl a personalitu svojej figuríne!",
"ItemSkinDesc12","Turn your mollusk into an extinct mollusk.","Premeň svojho živého mäkkýša na vyhynutého mäkkýša.",
"ItemSkinDesc13","Turn your pedro into pedroooooooooooooooo.","Z Jana sa stane Janooooooooooooooooooooo",
"ItemSkinDesc14","Turn your clay man into a clay man, except this time he's actually made out of clay.","Premení tvojho hlineného muža na hlineného muža z ozajstnej hliny.",
"ItemSkinDesc15","Give poopbutt a timeout in the magic microwave.","Daj hovnoriti prestávku v čarovnej mikrovlnke.",
"ItemSkinDesc16","Release your sea cucumbers into the wild, and then make a handcrafted charm to honor their legacy.","Vypusti svoje morské uhorky do divočiny, a vytvor si talizman na ich pamiatku.",
"ItemSkinDesc17","Turn your fish into a fish on a wall!","Pribi svoju rybu na stenu!",
"ItemSkinDesc18","Turn your squids into the best American carnival food!","Premeň svoje chobotnice na najlepšie americké stánkové jedlo!",

"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version1","A mystery item skin.. what is it?","Záhadný vzhlad položky...",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version2","How mysterious...","Aké záhadné...",
"ItemSkinDesc_Mystery_Version3","I wonder what it is...","Čo by to len mohlo byť...",

"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_15","Unlock this by beating the game at least once with every supervisor.","Odomkne sa, keď vyhráš aspoň jednu hru s každým dozorcom.",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_16","Unlock this by reaching round 300 in endless mode on any supervisor.","Odomkne sa, keď dosiahneš úroveň 300 v nekonečnom móde s lubovolným dozorcom.",
"ItemSkin_Unlock_Instructions_17","Unlock this by beating all challenges, including all nubby trials levels.","Odomkne sa, keď porazíš všetky výzvy vrátane Nubby Skúšok.",

"warehouse_tutorial0","Greetings! The name's Sparkplug.","Zdravím! Volám sa Skrutka.",
"warehouse_tutorial1","You've entered my realm... the warehouse!","Vstúpil si do mojej sféry... do môjho skladu!",
"warehouse_tutorial2","I'm the manager here, sort of. It's complicated...","Som tu manažérom. Asi. Je to zložité...",
"warehouse_tutorial3","Anyways, who cares, am I right? I'm gonna show you around real quick.","Každopádne koho to zaujíma, však? Poď, ukážem ti to tu rýchlo.",
"warehouse_tutorial4","Here we are! The warehouse is where you buy and activate cosmetic nubby skins and item skins.","A sme tu! V sklade si môžeš kúpiť a aplikovať vzhlady na položky a Nubbyho.",
"warehouse_tutorial5","We're currently looking at the nubby skins menu. Press the item skins button to view the item skins menu.","Momentálne sa pozeráme na ponuku Nubby vzhladov. Stlač tlačidlo "Vzhlady položiek" ak chceš vidieť vzhlady položiek.",
"warehouse_tutorial6","This is the menu for buying and activating item skins, but we're going to focus on nubby skins for now.","Toto je menu na kupovanie a aplikovanie vzhladov položiek, ale poďme sa najprv pozrieť na Nubby vzhlady.",
"warehouse_tutorial7","Go back to the nubby skins menu by pressing the nubby skins button.","Chod spať do menu s Nubby vzhladmi stlačením "Nubby vzhlady" tlačidla.",
"warehouse_tutorial8","Use the arrows to page through my collection of cosmetics! Click the arrows a couple times and we'll move on.","Ak si chceš popozerať vzhlady, použi šípky na stranách. Klikni na šípku zóparkrát a presunieme sa.",
"warehouse_tutorial9","Good job! Here's 10 free stars as a reward for being so obedient!","Dobrá práca! Tu máš 10 hviezd za tvoju poslušnosť!",
"warehouse_tutorial10","Now, find a nubby skin you can afford and buy it.","Teraz nájdi Nubby vzhlad, ktorý si môžeš dovoliť a kúp si ho.",
"warehouse_tutorial11","Nice. Now hit the green button below to activate it.","Pekne. Teraz stlač to zelené tlačidlo dole a aktivuj si ho.",
"warehouse_tutorial12","You can only activate one nubby skin at a time, but you can activate multiple item skins at once.","Aktívny môžeš mať iba jeden vzhlad na Nubbyho, ale na položky to neplatí.",
"warehouse_tutorial13","Other than that, nubby skins and item skins work the same way.","Okrem toho Nubby vzhlady a vzhlady položiek fungujú rovnako.",
"warehouse_tutorial14","Ok. That's pretty much all I have left to say I think.","Okej. To je viac menej všetko čo som ti chcel povedať.",
"warehouse_tutorial15","You're probably smart and you can figure the rest out for yourself.","Myslím si, že si múdry a sám zvládneš zistiť ako funguje zvyšok.",
"warehouse_tutorial16","I'm not gonna go away though because I don't trust you.","Ale nejdem preč, lebo ti neverím.",
"warehouse_tutorial17","By the way, did I mention that I'm also the official number factory historian?","Inak spomenul som, že som oficiálny historik tejto továrne na čísla?",
"warehouse_tutorial18","If you poke me, I'll tell you a random fact about the number factory. Anyways, have fun!","Keď ma šťuchneš, poviem ti náhodný fakt o továrni na čísla. Každopádne, maj sa dobre!",

"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome1","Yeah, sure. Feel free to barge in unannounced.","Jasné, nasáčkuj sa mi sem kedykolvek bez oznámenia.",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome2","Welcome in! You need to learn to knock, though.","Vítaj! Nauč sa klopať.",
"Sparkplug_Speech_Welcome3","Welcome back! I totally wasn't in the middle of something.","Vítaj späť! Vôbec som nebol uprostred niečoho.",

"SparkplugRandomDialogue0","Nubbies are a species of genetically modified human. They also have DNA from over 300 random mammals, fish, and reptiles.","Nubby je druh geneticky modifikovaného človeka. Obsahujú DNA z viac než 300 náhodných cicavcov, rýb a plazov.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue1","There is no singular nubby. Rather, nubbies are genetically cloned right here at the factory. It's the way we've always done it.","Neexistuje jeden konkrétny Nubby. Sú geneticky klonovaný priamo u nás v továrni. Vždy sme to tak robili.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue2","Not counting the incubation phase of nubby production, the average nubby life span is 6 seconds.","Ak nerátame inkubačnú fázu Nubby produkcie, priemerná doba života Nubbyho je 6 sekúnd.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue3","The nubby production process is a highly guarded secret, we're the only number factory to own the nubby patent.","Proces Nubby produkcie je prísne strážené tajomstvo, sme jediná továreň na čísla, ktorá má patent na Nubbyho.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue4","Other companies in the number industry try to produce numbers ethically without using nubbies. No other company is as successful as us.","Iné továrne produkujú čísla etickými spôsobmi bez použitia Nubbyho.  Preto žiadna továreň nesiaha na náš úspech.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue5","We produce numbers for the whole world to use in their math problems, computations, and calculations. Without numbers, the laws of physics cease to exist.","Produkujeme čísla, ktoré používa celý svet napríklad v matematických problémoch, výpočtoch a kalkuláciach. Bez čísiel by zanikli zákony fyziky.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue6","Years ago, I was hired to help remove asbestos from the warehouse. The other employees mistakenly thought I was a manager here, so I just rolled with it and here we are.","Niekolko rokov dozadu som bol najatý na odstránenie azbestu zo skladu. Zamestnanci si mysleli, že som manažér, tak jedného dňa som sa toho chopil.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue7","The factory pays me based on how many hours I spend in the warehouse, so I moved in and I haven't left in years.","Továreň mi platí na základe počtu hodín, ktoré strávim v sklade, tak som sa sem nasťahoval a už roky som neodišiel.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue8","Sometimes Tony and I listen to music and drive the forklift around to kill time. He's a nice guy once you get to know him.","Niekedy s Tonym zabíjame čas počúvaním hudby a šoférovaním vysokozdvižných vozíkov. Je to milý týpek, keď ho spoznáš viac.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue9","Nobody's met the boss of the number factory. Nobody knows if there even is one. You could fire Tony and he couldn't do anything about it.","Nikto nestretol šéfa továrne. Nikto nevie či vôbec existuje. Mohol by si vyhodiť Tonyho a nič by s tým nemohol spraviť.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue10","A while ago, Tony covered a bunch of nubbies in paint and threw them at my wall. He's a great artist!","Dávnejšie Tony oblial farbou niekolkých Nubbov a šmaril ich o moju stenu. Je výborný umelec!",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue11","We don't even store anything in the warehouse. My only job is to explain what the warehouse is to new employees and drive the forklift.","Popravde prakticky nič nemáme v sklade. Mojou jedinou úlohou je vysvetliť novým zamestnancom čo ten sklad vôbec je zač. A šoférovať vysokozdvižný vozík.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue12","Here at the factory, we don't produce our number pegs - we buy them from the peg factory. they won't tell us what they're made of, so it can't be good.","V našej továrni neprodukujeme kolíky, ale kupujeme ich od kolíkovej továrne. Nechcú nám povedať z čoho sú vyrobené, to neveští nič dobré.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue13","We protect nubbies from themselves and from our rival companies. If they leave the factory grounds, they self destruct.","Chránime Nubbov od seba a od konkurentných tovární. Ak sa dostanú mimo oblasť továrne, podlahnú samo-deštrukcii.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue14","Nubbies usually can't feel emotion, but they all have their own unique personality.","Nubbovia zvyčajne necítia emócie, ale napriek tomu majú svoje unikátne povahy.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue15","If nubbies are kept alive for too long, they slowly turn into cubes. We don't know why.","Ak sú Nubbovia príliš dlho ponechaný na žive, tak sa pomaly menia na kocky. Nevieme prečo.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue16","Tony and I go way back. I don't know if he's shy or something but I've known him for over a decade and I've never seen him take the glasses off.","Tony a ja sa poznáme už nejakú dobu. Poznám ho cez desať rokov a neviem či sa hanbí, ale nikdy som ho nevidel bez jeho okuliarov.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue17","You should really wear a gas mask in here. There's still tons of asbestos everywhere.","Mal by si nosiť plynovú masku keď si tu. Stále je vela azbestu v ovzduší.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue18","Nubbies are the only known creature that can harvest numbers. Their bodies have the exact shape and texture required to harvest numbers.","Nubbovia sú jediné stvorenia, ktoré sú schopné zbierať čísla. Ich telá majú správny tvar a textúru, ktorá je potrebná na zber čísel.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue19","I've overheard talks about the number factory getting into letter production as well. Who knows... letters are in high demand these days.","Prepočul som, že vedenie továrne na čísla by chcelo začať produkovať písmená. Uvidíme... písmená sú v celkom vysokom dopyte v tejto dobe.",
"SparkplugRandomDialogue20","You didn't hear this from me, but I've heard that nubbies taste like grape candy.","Toto si nepočul odo mňa, ale vraj Nubbovia chutia ako hroznové cukríky.",













